msgstr "Стой, стой, стой! Мемерун даст тебе блестяшки! Много-много блестяшек в уплату долга!"

#. ja: ベヒーモス
#. de: Behemoth
#. fr: béhémoth
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The first sightings of these heavily muscled beasts in the mountains of Coerthas coincided with the advent of the Seventh Umbral Era. Scholars believe them to be the spawn of the elder primal Bahamut, and have dubbed the creatures “behemoths.”Aside from their obvious physical traits, much about behemoth behavior and physiology remains shrouded in mystery.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:38:0:0"
msgid "Behemoth"
msgstr "Бегемот"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Behemoth
#. fr: béhémoths
#. column 0: Behemoth
#. column 8: The first sightings of these heavily muscled beasts in the mountains of Coerthas coincided with the advent of the Seventh Umbral Era. Scholars believe them to be the spawn of the elder primal Bahamut, and have dubbed the creatures “behemoths.”Aside from their obvious physical traits, much about behemoth behavior and physiology remains shrouded in mystery.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:38:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 異常に発達した筋肉を有す肉食獣。第七霊災を境に、クルザスの山岳部で目撃情報が相次ぐようになったため、蛮神バハムートの落とし子として「ベヒーモス」と名付けられた。生態については謎も多く、研究が待たれている。
#. de: Die ersten Sichtungen dieser vor Muskeln strotzenden Bestien in den Bergen von Coerthas fielen zeitlich mit dem Hereinbrechen der Siebten Katastrophe zusammen. Gelehrte gehen davon aus, dass es sich bei ihnen um die Brut des Primae Bahamut handelt und haben die Kreaturen daher „Behemoth“ genannt. Abgesehen von ihren offensichtlichen körperlichen Merkmalen ist kaum etwas über ihre Physiologie oder ihre Verhaltensmuster bekannt.
#. fr: Les premiers témoignages de personnes ayant observé ces bêtes à la musculature saillante coïncident avec l'avènement de la 7e ère ombrale. Les érudits pensent d'ailleurs qu'il s'agirait de rejetons du Primordial Bahamut, ce qui leur vaut le nom de “béhémoths”. Mis à part leur apparence physique, le com<shy>por<shy>te<shy>ment et la biologie de ces créatures restent entourés de mystère.
#. column 0: Behemoth
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:38:0:8"
msgid "The first sightings of these heavily muscled beasts in the mountains of Coerthas coincided with the advent of the Seventh Umbral Era. Scholars believe them to be the spawn of the elder primal Bahamut, and have dubbed the creatures “behemoths.”Aside from their obvious physical traits, much about behemoth behavior and physiology remains shrouded in mystery."
msgstr "Первые сообщения о крупных мускулистых зверях в горах Коэртаса появились одновременно с началом Седьмой Умбральной эры. Учёные считают их порождением праймала Бахамута и дали им имя «бегемоты». Несмотря на внушительный облик, об их повадках и физиологии почти ничего не известно."

#. ja: ギルガメッシュ＆エンキドゥ
#. de: Gilgamesch & Enkidu
#. fr: Gilgamesh & Enkidu
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “At long last, we meet again on the battlefield! I daresay Enkidu shall come to enjoy our tussles as much as I.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:39:0:0"
msgid "Gilgamesh & Enkidu"
msgstr "Гильгамеш и Энкиду"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Gilgamesh & Enkidu
#. column 0: Gilgamesh & Enkidu
#. column 8: “At long last, we meet again on the battlefield! I daresay Enkidu shall come to enjoy our tussles as much as I.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:39:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「オレは旅の剣豪……その名も、ギルガメッシュ！」<br>ギルガメッシュ／エンキドゥ
#. de: „Ich bin übrigens Gilgamesch. Ist mir eine Ehre, eure Bekanntschaft zu machen.“
#. fr: “Mon nom est Gilgamesh, au fait. Enchanté<nbsp>! Lui, c'est Enkidu, mon fidèle compagnon. Comme je me sentais seul durant mes voyages, j'ai attrapé ce coq et j'ai teint ses plumes, puis je lui ai donné le nom d'un ancien camarade.”
#. column 0: Gilgamesh & Enkidu
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:39:0:8"
msgid "“At long last, we meet again on the battlefield! I daresay Enkidu shall come to enjoy our tussles as much as I.”"
msgstr "Наконец-то мы снова встретились на поле боя! Уверен, Энкиду наши схватки понравятся не меньше, чем мне."

#. ja: イフリート
#. de: Ifrit
#. fr: Ifrit
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Summoned by the Amalj'aa of sunbaked Paglth'an, the Lord of the Inferno─with molten claws that render metal into bubbling pools of molten ooze, and terrible horns that stretch skyward, ever threatening to brand the heavens above─is feared across the realm for a blazing fury almost as unquenchable as his desire to swell the ranks of his tempered armies.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:40:0:0"
msgid "Ifrit"
msgstr "Ифрит"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Ifrit
#. column 0: Ifrit
#. column 8: Summoned by the Amalj'aa of sunbaked Paglth'an, the Lord of the Inferno─with molten claws that render metal into bubbling pools of molten ooze, and terrible horns that stretch skyward, ever threatening to brand the heavens above─is feared across the realm for a blazing fury almost as unquenchable as his desire to swell the ranks of his tempered armies.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:40:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アマルジャ族が呼び降ろした焔の神。非常に獰猛で猛々しい神として知られる存在で、その息は燃え盛り、その爪は鉄を溶かし、その角は天を焦がす。挑みかかる者は、必ずや「地獄の火炎」で焼かれることになるだろう。
#. de: Ifrit wurde von den Amalj'aa der ausgetrockneten Ebenen von Paglth'an beschworen. Der Gott des Infernos - mit seinen glühenden Klauen, die Metall in zähe brodelnde Flüssigkeit verwandeln, und seinen grässlichen Hörnern, die gen Himmel ragen und dabei drohen, den Himmel zu brandmarken - wird auf der ganzen Welt wegen seines brennenden Zorns gefürchtet, der beinahe ebenso unersättlich ist wie sein schwelendes Verlangen, seine Armeen heranwachsen zu sehen.
#. fr: Primordial révéré par les Amalj'aa, le Seigneur des flammes Ifrit prend généralement la forme d'une créature ardente et terrifiante, dont les griffes incandescentes peuvent faire fondre n'importe quel métal et dont les cornes menacent d'embraser les cieux. Ceux qui ont eu la folie de l'affronter ont fini brûlés par sa furie inextinguible ou ont rejoint les rangs de subjugués qui lui obéissent.
#. column 0: Ifrit
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:40:0:8"
msgid "Summoned by the Amalj'aa of sunbaked Paglth'an, the Lord of the Inferno─with molten claws that render metal into bubbling pools of molten ooze, and terrible horns that stretch skyward, ever threatening to brand the heavens above─is feared across the realm for a blazing fury almost as unquenchable as his desire to swell the ranks of his tempered armies. "
msgstr "Призванный амалджа из выжженного солнцем Пагльт'ана, Владыка Инферно внушает ужас всем вокруг. Его раскалённые когти плавят металл, а страшные рога, устремлённые ввысь, будто грозят опалить небеса. Его ярость не знает угасания — почти как и желание пополнить ряды порабощённого войска."

#. ja: タイタン
#. de: Titan
#. fr: Titan
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Summoned by the kobolds of O'Ghomoro, the Lord of Crags maintains an air of forbearance rarely seen in the realm's other primals. However, should he sense the lives of his loyal acolytes are in peril, he will not hesitate to call upon the very mountains themselves to crush the life from those who would bring them harm.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:41:0:0"
msgid "Titan"
msgstr "Титан"

