#. ja: 「お前さんは、己が手で道を拓く者。道には<br>人が集い……人が集えば、その場所が都となる」<br>賢人：ルイゾワ・ルヴェユール
#. de: „Es ist genug, Silberschwinge. Du wirst diese Welt nun endlich verlassen!“
#. fr: “Vous êtes la lumière qui a guidé et rallié les hommes et les femmes de ce pays. Là où les gens se rassemblent, la vie naît. Et tant qu'il y a de la vie, il y a de l'espoir. Il ne m'en faut pas plus.”
#. column 0: Louisoix Leveilleur
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:60:0:8"
msgid "“Silence, chattering raven. Your wretched wings are broken, and you shall soar no more.”"
msgstr "Молчи, болтливый ворон. Твои жалкие крылья сломаны, и больше тебе не взлететь."

#. ja: バハムート
#. de: Bahamut
#. fr: Bahamut
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Forgotten for millennia, the elder primal Bahamut was finally freed from his celestial prison Dalamud in the 1572nd year of the Sixth Astral Era through the machinations of the Garlean legatus Nael van Darnus. Unfettered at last, the dreadwyrm unleashed an endless rain of fire on the land, the destruction he wrought ushering in a dark age of death and suffering.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:61:0:0"
msgid "Bahamut"
msgstr "Бахамут"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Bahamut
