#. ja: 「できるできないの問題じゃない。<br>やるしかなければ、やるだけだ」<br>伝説の英雄：ライトニング
#. de: „Das ist keine Frage des Könnens. Manche Dinge im Leben tut man einfach.“
#. fr: “Le problème n'est pas de savoir si on <i>peut</i>. Il y a des choses qu'on <i>doit</i> faire, c'est tout.”
#. column 0: Lightning
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:80:0:8"
msgid "“It's not a question of can or can't. There are some things in life you just do.”"
msgstr "«Дело не в том, можешь ты или нет. Иногда просто нужно взять и сделать»."

#. ja: ゲイラキャット
#. de: Geira-Katze
#. fr: gaélichat
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A curious, charming creature with a feline body and the wings of a bat. Some scholars posit that it is a type of beastkin, while others insist that it is a lesser voidsent belonging to the eleventh rung of the hierarchy of twelve. One thing that cannot be denied is that it clearly possesses a keen, mischievous intelligence.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:81:0:0"
msgid "Gaelicat"
msgstr "Гэльская кошка"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Geira-Katzen
#. fr: gaélichats
#. column 0: Gaelicat
#. column 8: A curious, charming creature with a feline body and the wings of a bat. Some scholars posit that it is a type of beastkin, while others insist that it is a lesser voidsent belonging to the eleventh rung of the hierarchy of twelve. One thing that cannot be denied is that it clearly possesses a keen, mischievous intelligence.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:81:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: コウモリのような翼と、猫のような四肢を有する謎めいた存在。百獣綱に属する魔物と考える博物学者がいる一方、一部の妖異学者は第十一位に位置する下級妖異とする説を採っている。どうやら、それなりに知性があるらしい。
#. de: Ein neugieriges, liebenswürdiges Geschöpf mit einem katzenähnlichen Körper und Fledermausflügeln. Die meisten Forscher ordnen es der eorzäischen Fauna zu, aber es gibt solche, die in der Geira-Katze einen Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ten des elften Ranges sehen. Einigkeit besteht darüber, dass die Katze einen scharfen und bösartigen Intellekt besitzt.
#. fr: Une créature mystérieuse dotée d'un corps de félin et d'ailes de chauve-souris. Certains savants avancent qu'elle appartiendrait au règne animal, tandis que d'autres affirment qu'il s'agit d'un démon appartenant au onzième rang de la Hiérarchie du néant. La seule chose qui soit certaine, c'est qu'elle possède une in<shy>tel<shy>li<shy>gence fine et vive, qui lui permet d'agir rapidement.
#. column 0: Gaelicat
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:81:0:8"
msgid "A curious, charming creature with a feline body and the wings of a bat. Some scholars posit that it is a type of beastkin, while others insist that it is a lesser voidsent belonging to the eleventh rung of the hierarchy of twelve. One thing that cannot be denied is that it clearly possesses a keen, mischievous intelligence."
msgstr "Любопытное очаровательное существо с кошачьим телом и крыльями летучей мыши. Одни учёные считают его зверолюдом, другие уверены, что это младший демон из одиннадцатого круга двенадцати. Несомненно одно: оно наделено острым и весьма озорным умом."

#. ja: バヌバヌ
#. de: Vanu Vanu
#. fr: Vanu Vanu
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: An avian beast tribe that makes their home on the floating islands of the Sea of Clouds. Isolated from the world in the years prior to the advent of airship technology, in recent years they have grown wary of those who would encroach upon their homeland.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:82:0:0"
msgid "Vanu Vanu"
msgstr "Вану-вану"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Vanu Vanu
#. fr: Vanu Vanu
#. column 0: Vanu Vanu
#. column 8: An avian beast tribe that makes their home on the floating islands of the Sea of Clouds. Isolated from the world in the years prior to the advent of airship technology, in recent years they have grown wary of those who would encroach upon their homeland.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:82:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アバラシア雲海の浮島に棲まう先住民。長らく隔絶された土地で暮らしてきたためか、他種族との交流を持ったことがほとんどない。近年、飛空艇を得た地上の民が雲海へと進出してきたことを受けて、警戒心を強めているようだ。
#. de: Ein flugfähiger Wilder Stamm, der die schwebenden Inseln des Wolkenmeers sein Zuhause nennt. Bis die Luftschiff-Technologie den Ishgardern den Himmel erschloss, lebten die Vanu von ihnen isoliert, doch jetzt fühlen sie sich mehr und mehr dazu herausgefordert, ihr Revier zu verteidigen.
#. fr: Les Vanu Vanu sont une tribu d'hommes-hiboux qui vit sur les îles flottantes de L'Écume des cieux d'Abalathia. Complètement isolés du reste du monde jusqu'à l'apparition des premiers aéronefs, ils ont récemment pris conscience des menaces qui pèsent sur leur territoire, et ont renforcé leur vigilance à l'égard des visiteurs de la surface.
#. column 0: Vanu Vanu
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:82:0:8"
msgid "An avian beast tribe that makes their home on the floating islands of the Sea of Clouds. Isolated from the world in the years prior to the advent of airship technology, in recent years they have grown wary of those who would encroach upon their homeland."
msgstr "Птичье племя, обитающее на парящих островах Моря облаков. До появления дирижаблей они жили в изоляции от остального мира, а в последние годы стали с опаской относиться к тем, кто вторгается в их владения."

#. ja: グナース
#. de: Gnath
#. fr: Gnathe
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A tribe of insect-like beastmen known to inhabit the southern reaches of the Dravanian forelands. Hunters first and foremost, they burn a sort of incense to defend their homeland from the dragon threat. At the center of Gnath society sits the king-like “Overmind,” its presence allowing its subjects to communicate without need of word or gesture.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:83:0:0"
msgid "Gnath"
msgstr "Гнаты"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Gnath
#. fr: Gnathes
#. column 0: Gnath
#. column 8: A tribe of insect-like beastmen known to inhabit the southern reaches of the Dravanian forelands. Hunters first and foremost, they burn a sort of incense to defend their homeland from the dragon threat. At the center of Gnath society sits the king-like “Overmind,” its presence allowing its subjects to communicate without need of word or gesture.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:83:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 高地ドラヴァニアの南部地域を根拠地とする、昆虫にも似た狩猟民。ドラゴン避けの香煙を焚くことで、自領を護り暮らしてきた。王のような個体を中心に、すべての個体が精神を連結させているため、非常に統率がとれている。
#. de: Die Gnath sind ein insektenartiger Stamm, der die südlichen Bereiche des Dravanischen Vorlands besiedelt. Sie sind geschickte Jäger und halten die Drachen mit einer besonderen Art von Räucherwerk auf Distanz. Die Gnath sind durch einen „Der Verbindende“ genannten Stammesführer dazu in der Lage, sich gedanklich miteinander zu verständigen.
#. fr: Les Gnathes sont une tribu d'hommes-insectes qui vit dans les confins méridionaux de l'Avant-pays dravanien. Chasseurs avant tout, ils ont appris à protéger leur territoire des dragons en faisant brûler des substances résineuses, comme le benjoin. Au centre de leur société se trouve une sorte de roi appelé “l'Éveillé”, un catalyseur qui unit les volontés de ses sujets sans avoir recours à la parole.
#. column 0: Gnath
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:83:0:8"
msgid "A tribe of insect-like beastmen known to inhabit the southern reaches of the Dravanian forelands. Hunters first and foremost, they burn a sort of incense to defend their homeland from the dragon threat. At the center of Gnath society sits the king-like “Overmind,” its presence allowing its subjects to communicate without need of word or gesture."
msgstr "Племя насекомоподобных зверолюдов, обитающих на юге Драванских предгорий. Прежде всего они охотники, и для защиты родных земель от драконов жгут особые благовония. Во главе общества гнатов стоит подобный царю «сверхразум», который позволяет подданным общаться без слов и жестов."

#. ja: 霧隠のユウギリ
#. de: Yugiri Nebelschleicher
#. fr: Yugiri
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “To whom much is given, much is expected...”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:84:0:0"
msgid "Yugiri Mistwalker"
msgstr "Югири Туманная Путница"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Yugiri
#. column 0: Yugiri Mistwalker
#. column 8: “To whom much is given, much is expected...”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:84:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「ドマの忍衆、これより義によって<br>助太刀いたす！」<br>ドマの忍び：霧隠のユウギリ
#. de: „Gerechtigkeit ... wonach die Philosophen aller Völker fragen und worauf die Herrscher aller Länder pochen.“
#. fr: “Nous autres Domiens désirons plus que tout nous venger de l'Empire<nbsp>; et la première étape consiste à réduire leur influence en Éorzéa pour éviter que la tragédie qui a frappé notre pays ne se reproduise.”
#. column 0: Yugiri Mistwalker
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:84:0:8"
msgid "“To whom much is given, much is expected...”"
msgstr "«Кто много получил, с того много и спросится...»"

#. ja: でぶチョコボ
#. de: Chocomoppel
#. fr: gros chocobo
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A chocobo whose insatiable appetite and utter lack of willpower have resulted in a body more fit for a behemoth than a bird. Goblin legend has it this oversized avian is worshipped as a god in the world below, but no compelling evidence has been found to support this myth.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:85:0:0"
msgid "Fat Chocobo"
msgstr "Толстый чокобо"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Chocomoppel
#. fr: gros chocobos
#. column 0: Fat Chocobo
#. column 8: A chocobo whose insatiable appetite and utter lack of willpower have resulted in a body more fit for a behemoth than a bird. Goblin legend has it this oversized avian is worshipped as a god in the world below, but no compelling evidence has been found to support this myth.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:85:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 幼鳥の頃から、ひたすらに暴飲暴食を繰り返した結果、信じがたい巨躯を手にしたチョコボ。ゴブリン族に伝わる民話によれば、地底世界では「神の鳥」として崇められているとか、いないとか……。真相は定かではない。
#. de: Ein Chocobo, dessen unstillbare Fresssucht und Mangel an Selbstwertgefühl ihm einen Körper gaben, der eher dem eines Behemoths als eines Vogels ähnelt. Einer Legende der Goblins zufolge wird dieser beleibte Chocobo in der Unterwelt als Gott verehrt, aber es ist fraglich, ob diese Erzählung überhaupt ein Fünkchen Wahrheit enthält.
#. fr: Un chocobo dont l'appétit insatiable et l'absence totale de volonté ont abouti à un corps qui s'apparente plus à celui d'un béhémoth qu'à celui d'un oiseau. D'après certaines légendes du folklore gobelin, ce volatile surdimensionné serait vénéré comme un dieu dans le monde d'en bas. (Il est à noter, cependant, qu'aucun élément permettant de vérifier la pertinence de ce mythe n'a pu être trouvé.)
#. column 0: Fat Chocobo
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:85:0:8"
msgid "A chocobo whose insatiable appetite and utter lack of willpower have resulted in a body more fit for a behemoth than a bird. Goblin legend has it this oversized avian is worshipped as a god in the world below, but no compelling evidence has been found to support this myth."
msgstr "Ненасытный аппетит и полное отсутствие силы воли сделали из этого чокобо птицу размером с бегемота. Согласно гоблинским легендам, в подземном мире этой громадной птице поклоняются как божеству, но никаких убедительных доказательств этому мифу так и не нашли."

#. ja: グリフィン
#. de: Greif
#. fr: griffon
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The majestic winged creatures inhabit the untamed wilds of Abalathia's Spine. Possessed of unmatched sharpness of vision, a griffin swooping down from the heights to seize its prey in its mighty talons is truly a sight to behold. A symbol of courage and ferocity, the griffin adorns the crest of the fallen nation of Ala Mhigo.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:86:0:0"
msgid "Griffin"
msgstr "Грифон"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Greife
#. fr: griffons
#. column 0: Griffin
#. column 8: The majestic winged creatures inhabit the untamed wilds of Abalathia's Spine. Possessed of unmatched sharpness of vision, a griffin swooping down from the heights to seize its prey in its mighty talons is truly a sight to behold. A symbol of courage and ferocity, the griffin adorns the crest of the fallen nation of Ala Mhigo.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:86:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アバラシア山脈の奥地に棲息する有翼の魔獣。優れた視力で高空から獲物を見つけ、急降下して襲いかかる姿は圧巻。その猛々しい様から、古来より勇猛の象徴とされ、城塞都市「アラミゴ」の紋章の意匠にも選ばれている。
#. de: Diese majestätischen Flugtiere nisten und jagen in der Wildnis von Abalathias Rückgrat. Ihre unübertroffene Sehschärfe erlaubt es ihnen, Beute aus großer Höhe auszumachen und blitzartig aus dem Himmel auf sie herabzustoßen, um sie in ihren kräftigen Krallen davonzutragen. Als Symbol für Mut und Unzähmbarkeit ziert ein Greif das Wappen der gefallenen Nation Ala Mhigo.
#. fr: Une créature ailée majestueuse qui habite dans les étendues sauvages des montagnes d'Abalathia. Dotée d'une acuité visuelle ex<shy>cep<shy>tion<shy>nelle, ce grand volatile traque ses proies depuis les hauteurs et se jette sur elles tel un projectile pour les lacérer à l'aide de ses puissantes serres. Symbole de courage et de férocité, le griffon orne le blason de la nation déchue d'Ala Mhigo.
#. column 0: Griffin
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:86:0:8"
msgid "The majestic winged creatures inhabit the untamed wilds of Abalathia's Spine. Possessed of unmatched sharpness of vision, a griffin swooping down from the heights to seize its prey in its mighty talons is truly a sight to behold. A symbol of courage and ferocity, the griffin adorns the crest of the fallen nation of Ala Mhigo."
msgstr "Эти величественные крылатые создания обитают в диких землях Хребта Абалатии. Зрение у грифонов необычайно острое: зрелище того, как грифон пикирует с высоты и хватает добычу могучими когтями, захватывает дух. Грифон — символ отваги и свирепости; он украшает герб павшего государства Ала Миго."

#. ja: ティオマン
#. de: Tioman
#. fr: Tioman
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A mighty and vengeful dragon who makes her lair in the ghostly peak of Sohm Al. Consort of Nidhogg, one of the seven great wyrms, Tioman is known as the dark dragon among the Ishgardian people by virtue of her scales, which are said to be darker than a starless night.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:87:0:0"
msgid "Tioman"
msgstr "Тиоман"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Tioman
#. fr: Tioman
#. column 0: Tioman
#. column 8: A mighty and vengeful dragon who makes her lair in the ghostly peak of Sohm Al. Consort of Nidhogg, one of the seven great wyrms, Tioman is known as the dark dragon among the Ishgardian people by virtue of her scales, which are said to be darker than a starless night.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:87:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 霊峰「ソーム・アル」の山頂に棲まうとされる大型のドラゴン族。漆黒の鱗を持つことから、イシュガルドの民には「黒竜」の異名で知られ、恐れられる存在である。七大天竜の一翼、邪竜「ニーズヘッグ」の番いと呼ばれることも。
#. de: Ein mächtiger und rachsüchtiger Drache, der seinen Hort auf dem gespenstischen Gipfel von Sohm Al hat. Tioman, von weiblichem Geschlecht, ist die Gemahlin des Hohen Drachen Nidhogg, und den Ishgardern aufgrund der Färbung ihrer Schuppenhaut bekannt als der dunkle Drache, „dunkler als die sternenlose Nacht“.
#. fr: Un dragon puissant et effroyable vivant au sommet de Sohm Al. Fidèle servante de Nidhogg, sa puissance de destruction égale presque celle de son maître. Les Ishgardais la surnomment “Le dragon noir” en raison de ses écailles, prétendument plus sombres qu'une nuit sans étoiles.
#. column 0: Tioman
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:87:0:8"
msgid "A mighty and vengeful dragon who makes her lair in the ghostly peak of Sohm Al. Consort of Nidhogg, one of the seven great wyrms, Tioman is known as the dark dragon among the Ishgardian people by virtue of her scales, which are said to be darker than a starless night."
msgstr "Могущественный и мстительный дракон, обитающий на призрачной вершине Сом Аль. Тиоман — супруга Нидхёгга, одного из семи великих драконов. Из-за чешуи, темнее беззвёздной ночи, жители Ишгарда прозвали её Чёрным драконом."

#. ja: エスティニアン
#. de: Estinien
#. fr: Estinien
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “...But I yearn to spill the blood of a great wyrm, Nidhogg, and only your death will sate my lance.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:88:0:0"
msgid "Estinien"
msgstr "Эстиниен"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Estinien
#. column 0: Estinien
#. column 8: “...But I yearn to spill the blood of a great wyrm, Nidhogg, and only your death will sate my lance.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:88:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「待っていろ、ニーズヘッグ。<br>必ず貴様の息の根を止めてやる……」<br>蒼の竜騎士：エスティニアン
#. de: „Ich bin bereit. Ich erwarte dich, Nidhogg! Sobald du dich zeigst, lösche ich dein Lebenslicht aus!“
#. fr: “Prépare-toi à souffrir, Nidhogg. Bientôt je transpercerai ton cœur de ma lance et je répandrai tes entrailles dans tout le Coerthas<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Estinien
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:88:0:8"
msgid "“...But I yearn to spill the blood of a great wyrm, Nidhogg, and only your death will sate my lance.”"
msgstr "«Жди меня, Нидхёгг. Клянусь, я оборву твою жизнь...»"

#. ja: ルキア
#. de: Lucia goe Junius
#. fr: Lucia
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Those who dwell in the past risk losing sight of their future.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:89:0:0"
msgid "Lucia goe Junius"
msgstr "Люсия Гоэ Юниус"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Lucia
#. column 0: Lucia goe Junius
#. column 8: “Those who dwell in the past risk losing sight of their future.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:89:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「……過去の争いにこだわっていては、未来は<br>見えないからな」<br>神殿騎士団コマンド：ルキア
#. de: „Denn wer ewig der Ver<shy>gangen<shy>heit nachhängt, droht den Blick auf die Zukunft zu verlieren.“
#. fr: “Ceux qui restent obsédés par le passé ne peuvent pas avancer vers l'avenir.”
#. column 0: Lucia goe Junius
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:89:0:8"
msgid "“Those who dwell in the past risk losing sight of their future.”"
msgstr "«...Кто зациклился на распрях прошлого, тот будущего не разглядит»."

#. ja: イゼル
#. de: Ysayle
#. fr: Ysayle
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “We whom gods and men have forsaken shall be the instruments of our own deliverance!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:90:0:0"
msgid "Ysayle"
msgstr "Изейль"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Ysayle
#. column 0: Ysayle
#. column 8: “We whom gods and men have forsaken shall be the instruments of our own deliverance!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:90:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「我らを救い祈るべき神がいないなら、<br>聖女にこそ、この祈りを捧げよう」<br>氷の巫女：イゼル
#. de: „Wir haben keinen Gott, zu dem wir flehen könnten. So müssen wir uns selbst erlösen!“
#. fr: “Imbécile... Comment peux-tu être aussi lucide et aveugle à la fois<nbsp>? Toi, plus que tous les autres, devrais comprendre les souffrances que la guerre inflige... qu'aucun sacrifice n'est trop grand pour maintenir la paix.”
#. column 0: Ysayle
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:90:0:8"
msgid "“We whom gods and men have forsaken shall be the instruments of our own deliverance!”"
msgstr "«Если боги и люди отвернулись от нас, мы сами станем орудием своего спасения!»"

#. ja: ヒルダ
#. de: Hilda
#. fr: Hilda
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “...And what makes you think I have friends in high places?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:91:0:0"
msgid "Hilda"
msgstr "Хильда"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Hilda
#. column 0: Hilda
#. column 8: “...And what makes you think I have friends in high places?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:91:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「噂の英雄サマってのが、アタシたちに何の用<br>なのか、話くらい聞いてやろうじゃないか」<br>抵抗組織のリーダー：ヒルダ
#. de: „Wer von uns ist hier Abschaum, du verlogener Köter?“
#. fr: “C'est que j'ai envie de botter des fesses de nobliaux, moi, et c'est pas tous les jours que j'en ai l'occasion<nbsp>! Vous pouvez compter sur moi et mes hommes pour faire la révolution<nbsp>! Plutôt deux fois qu'une<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Hilda
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:91:0:8"
msgid "“...And what makes you think I have friends in high places?”"
msgstr "«Раз уж сам знаменитый герой явился к нам, так и быть, выслушаю, чего вам от нас надо»."

#. ja: マトーヤ
#. de: Matoya
#. fr: Matoya
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Spare me the hollow pleasantries, boy. I'll wager my remaining good teeth you didn't come to a forgotten corner of Eorzea to flirt with a wrinkly old woman.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:92:0:0"
msgid "Matoya"
msgstr "Матоя"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Matoya
#. column 0: Matoya
#. column 8: “Spare me the hollow pleasantries, boy. I'll wager my remaining good teeth you didn't come to a forgotten corner of Eorzea to flirt with a wrinkly old woman.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:92:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「こんな辺ぴな場所まで、世捨て人を<br>訪ねて来たんだ。どうせ、ろくでもない問題を<br>持ち込む気だろう？」<br>隠者：マトーヤ
#. de: „Schon gut, Junge. Und jetzt mal raus mit der Sprache. Was wollt ihr von einer alten Einsiedlerin wie mir? Ihr seid doch nicht hierher gekommen, nur um zu plaudern, hm?“
#. fr: “Un jour, ton insolence te coûtera ta queue, ma petite Y'shtola. Tu ne pourras pas dire que je ne t'avais pas prévenue.”
#. column 0: Matoya
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:92:0:8"
msgid "“Spare me the hollow pleasantries, boy. I'll wager my remaining good teeth you didn't come to a forgotten corner of Eorzea to flirt with a wrinkly old woman.”"
msgstr "«Не трать время на пустые любезности, парень. Готова поспорить последними зубами: ты явился в этот забытый уголок Эорзеи не затем, чтобы заигрывать со сморщенной старухой»."

#. ja: エドモン・ド・フォルタン
#. de: Graf Edmont Fortemps
#. fr: Edmont de Fortemps
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “As wards of House Fortemps, you shall be afforded every courtesy. My home is your home.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:93:0:0"
msgid "Count Edmont de Fortemps"
msgstr "Граф Эдмон де Фортан"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Edmont de Fortemps
#. column 0: Count Edmont de Fortemps
#. column 8: “As wards of House Fortemps, you shall be afforded every courtesy. My home is your home.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:93:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「歴史ある「フォルタン家」の家名を継ぐ者として、<br>一同、皆さまの来訪を、心より歓迎しますぞ」<br>フォルタン家当主：エドモン・ド・フォルタン
#. de: „Es ist mir eine Ehre, Euch in den Hallen meiner Ahnen begrüßen zu dürfen.“
#. fr: “Lorsque Haurchefant m'a demandé de vous accueillir chez nous, il vous a qualifié<if $gn4>e</if> d'espoir incarné. À l'époque, je me suis dit que ce n'était qu'une envolée lyrique de sa part, mais je me rends compte désormais qu'il décrivait juste la réalité.”
#. column 0: Count Edmont de Fortemps
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:93:0:8"
msgid "“As wards of House Fortemps, you shall be afforded every courtesy. My home is your home.”"
msgstr "«Как наследник славного рода Фортанов, я от всего сердца приветствую вас. Будьте у нас как дома»."

#. ja: ビブロス
#. de: Byblos
#. fr: Byblos
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A forbidding presence that guards the door to the forbidden halls of the Great Gubal Library. Presumed to be a voidsent summoned from the dark realm by Sharlayan magi, it dutifully guards its post as if bound there by some dark covenant.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:94:0:0"
msgid "Byblos"
msgstr "Библос"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Byblos
#. fr: Byblos
#. column 0: Byblos
#. column 8: A forbidding presence that guards the door to the forbidden halls of the Great Gubal Library. Presumed to be a voidsent summoned from the dark realm by Sharlayan magi, it dutifully guards its post as if bound there by some dark covenant.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:94:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: グブラ幻想図書館にて、禁書庫に至る扉を守っていた存在。おそらくシャーレアンの魔道士たちが、異界ヴォイドから召喚した大型妖異であると思われる。盟約によって縛られていたらしく、忠実に守護の役目に就いていた。
#. de: Eine verbotene Phantomgestalt, die die verbotenen Hallen der Großen Gubal-Bibliothek bewacht. Vermutlich ist Byblos ein von den Sharlayanern beschworener Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ter, der durch einen dunklen Zauber für alle Ewigkeit an seinen Dienst gebunden ist.
#. fr: Une créature menaçante qui garde la porte de la section interdite de la Grande bibliothèque de Gubal. Invoquée du néant par des mages sharlayanais, elle continue d'accomplir fidèlement son devoir<nbsp>; cer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment plus par contrainte que par choix...
#. column 0: Byblos
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:94:0:8"
msgid "A forbidding presence that guards the door to the forbidden halls of the Great Gubal Library. Presumed to be a voidsent summoned from the dark realm by Sharlayan magi, it dutifully guards its post as if bound there by some dark covenant."
msgstr "Зловещее существо, охраняющее вход в запретные залы Большой библиотеки Губала. По всей видимости, это демон из тёмного мира, призванный шарлеанскими магами. Он безотказно несёт службу, словно скованный мрачным договором."

#. ja: オルシュファン
#. de: Haurchefant
#. fr: Haurchefant
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “The docility to accept well-nigh impossible commands, the physical talents to carry them out─to a warrior born such as I there are no virtues greater in a steed! I say, be my personal steed!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:95:0:0"
msgid "Haurchefant"
msgstr "Оршефан"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Haurchefant
#. column 0: Haurchefant
#. column 8: “The docility to accept well-nigh impossible commands, the physical talents to carry them out─to a warrior born such as I there are no virtues greater in a steed! I say, be my personal steed!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:95:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「…………イイ……すごくイイぞ……！<br>はぁ、なんてそそる……<br>鍛え上げられた肉体だ……！」<br>フォルタン家の騎士：オルシュファン
#. de: „Meiner Meinung nach kann man sich <if $gn4>keine treuere Gefährtin<else>keinen treueren Gefährten</if> wünschen. Und auch körperlich stellt <if $gn4>sie<else>er</if> jedes Pferd und jeden Chocobo in den Schatten. <if $gn4>Ihre<else>Seine</if> Ausdauer ist geradezu legendär.“
#. fr: “Et puis pourquoi tu ne m'as pas appelé<nbsp>? Je serais allé combattre à tes côtés sans hésiter<nbsp>! La chaleur de nos deux corps luttant côte à côte aurait fait fondre la glace de Manteneige<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Haurchefant
#. column 2: 0
#, aeria-term-model-exception: warrior 98331897256f
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:95:0:8"
msgid "“The docility to accept well-nigh impossible commands, the physical talents to carry them out─to a warrior born such as I there are no virtues greater in a steed! I say, be my personal steed!”"
msgstr "«...Просто восхитительно... До чего же восхитительно!.. Ах, какое тело... Какое тренированное!»"

#. ja: アイメリク
#. de: Aymeric
#. fr: Aymeric
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Upon the souls of they who have sacrificed themselves to pave the way for peace, we will never abandon our cause.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:96:0:0"
msgid "Aymeric"
msgstr "Эймерик"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Aymeric
#. column 0: Aymeric
#. column 8: “Upon the souls of they who have sacrificed themselves to pave the way for peace, we will never abandon our cause.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:96:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「君が、噂の冒険者か。<br>なるほど、英傑の目をしている」<br>神殿騎士団総長：アイメリク
#. de: „Für all jene, die in der Hoffnung auf eine bessere Zukunft starben, und um unserer Freunde Seelen willen werden wir den Frieden erreichen.“
#. fr: “Il y a des personnes qui croient que la foi est un renoncement au libre arbitre, qu'il est uniquement possible de recevoir la grâce de la Conquérante en se dévouant corps et âme à son service. Une telle dévotion peut être utile à un chevalier sur la ligne de front, mais elle l'est cer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment moins pour un meneur d'hommes.”
#. column 0: Aymeric
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:96:0:8"
msgid "“Upon the souls of they who have sacrificed themselves to pave the way for peace, we will never abandon our cause.”"
msgstr "«Ради душ тех, кто пожертвовал собой ради мира, мы никогда не отступимся от своего дела»."

#. ja: ラーヴァナ
#. de: Ravana
#. fr: Ravana
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Wrath of the Colony and the god and savior of the Gnath tribe. A proud warrior and conqueror, Lord Ravana exalts strength and abhors weakness in any form. Believing the rite of combat to be sacred, he revels in battle with worthy opponents while wielding the Chandrahas─legendary blades of moonlight that obey his every command.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:97:0:0"
msgid "Ravana"
msgstr "Равана"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Ravana
#. column 0: Ravana
#. column 8: Wrath of the Colony and the god and savior of the Gnath tribe. A proud warrior and conqueror, Lord Ravana exalts strength and abhors weakness in any form. Believing the rite of combat to be sacred, he revels in battle with worthy opponents while wielding the Chandrahas─legendary blades of moonlight that obey his every command.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:97:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: グナース族が呼び降ろした武の神。武を誇り、勇を好む、猛々しくも誇り高き神であり、その気質は豪放。戦いを神聖なものと捉え、変幻自在の月光剣「チャンドラハース」を手に悠然と決闘に臨む。
#. de: Gott und Erlöser des Stammes der Gnath. Der Primae Ravana erscheint als Krieger und Eroberer, predigt Stärke und verabscheut jegliche Art von Schwäche. Er zelebriert die Heiligkeit des Kampfes und bezwingt würdige Gegner mit seinen tödlichen Mondlicht-Klingen, den legendären Chandrahas.
#. fr: Surnommé “le Maître des lames”, Ravana est la divinité protectrice des Gnathes. Seigneur du combat et de la guerre, le Primordial respecte la force et abhorre toute forme de faiblesse. Croyant que le rituel de combat est sacré, il se complaît dans la bataille avec des adversaires dignes, brandissant ses épées légendaires<nbsp>: les Chandrahas.
#. column 0: Ravana
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:97:0:8"
msgid "Wrath of the Colony and the god and savior of the Gnath tribe. A proud warrior and conqueror, Lord Ravana exalts strength and abhors weakness in any form. Believing the rite of combat to be sacred, he revels in battle with worthy opponents while wielding the Chandrahas─legendary blades of moonlight that obey his every command."
msgstr "Гнев племени и бог-спаситель гнатов. Гордый воин и завоеватель, владыка Равана превозносит силу и презирает слабость в любом её проявлении. Он чтит священный ритуал боя и с наслаждением сражается с достойными противниками, орудуя Чандрахасами — легендарными клинками лунного света, подвластными одному лишь ему."

#. ja: ビスマルク
#. de: Bismarck
#. fr: Bismarck
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Long thought to be little more than myth, the Lord of the Mists was summoned forth and given form by the fervent prayers of the Vanu Vanu, who worship him as the god that led their ancestors to their island home. With a flood-blast of water from his great blowhole, the great white whale purges the skies of those who would do his followers harm.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:98:0:0"
msgid "Bismarck"
msgstr "Бисмарк"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Bismarck
#. column 0: Bismarck
#. column 8: Long thought to be little more than myth, the Lord of the Mists was summoned forth and given form by the fervent prayers of the Vanu Vanu, who worship him as the god that led their ancestors to their island home. With a flood-blast of water from his great blowhole, the great white whale purges the skies of those who would do his followers harm.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:98:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: バヌバヌ族が呼び降ろした雲の神。雲海を遊弋する伝説の白鯨として、人々の間にも伝承が伝わる存在である。一方、バヌバヌ族の神話では祖先を浮島に導いた神とされ、「バブルブロウ」で悪を押し流すと語り継がれてきたようだ。
#. de: Der Herr der Wolken wurde lange dem Reich der Legenden zugeschrieben, bis er durch die rasenden Anrufungen der Vanu Gestalt erhielt. Sie glauben, dass er einst ihre Vorfahren zu den schwebenden Inseln führte und sie ihnen als Zuhause gab. Der Primae in Gestalt eines großen weißen Wals beschützt seine Jünger und reißt mit einem sintflutartigen Wasserschwall aus seinem Blasloch all diejenigen vom Himmel, die ihnen feindselig gesinnt sind.
#. fr: Longtemps considéré comme une légende par les humains, le Migrateur des brumes est apparu en Éorzéa en réponse aux ferventes prières des Vanu Vanu. Les hommes-hiboux vénèrent cette grande baleine blanche comme un dieu, convaincus qu'elle aurait conduit leurs ancêtres sur leur île natale. Grâce à son évent, elle crache de puissants jets d'eau afin d'épurer les cieux des dangers qui menacent ses adorateurs.
#. column 0: Bismarck
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:98:0:8"
msgid "Long thought to be little more than myth, the Lord of the Mists was summoned forth and given form by the fervent prayers of the Vanu Vanu, who worship him as the god that led their ancestors to their island home. With a flood-blast of water from his great blowhole, the great white whale purges the skies of those who would do his followers harm."
msgstr "Долгое время Повелителя туманов считали не более чем мифом, пока пламенные молитвы вану-вану не призвали его и не придали ему форму. Они почитают его как бога, приведшего их предков на острова. Великий белый кит извергает из дыхала потоки воды и очищает небеса от тех, кто угрожает его последователям."

#. ja: ニーズヘッグ
#. de: Nidhogg
#. fr: Nidhogg
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: One of the seven great wyrms sired by Midgardsormr, Father of Dragons. Leader of the Dravanian Horde, Nidhogg and his minions have tormented the Holy See for a thousand years in the bloody conflict that has come to be known as the Dragonsong War. The sound of his cry piercing the heavens can strike fear into the heart of the bravest of knights.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:99:0:0"
msgid "Nidhogg"
msgstr "Нидхёгг"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Nidhogg
#. column 0: Nidhogg
#. column 8: One of the seven great wyrms sired by Midgardsormr, Father of Dragons. Leader of the Dravanian Horde, Nidhogg and his minions have tormented the Holy See for a thousand years in the bloody conflict that has come to be known as the Dragonsong War. The sound of his cry piercing the heavens can strike fear into the heart of the bravest of knights.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:99:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 幻龍ミドガルズオルムの七つの卵から孵った、七大天竜の一翼。千年以上に渡り続いてきた「竜詩戦争」において、ドラゴン族を率いてきた。これと対するイシュガルドの民にとっては、憎悪と恐怖の対象となっている。
#. de: Einer der sieben Hohen Drachen, die Midgardsormr, Urvater aller Drachen, einst zeugte. Nidhogg führt die dravanische Drachenbrut an und überzieht seit 1000 Jahren Ishgard mit einem blutigen Krieg. Sein Gebrüll spaltet den Himmel und die Herzen selbst der mutigsten Tempelritter.
#. fr: L'un des sept grands dragons engendrés par Midgardsormr. Nidhogg et ses sbires dravaniens ont tourmenté le Saint-Siège pendant plus de mille ans dans le conflit sanglant que l'Histoire appelera la “Guerre du chant des dragons”. Le retentissement de son cri déchirant les cieux est capable de semer la peur dans le cœur des plus braves chevaliers.
#. column 0: Nidhogg
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:99:0:8"
msgid "One of the seven great wyrms sired by Midgardsormr, Father of Dragons. Leader of the Dravanian Horde, Nidhogg and his minions have tormented the Holy See for a thousand years in the bloody conflict that has come to be known as the Dragonsong War. The sound of his cry piercing the heavens can strike fear into the heart of the bravest of knights."
msgstr "Один из семи великих драконов, порождённых Мидгардсормом, Отцом драконов. Нидхёгг возглавляет драконью орду Дравании и уже тысячу лет терзает Святой престол в кровавой войне, вошедшей в историю как Драконья песнь. Его крик пронзает небеса и способен вселить страх в сердце самого храброго рыцаря."

#. ja: ミドガルズオルム
#. de: Midgardsormr
#. fr: Midgardsormr
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Thou hast forgotten the face of thy lord. Remember, mortal, and fear me.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:100:0:0"
msgid "Midgardsormr"
msgstr "Мидгардсормр"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Midgardsormr
#. column 0: Midgardsormr
#. column 8: “Thou hast forgotten the face of thy lord. Remember, mortal, and fear me.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:100:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「無知なる者よ、わきまえるがよい。<br>我こそはミドガルズオルム…… 原初の龍なるぞ！」<br>幻龍ミドガルズオルム
#. de: „Du hast das Antlitz des ersten Hüters vergessen, Einfältiger. Erinnere dich - und erbebe vor mir!“
#. fr: “Les humains meurent et leurs descendants oublient, mais nous sommes éternels. Pour nous, le passé et le présent ne font qu'un.”
#. column 0: Midgardsormr
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:100:0:8"
msgid "“Thou hast forgotten the face of thy lord. Remember, mortal, and fear me.”"
msgstr "«Невежда, знай своё место. Я — Мидгардсормр... Первозданный дракон!»"

#. ja: ディープアイ
#. de: Glotzauge
#. fr: oculus
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Possessed of one grotesquely huge eye, the otherwise diminutive deepeye is thought to manifest upon the physical plane by investing its essence exclusively in the ocular organs of beings that perished with their eyes wide open. Though scholars agree that it belongs on the lower rungs of the hierarchy of twelve, this voidsent's acute vision and arcane prowess constitute a respectable threat.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:101:0:0"
msgid "Deepeye"
msgstr "Глазастик"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Glotzaugen
#. fr: oculi
#. column 0: Deepeye
#. column 8: Possessed of one grotesquely huge eye, the otherwise diminutive deepeye is thought to manifest upon the physical plane by investing its essence exclusively in the ocular organs of beings that perished with their eyes wide open. Though scholars agree that it belongs on the lower rungs of the hierarchy of twelve, this voidsent's acute vision and arcane prowess constitute a respectable threat.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:101:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 巨大な眼球を有する小型妖異。一般に、目を見開いたまま死した生物の眼球を依り代として、発生するとされている。妖異学者の分類によれば、第十二位に位置する下級の存在だが、その眼力と魔力は決して侮れない。
#. de: Die Erscheinung des auf den ersten Blick weniger furcht<shy>er<shy>re<shy>gen<shy>den Glotzauges wird von seinem einzelnen roten Sehorgan beherrscht. Forscher vermuten, dass dieser Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>te sich auf der physischen Ebene manifestiert, indem er seine Essenz aus<shy>schließ<shy>lich in Opfer schleust, die mit weit aufgerissenen Augen den Tod gefunden haben. Obgleich von niederem Rang in der Hierarchie der Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ten, stellt das Glotzauge wegen seiner außer<shy>ordent<shy>lich scharfen Sicht und arkanen Macht eine ernst zu nehmende Bedrohung dar.
#. fr: Doté d'un énorme œil globuleux et de membres minuscules, l'oculus se manifeste dans le monde physique en investissant de son essence les organes oculaires des humains morts les yeux ouverts. Bien que les érudits s'accordent pour dire qu'il appartient à un rang peu élevé dans la Hiérarchie du néant, son acuité visuelle et son pouvoir arcanique font de lui une menace à ne pas négliger.
#. column 0: Deepeye
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:101:0:8"
msgid "Possessed of one grotesquely huge eye, the otherwise diminutive deepeye is thought to manifest upon the physical plane by investing its essence exclusively in the ocular organs of beings that perished with their eyes wide open. Though scholars agree that it belongs on the lower rungs of the hierarchy of twelve, this voidsent's acute vision and arcane prowess constitute a respectable threat."
msgstr "У этого крошечного низшего демона — один огромный, уродливый глаз. Считается, что он вселяется в глаза существ, умерших с широко раскрытыми глазами, и так является в физическом мире. Учёные относят его к низшим ступеням иерархии двенадцати, однако его острое зрение и магическое могущество делают его опасным противником."

#. ja: アルケオーニス
#. de: Archaeornis
#. fr: archéornis
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: These large, feathered beasts are primarily found in the northern reaches of Aldenard, and are often seen under the sway of the more powerful dragons. Long thought to belong to the cloudkin family, recent studies claim that the archaeornis are, in fact, descended from an ancient species of scalekin.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:102:0:0"
msgid "Archaeornis"
msgstr "Археорнис"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Archaeornis
#. fr: archéornis
#. column 0: Archaeornis
#. column 8: These large, feathered beasts are primarily found in the northern reaches of Aldenard, and are often seen under the sway of the more powerful dragons. Long thought to belong to the cloudkin family, recent studies claim that the archaeornis are, in fact, descended from an ancient species of scalekin.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:102:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アルデナード小大陸北部に棲息する有翼獣。長らく鳥類と同様に有翼綱に分類されてきたが、近年では古代種の血を引く甲鱗綱とする学説が有力視されている。しばしば、ドラゴン族により操られ、眷属化することがあるようだ。
#. de: Diese großen, gefiederten Untiere siedeln bevorzugt in den nördlichen Regionen von Aldenard und werden häufig in der Obhut von größeren Drachen gesichtet. Obwohl man sie vorerst dem Stamm der flugfähigen Wolkenbewohner zurechnete, wird ihre Nähe zu den Drachen nun allgemein auf eine Abstammung mit landgängigen Reptilien zurückgeführt.
#. fr: Cette imposante créature à plumes vit prin<shy>ci<shy>pa<shy>le<shy>ment dans la partie nord du continent d'Aldenard, souvent soumise à l'autorité des dragons les plus puissants. Bien qu'on ait longtemps pensé que l'archéornis appartienne à la famille des oiseaux, il descendrait en fait d'une ancienne espèce de reptile.
#. column 0: Archaeornis
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:102:0:8"
msgid "These large, feathered beasts are primarily found in the northern reaches of Aldenard, and are often seen under the sway of the more powerful dragons. Long thought to belong to the cloudkin family, recent studies claim that the archaeornis are, in fact, descended from an ancient species of scalekin."
msgstr "Эти крупные пернатые звери обитают преимущественно на севере Алденарда и нередко попадают под власть могучих драконов. Долгое время их относили к облачным, но последние исследования показывают, что археорнисы произошли от древнего вида чешуйчатых."

#. ja: パイッサ
#. de: Paissa
#. fr: païssa
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Discovered on the floating islands of the Sea of Clouds, paissas are mischievous, fur-covered beastkin with barrel-like bodies and saucer-sized eyes. There is a theory gaining popularity among naturalists that the paissa is closely related to the opo-opo; the Vanu, however, are content to simply classify these creatures as incarnations of pure idiocy.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:103:0:0"
msgid "Paissa"
msgstr "Пайсса"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Paissas
#. fr: païssas
#. column 0: Paissa
#. column 8: Discovered on the floating islands of the Sea of Clouds, paissas are mischievous, fur-covered beastkin with barrel-like bodies and saucer-sized eyes. There is a theory gaining popularity among naturalists that the paissa is closely related to the opo-opo; the Vanu, however, are content to simply classify these creatures as incarnations of pure idiocy.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:103:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アバラシア雲海にて発見された、樽型の身体と大きな目を持つ謎めいた生物。博物学者の間では、オポオポなどの猿に近い存在だとする説が有力視されている。なお、バヌバヌ族は、パイッサを愚か者の象徴と考えているようだ。
#. de: Paissas sind böswillige, felltragende Kreaturen und auf den schwebenden Inseln des Wolkenmeeres beheimatet. Ihre fassförmigen Körper und handtellergroßen Augen legen die Vermutung nahe, dass sie mit den Opo-Opo verwandt sind. Die Vanu hingegen sehen in ihnen lediglich die Verkörperung größtmöglicher Einfältigkeit.
#. fr: Découvert sur les îles flottantes de la Mer de nuages, le païssa est un mammifère espiègle caractérisé par son corps allongé recouvert d'une épaisse fourrure et ses grands yeux ronds. Une théorie en vogue chez les naturalistes tend à identifier le païssa comme un proche cousin de l'opo-opo, alors que pour les Vanu Vanu il représente simplement l'idiotie incarnée.
#. column 0: Paissa
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:103:0:8"
msgid "Discovered on the floating islands of the Sea of Clouds, paissas are mischievous, fur-covered beastkin with barrel-like bodies and saucer-sized eyes. There is a theory gaining popularity among naturalists that the paissa is closely related to the opo-opo; the Vanu, however, are content to simply classify these creatures as incarnations of pure idiocy."
msgstr "Пайссы — покрытые шерстью проказливые зверолюди с бочкообразным туловищем и огромными, с блюдце, глазами. Их обнаружили на парящих островах Моря облаков. Натуралисты всё чаще считают, что пайссы состоят в близком родстве с опо-опо. Вану же просто считают их воплощением глупости."

#. ja: ダルメル
#. de: Dhalmel
#. fr: dhalmel
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Dhalmels are herbivorous beastkin that inhabit the Sea of Clouds. It is thought that their characteristically long necks developed from a need to reach the leaves of trees growing on neighboring islands. Perhaps due to the scarcity of foliage found on the floating landmasses, dhalmels exhibit excessive aggression towards any creature that intrudes upon their territory.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:104:0:0"
msgid "Dhalmel"
msgstr "Далмель"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Dhalmele
#. fr: dhalmels
#. column 0: Dhalmel
#. column 8: Dhalmels are herbivorous beastkin that inhabit the Sea of Clouds. It is thought that their characteristically long necks developed from a need to reach the leaves of trees growing on neighboring islands. Perhaps due to the scarcity of foliage found on the floating landmasses, dhalmels exhibit excessive aggression towards any creature that intrudes upon their territory.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:104:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アバラシア雲海の浮島に棲息する百獣綱の草食獣。特徴的な長い首は、隣接する浮島の樹木を食すために発達したものではないかと考えられている。なお、樹木が少ない浮島で生きるためか、縄張りを侵す者には過敏に反応する。
#. de: Die pflanzenfressenden Dhalmel sind aggressive Bewohner des Wolkenmeers. Ihre langen Hälse haben sich angeblich aus der Notwendigkeit entwickelt, Blätter von Bäumen auf benachbarten schwebenden Inseln zu erreichen. Der Mangel an dichtem Blätterwerk auf den schwebenden Landmassen ist der vermutete Grund für die aggressive Territorialität, welche diese Kreaturen allen Eindringlingen gegenüber an den Tag legen.
#. fr: Le dhalmel est un mammifère herbivore habitant L'Écume des cieux d'Abalathia. On pense que son long cou ca<shy>rac<shy>té<shy>ris<shy>ti<shy>que s'est développé par besoin d'atteindre les feuilles des arbres des îles voisines. C'est cer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment la relative rareté du feuillage dans la région qui pousse le dhalmel à se montrer agressif envers toute créature s'introduisant sur son territoire.
#. column 0: Dhalmel
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:104:0:8"
msgid "Dhalmels are herbivorous beastkin that inhabit the Sea of Clouds. It is thought that their characteristically long necks developed from a need to reach the leaves of trees growing on neighboring islands. Perhaps due to the scarcity of foliage found on the floating landmasses, dhalmels exhibit excessive aggression towards any creature that intrudes upon their territory."
msgstr "Далмели — травоядные зверолюди, обитающие в Море облаков. Считается, что их длинные шеи развились, чтобы доставать листья с деревьев на соседних островах. Возможно, из-за нехватки зелени на парящих островах далмели яростно защищают свою территорию от любых чужаков."

#. ja: バンダースナッチ
#. de: Bandersnatch
#. fr: bandersnatch
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A forest-dwelling beastkin, the bandersnatch is a vicious hunter that employs long, curved fangs to rend the flesh of its prey. Though it feeds predominantly on chocobos and other forest creatures, this frenzied carnivore has been known to launch itself at dragons when lost in the throes of uncontrollable bloodlust.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:105:0:0"
msgid "Bandersnatch"
msgstr "Бандерснатч"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Bandersnatch
#. fr: bandersnatchs
#. column 0: Bandersnatch
#. column 8: A forest-dwelling beastkin, the bandersnatch is a vicious hunter that employs long, curved fangs to rend the flesh of its prey. Though it feeds predominantly on chocobos and other forest creatures, this frenzied carnivore has been known to launch itself at dragons when lost in the throes of uncontrollable bloodlust.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:105:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 森林地帯に棲息する百獣綱の肉食獣。チョコボなどの獣を狩る優秀な狩人で、曲刀のような牙で、やすやすと獲物の肉を切り裂く。非常に獰猛な存在で、怒り狂うと見境がなくなり、ドラゴン族に襲いかかることさえある。
#. de: Der legendäre Bandersnatch ist ein gefürchteter Jäger, der seine be<shy>mit<shy>leidens<shy>werte Beute mithilfe seiner langen, gekrümmten Krallen schlägt. Obwohl er sich hauptsächlich von Chocobos und anderen Waldbewohnern ernährt, wurde der Bandersnatch schon dabei beobachtet, wie er sich in seinem unkontrollierbaren Blutrausch sogar Drachenbrut an die Gurgel wirft.
#. fr: Mammifère habitant des forêts, le bandersnatch est un prédateur brutal qui se sert de ses longs crocs incurvés pour arracher la chair de ses proies. Bien qu'il se nourrisse prin<shy>ci<shy>pa<shy>le<shy>ment de chocobos et d'autres créatures forestières, il lui arrive parfois de s'abandonner à une in<shy>con<shy>trô<shy>la<shy>ble soif de sang et de s'attaquer à des dragons bien plus imposants que lui.
#. column 0: Bandersnatch
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:105:0:8"
msgid "A forest-dwelling beastkin, the bandersnatch is a vicious hunter that employs long, curved fangs to rend the flesh of its prey. Though it feeds predominantly on chocobos and other forest creatures, this frenzied carnivore has been known to launch itself at dragons when lost in the throes of uncontrollable bloodlust."
msgstr "Лесной зверь и свирепый охотник, бандерснатч раздирает добычу длинными изогнутыми клыками. Обычно он охотится на чокобо и других лесных обитателей, но в припадке неудержимой кровожадности может броситься даже на дракона."

#. ja: クロウラー
#. de: Kriecher
#. fr: chenille
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: This corpulent vilekin infests the Dravanian hinterlands, its distinctive black and yellow coloring warning potential predators of its toxic nature. Curious gourmands beware: consuming a crawler's flesh without the proper preparation invariably results in excruciating abdominal pain.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:106:0:0"
msgid "Crawler"
msgstr "Гусеница"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Kriecher
#. fr: chenilles
#. column 0: Crawler
#. column 8: This corpulent vilekin infests the Dravanian hinterlands, its distinctive black and yellow coloring warning potential predators of its toxic nature. Curious gourmands beware: consuming a crawler's flesh without the proper preparation invariably results in excruciating abdominal pain.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:106:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 低地ドラヴァニアなどに棲息する大型の百蟲綱。黄色と黒の目立つ体表は、一種の警戒色であり有毒生物であることを示す。その肉を食べることもできるが、適切な処理を行わないと、激しい腹痛を起こすことになる。
#. de: Dieses Insekt hat große Teile des Dravanischen Hinterlands befallen, und seine schwarz-gelbe Färbung ist potenziellen Angreifern ein deutlicher Hinweis auf seine enorme Giftigkeit. Wer bei der Zubereitung eines Kriechers nicht die allerhöchste Sorgfalt anwendet, wird sich einem wochenlangen heftigen Jucken der Kopfhaut gepaart mit einer Hypersensibilisierung der Fingernägel ausgesetzt sehen.
#. fr: Cet insecte corpulent pullule dans l'Arrière-pays dravanien, sa coloration noire et jaune facilement reconnaissable mettant en garde ses prédateurs éventuels contre sa nature venimeuse. Les gourmands curieux sont prévenus<nbsp>: consommer une chenille sans préparation spécifique engendrera assurément des douleurs abdominales aiguës.
#. column 0: Crawler
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:106:0:8"
msgid "This corpulent vilekin infests the Dravanian hinterlands, its distinctive black and yellow coloring warning potential predators of its toxic nature. Curious gourmands beware: consuming a crawler's flesh without the proper preparation invariably results in excruciating abdominal pain."
msgstr "Эти тучные насекомые заполонили Драванские низины. Их характерная жёлто-чёрная окраска предупреждает хищников об их ядовитой природе. Любопытным гурманам стоит быть осторожнее: без должной подготовки мясо гусеницы неизменно вызывает мучительную боль в животе."

#. ja: ポロッゴ
#. de: Poroggo
#. fr: poroggo
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Poroggos were once lowly toads, transformed into creatures of speech and reason through the magicks of Sharlayan mages. Their intelligence is such that they can even be taught to cast spells. Should poroggos be isolated from other sentient beings, however, their minds gradually regress into a feral state.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:107:0:0"
msgid "Poroggo"
msgstr "Порогго"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Poroggos
#. fr: poroggos
#. column 0: Poroggo
#. column 8: Poroggos were once lowly toads, transformed into creatures of speech and reason through the magicks of Sharlayan mages. Their intelligence is such that they can even be taught to cast spells. Should poroggos be isolated from other sentient beings, however, their minds gradually regress into a feral state.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:107:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: シャーレアンの魔道士たちが、トードに魔法をかけて創り出した使い魔。人と会話できるほどの知性を持ち、魔法すら使いこなすことが可能だ。しかし、人との接触がなくなると徐々に理性を失い、野生化してしまうという。
#. de: Poroggos, einst niedere Krötentiere, wurden durch die Magie der Sharlayaner mit Intelligenz und Sprechvermögen ausgestattet. Sie haben sogar die Gabe, einfache Zaubersprüche zu wirken. Isoliert von anderen empfindungsfähigen Lebewesen degenerieren ihre geistigen Fä<shy>hig<shy>kei<shy>ten jedoch langsam, aber sicher wieder auf Krötenniveau.
#. fr: Le poroggo était autrefois un simple crapaud, depuis transformé en une créature douée de raison et de parole grâce à la magie des sages sharlayanais. Son in<shy>tel<shy>li<shy>gence est telle qu'il est même capable d'apprendre des sorts. En revanche, si le poroggo est isolé d'autres créatures sensibles pendant une longue durée, son esprit régresse progressivement jusqu'à son état sauvage.
#. column 0: Poroggo
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:107:0:8"
msgid "Poroggos were once lowly toads, transformed into creatures of speech and reason through the magicks of Sharlayan mages. Their intelligence is such that they can even be taught to cast spells. Should poroggos be isolated from other sentient beings, however, their minds gradually regress into a feral state."
msgstr "Когда-то порогго были обычными жабами, но маги Шарлея чарами наделили их речью и разумом. Они настолько умны, что способны обучаться заклинаниям. Однако, если порогго надолго останется без общества разумных существ, его рассудок постепенно угаснет, и он одичает."

#. ja: ヴェズルフェルニル
#. de: Vedrfölnir
#. fr: Vedrfolnir
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Sired by the great wyrm Hraesvelgr, Vedrfolnir's fiercely aggressive demeanor sets him apart from his tranquil broodmates. This mighty dragon revels in the glory of combat, and has fostered a deadly rivalry with Darkscale, a general in Nidhogg's Horde.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:108:0:0"
msgid "Vedrfolnir"
msgstr "Ведрфёльнир"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Vedrfolnir
#. column 0: Vedrfolnir
#. column 8: Sired by the great wyrm Hraesvelgr, Vedrfolnir's fiercely aggressive demeanor sets him apart from his tranquil broodmates. This mighty dragon revels in the glory of combat, and has fostered a deadly rivalry with Darkscale, a general in Nidhogg's Horde.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:108:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 聖竜フレースヴェルグの血を引く高位のドラゴン族。静寂を好む者が多い聖竜の眷属としては珍しく、力と力のぶつかり合いを好む、猛々しい性格の持ち主。白亜の宮殿を狙う、闇竜ダークスケールとは好敵手の間柄のようだ。
#. de: Vedrfölnir, Abkömmling des Hohen Drachen Hraesvelgr, unterscheidet sich durch sein aggressives, dominantes Verhalten von seinen friedvollen Blutsbrüdern. Der mächtige Drache weidet sich an der Herrlichkeit des Kampfes und hegt eine hitzige Rivalität mit Dunkelschuppe, einem General in Nidhoggs Horde.
#. fr: Engendré par l'illustre Hraesvelgr, Vedrfolnir se démarque de ses tranquilles congénères par son com<shy>por<shy>te<shy>ment agressif. Ce terrible dragon se délecte de combats périlleux et entretient une intense rivalité avec Sombrécaille, un des généraux de la horde de Nidhogg.
#. column 0: Vedrfolnir
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:108:0:8"
msgid "Sired by the great wyrm Hraesvelgr, Vedrfolnir's fiercely aggressive demeanor sets him apart from his tranquil broodmates. This mighty dragon revels in the glory of combat, and has fostered a deadly rivalry with Darkscale, a general in Nidhogg's Horde."
msgstr "Ведрфёльнир — потомок великого дракона Хресвельгра. Он резко выделяется на фоне спокойных сородичей своей свирепостью и яростью. Могучий дракон наслаждается битвой и ведёт смертельное соперничество с Тёмной Чешуёй, генералом в орде Нидхёгга."

#. ja: クァールレギナ
#. de: Coeurl-Königin
#. fr: Regina coeurl
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A legend amongst the hunters of Tailfeather, this aged matriarch of the coeurls has attained immense size and magical potency. By conducting vast arcane energies through her massive elk-like horns and dispersing it into the surrounding air, Coeurlregina is said to be capable of altering the weather itself.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:109:0:0"
msgid "Coeurlregina"
msgstr "Королева коэрлов"

