msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:111:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: オーン原生林に自生する恐るべき食獣植物。花弁を獣に擬態させることで獲物を誘引し、側に寄ってきたところを捉えて捕食する。聖モシャーヌ植物園における研究結果によると、しばしば人を獲物と認識することがあるという。
#. de: Diese fleischfressende Pflanze aus dem Orn-Busch lockt ihre ahnungslosen Opfer dadurch an, dass sie mit ihren Blütenblättern verschiedene Tiere nachahmt. Kostspielige Experimente im Sankt Mocianne-Arboretum haben zweifelsfrei bewiesen, dass Belladonnas sowohl zweibeinige als auch vierbeinige Opfer als Beute nehmen.
#. fr: Plante carnivore native de l'étendue d'Orn, ce spécimen vorace de flore attire ses victimes potentielles en tordant ses pétales à l'apparence de diverses créatures. Les recherches conduites à l'Arboretum Sainte-Mocianne ont conclu que la meurtrière Belladone est susceptible de s'attaquer à des proies aussi bien bipèdes que quadrupèdes.
#. column 0: Belladonna
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:111:0:8"
msgid "A carnivorous plant native to the Orn Wild, this voracious specimen of flora lures in potential victims by contorting its petals into the form of various beasts. Research conducted at Saint Mocianne's Arboretum concluded that the murderous Belladonna is as likely to prey upon two-legged victims as four."
msgstr "Это хищное растение родом из Дикого Орна заманивает добычу, придавая своим лепесткам вид разных зверей. Исследования в Дендрарии Святой Моссианны показали: Белладонна охотится и на двуногих, и на четвероногих жертв."

#. ja: エキドナ
#. de: Echidna
#. fr: Echidna
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Echidna is the name of an alluring voidsent bound within the enigmatic Void Ark. The voidmages of Mhach, a city that thrived during the Fifth Astral Era, were said to have employed the fiendish entity as a strategic weapon in their endless conflicts. Scholars conjecture that as a member of voidsent nobility, Echidna likely occupies one of the higher rungs of the hierarchy.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:112:0:0"
msgid "Echidna"
msgstr "Эхидна"

