#. de: NONE
#. fr: Calcabrina
#. column 0: Calcabrina
#. column 8: This doll-like construct was created by the Sharlayans to protect the sanctity of the Antitower. Steeped in the energies of generations of mages, the powerful magicks instilled in this guardian have worked eerie transmutations upon its form.
