msgstr "0"

#. ja: シャーレアンの魔法施設「逆さの塔」を守護するために創り出された魔法人形。強大な力を付与するために、歴代の魔道士たちが長い時をかけて魔力を注ぎ込んだ結果、不気味な姿に変容を遂げている。
#. de: Sharlayaner Magier schufen diese schaurige Puppe, um ihren Antiturm vor ungebetenen Gästen zu beschützen. Bedacht, sie mit besonders starken Kräften auszustatten, ließen ihre Erbauer Unmengen an Äther in sie hineinfließen, und dieser strapaziösen Prozedur schuldet die Puppe ihr fürchterliches Aussehen.
#. fr: Ce pantin magique a été fabriqué par les Sharlayanais dans le but de protéger l'Antitour. Afin de lui conférer son ex<shy>traor<shy>di<shy>nai<shy>re puissance, les archimages de la Cité du savoir ont infusé leurs pouvoirs durant de longues périodes. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, cette opération a eu pour fâcheuse conséquence d'altérer son apparence physique et de lui donner cette forme terrifiante...
#. column 0: Calcabrina
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:130:0:8"
msgid "This doll-like construct was created by the Sharlayans to protect the sanctity of the Antitower. Steeped in the energies of generations of mages, the powerful magicks instilled in this guardian have worked eerie transmutations upon its form."
msgstr "Эту куклоподобную конструкцию создали шарлеанцы, чтобы защитить святость Антибашни. В неё вложили могущественную магию и энергию поколений магов. Со временем чары жутко изменили её облик."

#. ja: クリブ
#. de: Kuribu
#. fr: Kuribu
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Created by the magi of Amdapor using an advanced form of golem construction, this statue is animated by the gems embedded in its chest and hands. Kuribu commands formidable white magicks to aid in its battle against invading voidsent.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:131:0:0"
msgid "Kuribu"
msgstr "Курибу"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Kuribu
#. column 0: Kuribu
#. column 8: Created by the magi of Amdapor using an advanced form of golem construction, this statue is animated by the gems embedded in its chest and hands. Kuribu commands formidable white magicks to aid in its battle against invading voidsent.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:131:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アムダプールの白魔道士たちが造り上げた古都の守護者。ゴーレムの技術を応用して造られており、石像の胸元と両手には心核となる宝石がはめ込まれている。対妖異戦に特化し、複数の白魔法を使いこなす。
#. de: Die Weißmagier Amdapors erschufen Kuribu als Beschützerin ihrer Stadt. Dabei bedienten sie sich derselben Technik wie zur Erschaffung von Golems und arbeiteten kostbare Edelsteine in Torso und Hände. Sie ist optimiert, um gegen Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>te zu kämpfen, und beherrscht verschiedene Zauber der weißen Magie.
#. fr: Créée par les mages blancs d'Amdapor, cette statue est la gardienne de la vie dans l'ancienne Cité. Fabriquée selon le même procédé que celui des golems, les cristaux encastrés dans ses mains et son torse font office de cœurs. Kuribu est une arme optimisée pour le combat contre les créatures du néant, ce qui explique pourquoi elle maîtrise autant de sorts de magie blanche.
#. column 0: Kuribu
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:131:0:8"
msgid "Created by the magi of Amdapor using an advanced form of golem construction, this statue is animated by the gems embedded in its chest and hands. Kuribu commands formidable white magicks to aid in its battle against invading voidsent."
msgstr "Эту статую создали маги Амдапора, применив усовершенствованную технику изготовления големов. Её оживляют драгоценные камни, вставленные в грудь и ладони. Курибу владеет могущественной белой магией и использует её в бою с вторгшимися демонами."

#. ja: ティターン
#. de: Phlegethon
#. fr: Phlégéthon
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Phlegethon was a hero of the rebellion that sought to oppose the rule of Allag in the twilight of the Third Astral Era. After his capture by the technologist Amon, the valiant general was subjected to hideous experiments, his body altered and mind broken, fated to become an eternal guardian of the Crystal Tower.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:132:0:0"
msgid "Phlegethon"
msgstr "Флегетон"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Phlégéthon
#. column 0: Phlegethon
#. column 8: Phlegethon was a hero of the rebellion that sought to oppose the rule of Allag in the twilight of the Third Astral Era. After his capture by the technologist Amon, the valiant general was subjected to hideous experiments, his body altered and mind broken, fated to become an eternal guardian of the Crystal Tower.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:132:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 第三星暦末期、アラグ帝国の支配に抗うために戦った革命勢力の英雄。アモンによって捕らわれた後、その堅強な肉体を不老不死化の実験材料として利用された。生前の記憶は無きに等しく、クリスタルタワー防衛用の傀儡と化した。
#. de: Der tapfere General Phlegethon lehnte sich zum Ende der Dritten Ära des Lichts gegen die allagischen Herrscher auf, um sein Volk zu befreien. Doch der Wissenschaftler Amon, ein Gefolgsmann Xandes', lockte den Volkshelden in eine Falle, löschte seine Erinnerung und fror ihn in der Zeit ein, damit er auf alle Ewigkeit den Kristallturm beschütze.
#. fr: Ancien général qui instigua, à la fin de la 3e ère astrale, l'une des révoltes les plus célèbres contre la domination de l'empire d'Allag. Après avoir été capturé par Amon, il a été l'objet d'expériences magismologiques qui firent de lui un esclave soumis et lobotomisé. Certains historiens ont émis la théorie qu'il avait été transformé en sentinelle quasi éternelle afin de dissuader toute future rébellion du peuple allagois.
#. column 0: Phlegethon
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:132:0:8"
msgid "Phlegethon was a hero of the rebellion that sought to oppose the rule of Allag in the twilight of the Third Astral Era. After his capture by the technologist Amon, the valiant general was subjected to hideous experiments, his body altered and mind broken, fated to become an eternal guardian of the Crystal Tower."
msgstr "Флегетон был героем восстания против владычества Аллаганской империи в конце Третьей астральной эры. После пленения техномагом Амоном отважного генерала подвергли чудовищным опытам: его тело изменили, а разум сломили. Так он стал вечным стражем Кристальной башни."

#. ja: アルトアレール・ド・フォルタン
#. de: Artoirel
#. fr: Artoirel
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “I am no stranger to the battlefield, Ser Aymeric! My arm will not falter; my shield will not break! Halone as my witness, we will bring these fanatics to justice!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:133:0:0"
msgid "Artoirel de Fortemps"
msgstr "Арторель де Фортан"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Artoirel
#. column 0: Artoirel de Fortemps
#. column 8: “I am no stranger to the battlefield, Ser Aymeric! My arm will not falter; my shield will not break! Halone as my witness, we will bring these fanatics to justice!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:133:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「我が名は、アルトアレール・ド・フォルタン。<br>フォルタン家の長子にして、<br>誇り高きイシュガルドの騎士だ」<br>フォルタン家長男：アルトアレール・ド・フォルタン
#. de: „Ich bin bereit, mein Schwert und mein Schild in den Dienst der Bürger dieser Stadt zu stellen! So wahr ich ein Fortemps bin!“
#. fr: “La licorne qui orne mon bouclier est le symbole du dévouement des Fortemps envers le peuple d'Ishgard, et je compte bien lui faire honneur.”
#. column 0: Artoirel de Fortemps
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:133:0:8"
msgid "“I am no stranger to the battlefield, Ser Aymeric! My arm will not falter; my shield will not break! Halone as my witness, we will bring these fanatics to justice!”"
msgstr "«Я не новичок на поле боя, сир Эймерик! Рука моя не дрогнет, щит не падёт! Клянусь Халонэ, мы призовём этих фанатиков к ответу!»"

#. ja: エマネラン・ド・フォルタン
#. de: Emmanellain
#. fr: Emmanellain
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “'Tis a pleasure to see you again, my lady Laniaitte! You cut an elegant figure as always─a steel-clad rose, equally at home on a battlefield or in a ballroom.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:134:0:0"
msgid "Emmanellain de Fortemps"
msgstr "Эмманеллен де Фортан"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Emmanellain
#. column 0: Emmanellain de Fortemps
#. column 8: “'Tis a pleasure to see you again, my lady Laniaitte! You cut an elegant figure as always─a steel-clad rose, equally at home on a battlefield or in a ballroom.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:134:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「君だけの騎士、エマネランが助けにきたぞ！<br>オレ様が来たからには、もう安心してくれ！」<br>フォルタン家次男：エマネラン・ド・フォルタン
#. de: „Die Freude, dich zu sehen, ist ganz meinerseits, liebe Laniaitte! Du kannst aufatmen: Ich bin hier, um dir die Last deiner Sorgen von den Schultern zu nehmen.“
#. fr: “C'est un plaisir de vous revoir, Dame Laniaitte. Vous êtes toujours aussi ravissante, telle une rose aux épines d'acier qui resplendit aussi bien sur le champ de bataille que dans une salle de bal.”
#. column 0: Emmanellain de Fortemps
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:134:0:8"
msgid "“'Tis a pleasure to see you again, my lady Laniaitte! You cut an elegant figure as always─a steel-clad rose, equally at home on a battlefield or in a ballroom.”"
msgstr "«Рад снова видеть вас, леди Ланиетт! Вы, как всегда, прекрасны — роза в стальных доспехах, одинаково уместная и на поле боя, и на балу»"

#. ja: ザンデ
#. de: Xande
#. fr: Xande
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Xande, the first emperor of Allag, was resurrected from the sleep of death by the technologist Amon. Exhuming the ruler's body from his tomb, Amon cultivated the inert vessel for immortality, enlarging and strengthening Xande's form. After the emperor's successful rebirth, clones were made to serve as doubles.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:135:0:0"
msgid "Xande"
msgstr "Занди"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Xande
#. column 0: Xande
#. column 8: Xande, the first emperor of Allag, was resurrected from the sleep of death by the technologist Amon. Exhuming the ruler's body from his tomb, Amon cultivated the inert vessel for immortality, enlarging and strengthening Xande's form. After the emperor's successful rebirth, clones were made to serve as doubles.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:135:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 魔科学者アモンによって、永遠の眠りから蘇ったアラグ帝国初代皇帝。ザンデ霊廟に安置されていた遺体を培養し、不老不死化が計られているため肉体が巨大化している。なお、不死化後に、影武者としてクローンが作られたという。
#. de: Xande war der erste Kaiser und Begründer des Allagischen Kaiserreichs. Der geniale Amon entnahm Gewebeproben aus der kaiserlichen Grabkammer, reicherte sie mit üppiger Lebensenergie an und schuf so ein beinah unsterbliches, riesenhaftes Abbild des allagischen Herrschers.
#. fr: Fondateur de l'empire d'Allag, Xande est revenu à la vie grâce au génie d'Amon. Souhaitant redonner à l'empire déchu sa gloire passée, le magismologue a exhumé la dépouille de l'ancien monarque de son mausolée, et l'a placée dans un incubateur afin d'en accroître l'énergie vitale. Après l'avoir rendu quasi immortel, une série de clones a été fabriquée pour servir de substitut au véritable empereur en cas de menace.
#. column 0: Xande
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:135:0:8"
msgid "Xande, the first emperor of Allag, was resurrected from the sleep of death by the technologist Amon. Exhuming the ruler's body from his tomb, Amon cultivated the inert vessel for immortality, enlarging and strengthening Xande's form. After the emperor's successful rebirth, clones were made to serve as doubles."
msgstr "Занди, первый император Аллаганской империи, был воскрешён техномагом Амоном из смертного сна. Амон извлёк тело правителя из гробницы и вырастил его заново, чтобы даровать ему бессмертие, увеличив и укрепив его. После удачного возрождения императора создали клонов, чтобы те служили его двойниками."

#. ja: ブルートジャスティス
#. de: Brutalus
#. fr: Justicier
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Charged with the protection of Alexander, Brute Justice is a remarkable amalgamation of five separate guardians. With Onslaughter as its core, Vortexer, Swindler, Blaster, and Brawler complete the union. Brute Justice's lack of autonomy is balanced by its incorruptible loyalty to Quickthinx Allthoughts.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:136:0:0"
msgid "Brute Justice"
msgstr "Брутальная справедливость"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Justicier
#. column 0: Brute Justice
#. column 8: Charged with the protection of Alexander, Brute Justice is a remarkable amalgamation of five separate guardians. With Onslaughter as its core, Vortexer, Swindler, Blaster, and Brawler complete the union. Brute Justice's lack of autonomy is balanced by its incorruptible loyalty to Quickthinx Allthoughts.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:136:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 機工城を守る謎の合体兵士。防衛参謀オンスローターを中心に、魔道兵ボルテッカー、算術兵スウィンドラー、忍術兵ブラスター、武装兵ブロウラーが合体。主体性に欠ける反面、総統である万能のクイックシンクスには忠実である。
#. de: Brutalus, das komplizierte Wächterkonstrukt, dient Denkfix Alleskönner, dem Anführer der Indigohand, und patrouilliert ohne Unterlass im Inneren des kolossalen Alexander. Er vereint in sich fünf mächtige Kämpfer: Schlachter, Blaster, Wirbler, Schwindler und Blechbrecher, die jeder für sich von tödlicher Präzision sind.
#. fr: Une mystérieuse sentinelle mécanique gardant le Primordial Alexander. Attaqueur est l'élément principal, sur lequel sont assemblés Tourbillonneur, Arnaqueur, Fracasseur et Bagarreur. Bien qu'il soit pratiquement dépourvu d'autonomie, ce formidable robot des temps nouveaux voue une fidélité sans faille à Quickthinx.
#. column 0: Brute Justice
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:136:0:8"
msgid "Charged with the protection of Alexander, Brute Justice is a remarkable amalgamation of five separate guardians. With Onslaughter as its core, Vortexer, Swindler, Blaster, and Brawler complete the union. Brute Justice's lack of autonomy is balanced by its incorruptible loyalty to Quickthinx Allthoughts."
msgstr "Брутальная справедливость защищает Александра и состоит из пяти отдельных стражей. Её ядро — Резчик, а Вихревик, Плут, Бластер и драчун завершают это слияние. Брутальной справедливости недостаёт самостоятельности, зато она беззаветно верна Квиксинксу Всезнайке."

#. ja: セフィロト
#. de: Sephirot
#. fr: Sephirot
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Sephirot was revered as the world's first sacred tree, elevated to godhood by the belief of its devoted worshipers. This towering pillar of the Warring Triad is capable of inducing spontaneous growth, allowing the eikon to enlarge its own form to enormous proportions.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:137:0:0"
msgid "Sephirot"
msgstr "Сефирот"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Sephirot
#. column 0: Sephirot
#. column 8: Sephirot was revered as the world's first sacred tree, elevated to godhood by the belief of its devoted worshipers. This towering pillar of the Warring Triad is capable of inducing spontaneous growth, allowing the eikon to enlarge its own form to enormous proportions.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:137:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「三闘神」の一柱。南方大陸メラシディアに棲んでいた樹状種族が崇めていた存在で、世界最初の樹を神格化したものと考えられている。生命を操り、自らを「成長」させて巨大化させ暴れ回る様は、「魔神」の名に相応しい。
#. de: Eine der drei Ikonen der Kriegstriade. Einst war Sephirot der Schutzgott eines Volkes von baumähnlichen Wesen, die auf dem südlichen Kontinent Meracydia lebten, und soll ihren Legenden zufolge aus dem ersten heiligen Baum hervorgegangen sein.
#. fr: Pilier de la Triade guerrière, ce Primordial était autrefois le gardien protecteur d'une tribu d'êtres végétaux qui vivait à Méracydia. Certains érudits émettent l'hypothèse qu'il était à l'origine le premier arbre sacré de ce monde, élevé au rang de divinité par la foi de ses adorateurs. Sephirot possède la capacité de contrôler la croissance des organismes vivants à travers la manipulation de l'éther environnant, une faculté qu'il n'a pas hésité à utiliser sur lui-même pour écraser ses ennemis.
#. column 0: Sephirot
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:137:0:8"
msgid "Sephirot was revered as the world's first sacred tree, elevated to godhood by the belief of its devoted worshipers. This towering pillar of the Warring Triad is capable of inducing spontaneous growth, allowing the eikon to enlarge its own form to enormous proportions."
msgstr "Сефирота почитали как первое священное древо мира, а верующие вознесли его до божества. Этот исполинский столп Воюющей Триады способен вызывать внезапный рост, благодаря чему эйкон может увеличиваться до невероятных размеров."

#. ja: フ・ラミン
#. de: F'lhaminn
#. fr: F'lhaminn
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Have I become an open book, or has she acquired still greater powers of insight? I shall choose to believe the latter.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:138:0:0"
msgid "F'lhaminn"
msgstr "Ф'ламинн"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: F'lhaminn
#. column 0: F'lhaminn
#. column 8: “Have I become an open book, or has she acquired still greater powers of insight? I shall choose to believe the latter.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:138:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「フフ、子供はいつの間にか成長するものね。<br>小さなアシリアが、あんなに立派になって……」<br>ウルダハの歌姫：フ・ラミン
#. de: „Ob ich etwas auf dem Herzen habe? Nicht doch! Zumindest nicht das, was Minfilia denkt. Es hat gar nichts mit ihr zu tun.“
#. fr: “Tu n'as plus besoin de ma protection désormais. La petite chenille est devenue un beau papillon plein de vie, et j'en suis heureuse.”
#. column 0: F'lhaminn
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:138:0:8"
msgid "“Have I become an open book, or has she acquired still greater powers of insight? I shall choose to believe the latter.”"
msgstr "«Неужели я стала такой понятной или она научилась читать мысли ещё лучше? Пожалуй, буду считать, что дело во втором»"

#. ja: ヴィゾーヴニル
#. de: Vidofnir
#. fr: Vidofnir
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Vidofnir was sired by the great wyrm Hraesvelgr. A creature of great age, she has memories of the era when man and dragon lived together in peace, and is revered as an elder by others of her brood.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:139:0:0"
msgid "Vidofnir"
msgstr "Видофнир"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Vidofnir
#. column 0: Vidofnir
#. column 8: Vidofnir was sired by the great wyrm Hraesvelgr. A creature of great age, she has memories of the era when man and dragon lived together in peace, and is revered as an elder by others of her brood.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:139:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 聖竜フレースヴェルグの血を引くドラゴン。かつて人と竜とが蜜月関係にあった時代も知る古き竜であり、聖竜の眷属たちを束ねる長老的存在でもある。美しい翼から「白き翼」の二つ名で呼ばれることも。
#. de: Vidofnir ist ein Abkömmling Hraesvelgrs und von historischem Alter. Sie erinnert sich gut an die Zeit, in der Ishgard und die Drachen in Harmonie miteinander lebten. Wegen ihrer strahlenden Schwingen wird sie gelegentlich respektvoll „der weiße Drache“ genannt.
#. fr: Cette vieille dragonne est en quelque sorte la doyenne des descendants de Hraesvelgr. Connue depuis l'époque où les humains et les dragons vivaient en harmonie, elle est aussi surnommée “Blanches ailes” par les Ishgardais en raison de sa beauté ex<shy>cep<shy>tion<shy>nelle.
#. column 0: Vidofnir
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:139:0:8"
msgid "Vidofnir was sired by the great wyrm Hraesvelgr. A creature of great age, she has memories of the era when man and dragon lived together in peace, and is revered as an elder by others of her brood."
msgstr "Видофнир — потомок великого дракона Хресвельгра. Она прожила очень долгую жизнь и помнит времена, когда люди и драконы жили в мире. Другие драконы почитают её как старшую."

#. ja: 暗闇の雲
#. de: Wolke der Dunkelheit
#. fr: Nuage de Ténèbres
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: One of the undisputed rulers of the void and an entity of immeasurable strength, the Cloud of Darkness occupies the highest rung of the hierarchy of twelve. This terrifying voidsent entered into a dark covenant with Emperor Xande of Allag in a bid to invade the physical realm.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:140:0:0"
msgid "Cloud of Darkness"
msgstr "Облако Тьмы"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Nuage de Ténèbres
#. column 0: Cloud of Darkness
#. column 8: One of the undisputed rulers of the void and an entity of immeasurable strength, the Cloud of Darkness occupies the highest rung of the hierarchy of twelve. This terrifying voidsent entered into a dark covenant with Emperor Xande of Allag in a bid to invade the physical realm.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:140:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 異界ヴォイドを統べる魔王のひとり。その実力は計り知れず、妖異十二階位において最高位である「第一位」に位置する。古代アラグ帝国の皇帝「ザンデ」と血の契約を交わし、物質界への侵攻をもくろんでいた。
#. de: Ein Nichtswesen von allerhöchstem Rang und unermesslicher Macht. Die Wolke der Dunkelheit schloss mit Xande, Kaiser der Allager, einen unheilvollen Pakt, der es ihr erlaubte, in die diesseitige Welt einzufallen.
#. fr: L'un des êtres les plus puissants qui existent dans le Monde des Ténèbres. Son pouvoir est tel que les spé<shy>cia<shy>listes le classent au premier rang de la Hiérarchie du néant. Ayant conclu un pacte avec l'ancien empereur allagois Xande, le Nuage de Ténèbres projetait d'envahir le monde des humains. Il est fort probable que s'il avait réussi, il aurait absorbé tout l'éther, apportant destruction et anéantissant toute forme de vie.
#. column 0: Cloud of Darkness
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:140:0:8"
msgid "One of the undisputed rulers of the void and an entity of immeasurable strength, the Cloud of Darkness occupies the highest rung of the hierarchy of twelve. This terrifying voidsent entered into a dark covenant with Emperor Xande of Allag in a bid to invade the physical realm."
msgstr "Облако Тьмы — один из бесспорных владык пустоты, существо неизмеримой силы, стоящее на вершине иерархии двенадцати. Этот ужасающий пустотник заключил мрачный договор с императором Занди из Аллагана, чтобы вторгнуться в материальный мир."

#. ja: ロロリト・ナナリト
#. de: Lolorito Nanarito
#. fr: Lolorito Nanarito
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Precious or not, they were never yet so reliable. And unlike those who frequent your establishment, I have no desire to gamble with my future.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:141:0:0"
msgid "Lolorito Nanarito"
msgstr "Лолорито Нанарито"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Lolorito Nanarito
#. column 0: Lolorito Nanarito
#. column 8: “Precious or not, they were never yet so reliable. And unlike those who frequent your establishment, I have no desire to gamble with my future.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:141:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「……人や金は、国の柱だ。<br>国の礎は、堅固な統治にほかならない」<br>東アルデナード商会会長：ロロリト・ナナリト
#. de: „Exakt. Wer hat zu Beginn einer neuen Partie nicht gern gleich freie Bahn?“
#. fr: “Les hommes et l'argent sont les piliers d'un État, mais sa base doit être un pouvoir fort. Et c'est justement ce qui fait ac<shy>tu<shy>el<shy>le<shy>ment défaut à Ul'dah. Sans un gouvernement stable, il nous est impossible de bâtir quoi que ce soit de durable.”
#. column 0: Lolorito Nanarito
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:141:0:8"
msgid "“Precious or not, they were never yet so reliable. And unlike those who frequent your establishment, I have no desire to gamble with my future.”"
msgstr "«Дороги они или нет, надёжностью никогда не отличались. И, в отличие от завсегдатаев твоего заведения, я не собираюсь ставить своё будущее на кон»"

#. ja: ジブリオン
#. de: Gibrillont
#. fr: Gibrillont
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “You know, people long for a sympathetic ear, but they need to know that it comes with tight lips.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:142:0:0"
msgid "Gibrillont"
msgstr "Гибрилонт"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Gibrillont
#. column 0: Gibrillont
#. column 8: “You know, people long for a sympathetic ear, but they need to know that it comes with tight lips.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:142:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「上手く酒場を経営する秘訣はな、<br>無闇やたらに客の話を、他人に漏らさないことさ」<br>「忘れられた騎士亭」マスター：ジブリオン
#. de: „Das Erfolgsrezept einer gut geführten Schenke liegt in der Diskretion des Wirtes.“
#. fr: “Écoute-moi bien, <if $gn4>ma jolie<else>mon p'tit bonhomme</if>, le meilleur moyen pour un tavernier de conserver sa clientèle, c'est de savoir garder un secret. Tu ne pourrais pas te biturer l'esprit tranquille si tu savais que tout ce que tu dis risque d'être répété, pas vrai<nbsp>?”
#. column 0: Gibrillont
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:142:0:8"
msgid "“You know, people long for a sympathetic ear, but they need to know that it comes with tight lips.”"
msgstr "«Знаешь, людям нужно выговориться, но они должны быть уверены, что их слова останутся при тебе»"

#. ja: ラニエット・ド・アインハルト
#. de: Laniaitte de Haillenarte
#. fr: Laniaitte de Haillenarte
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Ye gods! I knew you were clever, but I never realized you were capable of this!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:143:0:0"
msgid "Laniaitte de Haillenarte"
msgstr "Ланиетт де Айнхардт"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Laniaitte de Haillenarte
#. column 0: Laniaitte de Haillenarte
#. column 8: “Ye gods! I knew you were clever, but I never realized you were capable of this!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:143:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「……すまん、いたのか、気付かなかった。<br>今、取り込み中だから、少し黙っていてくれないか？」<br>薔薇騎兵団団長：ラニエット・ド・アインハルト
#. de: „Die Schicksalsgöttin führt uns heute zum ersten Mal zusammen, aber ich habe schon viel von dir gehört.“
#. fr: “Le camp de Cime-des-nuages a été établi pour envoyer à Ishgard des avertissements suf<shy>fi<shy>sam<shy>ment prompts en cas d'offensive des Dravaniens. La haute altitude de ces îles flottantes est idéale pour cela. Bien sûr, cette position avancée fait aussi de nous une cible de choix pour leurs attaques, mais nous ne sommes pas sans défense. Le Protecteur, notre aéronef le plus moderne et le plus imposant, est capable d'abattre presque n'importe quel dragon.”
#. column 0: Laniaitte de Haillenarte
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:143:0:8"
msgid "“Ye gods! I knew you were clever, but I never realized you were capable of this!”"
msgstr "«Боги! Я знала, что ты умён, но даже не представляла, на что ты способен!»"

#. ja: ローズウェン
#. de: Rhoswen
#. fr: Rhoswen
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Ye won't find no mollycoddles or ministers in my crew─just real buccaneers what know how to stand up for 'emselves!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:144:0:0"
msgid "Rhoswen"
msgstr "Росвен"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Rhoswen
#. column 0: Rhoswen
#. column 8: “Ye won't find no mollycoddles or ministers in my crew─just real buccaneers what know how to stand up for 'emselves!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:144:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「うちら紅血聖女団は、海賊の伝統ってやつを重んじている。<br>束縛を嫌い、自由に生きる。これぞ海賊の生き様さ」<br>紅血聖女団頭領：ローズウェン
#. de: „Entweder gehst du sofort auf die Knie oder meine Mädels brechen dir dieselben.“
#. fr: “Nous, Sirènes san<shy>gui<shy>nai<shy>res, sommes fières de notre longue tradition de piraterie. Nous avons le plus grand mépris pour toutes les formes de contraintes. Mais ce qui nous répugne encore plus, ce sont les prétentieux comme ces chiens de la Horde du kraken que dirige Carvallain<nbsp>! Ils souillent l'honneur de tous les naufrageurs par leur bassesse<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Rhoswen
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:144:0:8"
msgid "“Ye won't find no mollycoddles or ministers in my crew─just real buccaneers what know how to stand up for 'emselves!”"
msgstr "«У меня в команде нет ни кисейных барышень, ни чинуш — только настоящие пираты, которые за себя постоять умеют!»"

#. ja: カルヴァラン・ド・ゴルガニュ
#. de: Carvallain de Gorgagne
#. fr: Carvallain de Gorgagne
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Limsa Lominsa is a place where a man's work and wits determine his worth, where an orphan can pull himself up by his bootstraps to one day lead the Kraken's Arms!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:145:0:0"
msgid "Carvallain de Gorgagne"
msgstr "Карваллен де Горгань"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Carvallain de Gorgagne
#. column 0: Carvallain de Gorgagne
#. column 8: “Limsa Lominsa is a place where a man's work and wits determine his worth, where an orphan can pull himself up by his bootstraps to one day lead the Kraken's Arms!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:145:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「この自由さこそ、私がこの都市を愛し、<br>「百鬼夜行」の頭領として、生きている理由です」<br>百鬼夜行頭領：カルヴァラン・ド・ゴルガニュ
#. de: „Heißt das, ich habe das Duell gewonnen? Ts, was für eine lächerliche Aufführung ...“
#. fr: “Avec du talent, n'importe qui peut faire fortune et élever son rang ici... C'est cette liberté qui fait que j'aime Limsa Lominsa et que je suis devenu le chef de la Horde du kraken. Si le bateau à bord duquel j'étais dans ma jeunesse n'avait pas été attaqué par des pirates, je serais sûrement encore dans mon village au cœur des montagnes, et j'aurais fini à l'Observatoire. Comme quoi certains événements marquent nos vies.”
#. column 0: Carvallain de Gorgagne
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:145:0:8"
msgid "“Limsa Lominsa is a place where a man's work and wits determine his worth, where an orphan can pull himself up by his bootstraps to one day lead the Kraken's Arms!”"
msgstr "«В Лимсе Ломинсе ценят ум и труд. Тут даже сирота может пробиться наверх и однажды возглавить „Когти кракена“!»"

#. ja: カル・ミーク
#. de: Kal Myhk
#. fr: Kal Myhk
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Am I really any different from other creatures that have fallen at your hands?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:146:0:0"
msgid "Kal Myhk"
msgstr "Кал-Мик"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Kal Myhk
#. column 0: Kal Myhk
#. column 8: “Am I really any different from other creatures that have fallen at your hands?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:146:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「しょうがないから、おともだちになってあげる！<br>ボクの名前は「カル・ミーク」だよ、よろしくね！」<br>聖竜の眷属：カル・ミーク
#. de: „Interessant. Du bist also nicht so lahm, wie ich dachte.“
#. fr: “Bon sang, mais comment tu fais<nbsp>!? T'es la première personne qui finit toujours par me retrouver. Enfin, t'as l'air plus attenti<if $gn4>ve<else>f</if> que les cailloux avec lesquels je joue d'habitude... Bon, j'ai décidé qu'on pouvait être copains s'tu veux. Moi, c'est Kal Myhk...”
#. column 0: Kal Myhk
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:146:0:8"
msgid "“Am I really any different from other creatures that have fallen at your hands?”"
msgstr "«Неужели я ничем не отличаюсь от других существ, что пали от твоей руки?»"

#. ja: ワウッケオン
#. de: Waukkeon
#. fr: waukkeon
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: This giant sanuwa nests on Neverreap, an island sacred to the Vanu Vanu. The scales of the waukkeon glisten with liquid vibrancy, as if the life-giving rains that fall upon the floating isles were trapped within. If such a treasure could be pried from its hide, one might fashion a mask that granted the authority of a furious storm cloud.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:147:0:0"
msgid "Waukkeon"
msgstr "Вауккеон"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: waukkeon
#. column 0: Waukkeon
#. column 8: This giant sanuwa nests on Neverreap, an island sacred to the Vanu Vanu. The scales of the waukkeon glisten with liquid vibrancy, as if the life-giving rains that fall upon the floating isles were trapped within. If such a treasure could be pried from its hide, one might fashion a mask that granted the authority of a furious storm cloud.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:147:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: バヌバヌ族の聖域、ネバーリープを棲処とする大物のサヌワ。その鱗は、浮島を潤す恵みの雨のように、しっとりと艶やかに輝いている。もし、鱗を剥がして持ち帰ることができれば、群雲のようなお面を作ることができるだろう。
#. de: Diese riesige Sanuwa lebt in Nimmerreich, der heiligen Stätte der Vanu Vanu. Ihre Schuppen funkeln wie der lebenspendende Regen, der die Schwebenden Inseln benetzt, weshalb sie von den Vanu Vanu gerne als rituelle Masken getragen werden.
#. fr: Cet énorme sanuwa vit sur la terre sacrée des Vanu Vanu qu'est Nalloncques. Ses écailles sont si humides et brillantes qu'elles pourraient sûrement servir à fabriquer un masque rappelant les nuages de L'Écume des cieux d'Abalathia.
#. column 0: Waukkeon
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:147:0:8"
msgid "This giant sanuwa nests on Neverreap, an island sacred to the Vanu Vanu. The scales of the waukkeon glisten with liquid vibrancy, as if the life-giving rains that fall upon the floating isles were trapped within. If such a treasure could be pried from its hide, one might fashion a mask that granted the authority of a furious storm cloud."
msgstr "Этот огромный санува обитает на Неверлипе — священном острове племени вану-вану. Его чешуя влажно и ярко блестит, словно впитавшая живительную влагу дождей, орошающих парящие острова. Сдери с него эту красоту — и получится маска, способная повелевать свирепыми грозовыми тучами."

#. ja: キュレーター
#. de: Kurator
#. fr: Conservateur
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: An autonomous machine housed within the Fractal Continuum. Primarily a tool for education, the Curator is equipped with a reality augmentation system that allows museum visitors to experience a plethora of technological marvels. When unauthorized personnel are detected, however, the machine also functions as a lethally effective counter-intrusion measure.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:148:0:0"
msgid "Curator"
msgstr "Куратор"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Conservateur
#. column 0: Curator
#. column 8: An autonomous machine housed within the Fractal Continuum. Primarily a tool for education, the Curator is equipped with a reality augmentation system that allows museum visitors to experience a plethora of technological marvels. When unauthorized personnel are detected, however, the machine also functions as a lethally effective counter-intrusion measure.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:148:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 博物戦艦「フラクタル・コンティニアム」に配備されていた無人機械。現実拡張システムを用いて、来館者にアラグ脅威の技術の数々を体感させる教育的体感型アトラクションの一部だが、侵入者に対しては防衛兵器としても機能する。
#. de: Das autonome Steuerungssystem der <i>Fraktal-Kontinuum</i>, einem allagischen Museumsschiff. Es geht seiner Aufgabe, interessierten Museumsgästen die technischen Errungenschaften der Allager näher zu bringen, genauso begeistert nach wie der gewaltsamen Abwehr von ungebetenen Besuchern.
#. fr: Cette machine autonome a été installée autrefois dans le vaisseau-musée qu'est Le Continuum fractal. Dotée d'un système de distorsion de la réalité, elle était intégrée à une attraction éducative qui permettait de faire ressentir aux visiteurs toute l'ampleur de la technologie allagoise. Elle pouvait également servir d'arme de défense contre les intrus.
#. column 0: Curator
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:148:0:8"
msgid "An autonomous machine housed within the Fractal Continuum. Primarily a tool for education, the Curator is equipped with a reality augmentation system that allows museum visitors to experience a plethora of technological marvels. When unauthorized personnel are detected, however, the machine also functions as a lethally effective counter-intrusion measure. "
msgstr "Автономная машина, находившаяся во Фрактальном континууме. Прежде всего куратор служил для обучения: система дополненной реальности позволяла посетителям музея знакомиться с чудесами техники. Но если обнаруживались незваные гости, машина становилась смертоносным средством защиты от вторжения."

#. ja: 霧髭
#. de: Rauschebart
#. fr: Barbe-Brume
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Steel yourself for the wrath of Mistbeard! King of the five seas!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:149:0:0"
msgid "Mistbeard"
msgstr "Туманный Бородач"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Barbe-Brume
#. column 0: Mistbeard
#. column 8: “Steel yourself for the wrath of Mistbeard! King of the five seas!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:149:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「我こそは、海賊王「霧髭」！<br>一日限り、海の底より蘇ろうぞ！」<br>伝説の海賊王：霧髭
#. de: „Zittere vor Rauschebarts Zorn! Dem König der Fünf Meere!“
#. fr: “Oui, je suis Barbe-Brume, le légendaire roi des pirates<nbsp>! J'ai parcouru toutes les mers et amassé plus de trésors que l'on ne peut imaginer<nbsp>! Il n'est pas de marin dans ce monde qui ne tremble en entendant mon nom ou à la vue de mon masque... car quiconque croise ma route finit au fond de l'océan<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Mistbeard
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:149:0:8"
msgid "“Steel yourself for the wrath of Mistbeard! King of the five seas!”"
msgstr "«Приготовьтесь узреть гнев Туманного Бородача — короля пяти морей!»"

#. ja: ウネ＆ドーガ
#. de: Unei & Doga
#. fr: Unéi & Doga
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “'Tis for no other purpose but to put an end to Xande's madness that we exist. This is the mantle we have inherited from our namesakes.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:150:0:0"
msgid "Unei & Doga"
msgstr "Унэи и Дога"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Unéi & Doga
#. column 0: Unei & Doga
#. column 8: “'Tis for no other purpose but to put an end to Xande's madness that we exist. This is the mantle we have inherited from our namesakes.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:150:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「私たちは、ザンデを止めたい。<br>それが、オリジナルのウネとドーガから託された使命なんだ」<br>ノアの一員：ウネ＆ドーガ
#. de: „Ich bin Unei, und mein Gefährte heißt Doga. Lasst euch von seinem finsteren Blick nicht einschüchtern.“
#. fr: “Notre seul désir est d'arrêter Xande. C'est la mission que les vrais Doga et Unéi nous ont confiée. Ils savaient quel danger l'ancien empereur représentait pour le monde, et souhaitant empêcher une nouvelle catastrophe, ils ont donné la volonté de se battre aux clones que nous sommes.”
#. column 0: Unei & Doga
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:150:0:8"
msgid "“'Tis for no other purpose but to put an end to Xande's madness that we exist. This is the mantle we have inherited from our namesakes.”"
msgstr "«Мы существуем лишь затем, чтобы положить конец безумию Занди. Такова миссия, доставшаяся нам от тех, чьи имена мы носим»"

#. ja: ティアマット
#. de: Tiamat
#. fr: Tiamat
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: One of the seven great wyrms sired by Midgardsormr, Father of Dragons. Following in the wake of her sibling Bahamut, Tiamat crossed to the southern continent of Meracydia where she became mother to her own expansive brood. Until this very day, she is tormented by the decision to resurrect her fallen brother as a primal in their failed resistance against the invading Allagan Empire.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:151:0:0"
msgid "Tiamat"
msgstr "Тиамат"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Tiamat
#. column 0: Tiamat
#. column 8: One of the seven great wyrms sired by Midgardsormr, Father of Dragons. Following in the wake of her sibling Bahamut, Tiamat crossed to the southern continent of Meracydia where she became mother to her own expansive brood. Until this very day, she is tormented by the decision to resurrect her fallen brother as a primal in their failed resistance against the invading Allagan Empire.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:151:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 幻龍ミドガルズオルムの七つの卵から孵った、七大天竜の一翼。兄弟である光竜バハムートと南方大陸メラシディアへと渡り、多くの子を成した。アラグに抗うため、死した光竜を蛮神として呼び降ろした事を、今も後悔し続けている。
#. de: Tiamat ist eine der sieben Hohen Drachen, den Abkömmlingen Midgardsormrs. Einst zog sie mit Bahamut in den südlichen Kontinent Meracydia, wo sie zahlreiche Nachkommen zeugten. Doch indem sie ihren von den Allagern getöteten Geliebten als zornigen Primae wiedererweckte, beging sie nichtsahnend einen unsäglichen Fehler, der ihr bis heute die Ruhe versagt.
#. fr: L'un des sept grands dragons engendrés par Midgardsormr. Tiamat s'était installée autrefois avec son frère et compagnon Bahamut sur le continent de Méracydia, où ils donnèrent naissance à une nombreuse progéniture. Toutefois, après que son bien-aimé eut été tué par le belliqueux empire d'Allag, elle choisit de le rappeler à la vie sous la forme d'un Primordial destructeur... une erreur qu'elle doit désormais regretter amèrement pour l'éternité.
#. column 0: Tiamat
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:151:0:8"
msgid "One of the seven great wyrms sired by Midgardsormr, Father of Dragons. Following in the wake of her sibling Bahamut, Tiamat crossed to the southern continent of Meracydia where she became mother to her own expansive brood. Until this very day, she is tormented by the decision to resurrect her fallen brother as a primal in their failed resistance against the invading Allagan Empire."
msgstr "Один из семи великих драконов, порождённых Мидгардсормом, Отцом драконов. Вслед за братом Бахамутом Тиамат отправилась на южный континент Мерацидию, где у неё появилось множество детей. Она и по сей день мучается из-за того, что ради неудачного сопротивления вторгшейся Аллагской империи воскресила погибшего брата в облике праймала."

#. ja: カロフィステリ
#. de: Calofisteri
#. fr: Calofisteri
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Head crowned with animate tresses and mind caressed by madness, Calofisteri haunts the Tomb of the Nullstone as the relic's self-appointed guardian. This mighty sorceress of Mhach achieved a twisted form of immortality by combining the power of aether-infused crystal with the ritual consumption of voidsent blood.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:152:0:0"
msgid "Calofisteri"
msgstr "Калофистери"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Calofisteri
#. column 0: Calofisteri
#. column 8: Head crowned with animate tresses and mind caressed by madness, Calofisteri haunts the Tomb of the Nullstone as the relic's self-appointed guardian. This mighty sorceress of Mhach achieved a twisted form of immortality by combining the power of aether-infused crystal with the ritual consumption of voidsent blood.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:152:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 魔法都市マハのピラミッドにて、妖異との契約の「要」を守護する存在。マハの偉大な大魔道士のひとりであったが、自身の肉体に妖異の血を注入する邪法と、魔力を込めた水晶の力により、自ら永遠の守護者に変異を遂げたという。
#. de: Einst eine Großmagierin der Mhach-Zivilisation, vermengte sie ihr Blut mit dem der Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ten, um fortan in der Pyramide der Stadt der Tränen über den Nullstein, Symbol des Paktes mit den Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ten, zu wachen.
#. fr: Cette créature a été placée par les sorciers mhachois au sommet de leur pyramide afin de garder la Clef de voûte, un artefact qui leur permettait de s'assurer les services des êtres du néant. Calofisteri était à l'origine une grande magicienne, qui aurait acquis un pouvoir incommensurable en s'injectant du sang de démon et grâce à un cristal recelant une importante source de mana.
#. column 0: Calofisteri
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:152:0:8"
msgid "Head crowned with animate tresses and mind caressed by madness, Calofisteri haunts the Tomb of the Nullstone as the relic's self-appointed guardian. This mighty sorceress of Mhach achieved a twisted form of immortality by combining the power of aether-infused crystal with the ritual consumption of voidsent blood."
msgstr "С головой, увенчанной живыми прядями, и разумом, охваченным безумием, Калофистери обитает в Гробнице Нулевого камня, назначив себя хранительницей реликвии. Эта могущественная чародейка из Мхача обрела извращённую форму бессмертия, соединив силу насыщенного эфиром кристалла с ритуальным питьём крови пустотников."

#. ja: フレースヴェルグ
#. de: Hraesvelgr
#. fr: Hraesvelgr
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: One of the seven great wyrms sired by Midgardsormr, Hraesvelgr shared a love with Saint Shiva that transcended race and reason. Their pure bond quelled the hostility between dragon and man, until one fateful day when mortal treachery shattered the peace and soured the wyrm's heart with grief.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:153:0:0"
msgid "Hraesvelgr"
msgstr "Хресвельгр"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Hraesvelgr
#. column 0: Hraesvelgr
#. column 8: One of the seven great wyrms sired by Midgardsormr, Hraesvelgr shared a love with Saint Shiva that transcended race and reason. Their pure bond quelled the hostility between dragon and man, until one fateful day when mortal treachery shattered the peace and soured the wyrm's heart with grief.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:153:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 幻龍ミドガルズオルムの七つの卵から孵った、七大天竜の一翼。かつて、聖女「シヴァ」と種族を超えた愛を育み、人と竜との融和のきっかけを作った。しかし、人と竜との蜜月関係は、後に人の裏切りにより崩れ去ることになる。
#. de: Hraesvelgr ist einer der sieben Hohen Drachen, ein Abkömmling Midgardsormrs. Seine Liebe zu Shiva wurde zum Symbol für die Verbundenheit von Drachen und Sterblichen - bis diese Verbundenheit verraten wurde und die Völker in einen tausendjährigen Krieg stürzten.
#. fr: L'un des sept grands dragons engendrés par Midgardsormr. L'histoire d'amour qui a autrefois uni Hraesvelgr à l'humaine Shiva avait permis de rapprocher deux peuples qui jusque-là se livraient farouchement bataille. Hélas, l'amitié entre hommes et dragons fut de courte durée<nbsp>; l'horrible trahison commise quelque deux cents ans plus tard par ces premiers marqua le début d'une guerre qui devait durer plus d'un millénaire. Par respect pour sa défunte bien-aimée, Hraesvelgr, lui, préféra se tenir à l'écart et vivre dans l'oubli.
#. column 0: Hraesvelgr
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:153:0:8"
msgid "One of the seven great wyrms sired by Midgardsormr, Hraesvelgr shared a love with Saint Shiva that transcended race and reason. Their pure bond quelled the hostility between dragon and man, until one fateful day when mortal treachery shattered the peace and soured the wyrm's heart with grief."
msgstr "Один из семи великих драконов, рождённых Мидгардсормром, Хресвельгр любил святую Шиву — любовь, не знавшую ни границ между расами, ни доводов разума. Их чистое чувство прекратило вражду между людьми и драконами, пока однажды предательство смертных не разрушило мир и не наполнило сердце дракона скорбью."

#. ja: アプカル
#. de: Apkallu
#. fr: apkallu
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: These large, flightless seabirds dwell on the coastlines of Vylbrand. Though apkallu move on land with an awkward waddle, they use their flipper-like wings to glide through the water at impressive speeds. Able to adjust their stomach acids at will, the green-feathered cloudkin store fish in their bellies for feeding their young, but have also been known to spit caustic fluids at predators.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:154:0:0"
msgid "Apkallu"
msgstr "Апкаллу"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Apkallus
#. fr: apkallus
#. column 0: Apkallu
#. column 8: These large, flightless seabirds dwell on the coastlines of Vylbrand. Though apkallu move on land with an awkward waddle, they use their flipper-like wings to glide through the water at impressive speeds. Able to adjust their stomach acids at will, the green-feathered cloudkin store fish in their bellies for feeding their young, but have also been known to spit caustic fluids at predators.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:154:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: バイルブランド島沿岸に棲息する大型海鳥。飛ぶことはできないがヒレと化す翼を用いて、海中を自在に泳いで魚を捕食する。ヒナに魚を持ち帰るため、任意に胃液を調節することで知られるが、危機に際しては吐き出すことも。
#. de: Die Flügel dieses Seevogels von den Küsten Vylbrands haben sich zu Flossen entwickelt, und obwohl der Vogel dadurch seine Flugfähigkeit einbüßte, ist er zu einem geschickten Jäger von Fischen geworden. Apkallus können die Produktion ihrer Magensäfte steuern, um im Schnabel gehaltene Fische auf dem Weg zurück zum Nest für ihre Küken vorzuverdauen, und benutzen bei Anzeichen von Gefahr diese Magensäfte auch für unangenehme Spuckangriffe.
#. fr: Ces gros oiseaux maritimes sont incapables de voler, mais utilisent leurs ailes comme des nageoires, ce qui leur permet d'évoluer dans l'eau aussi bien que des poissons. Ils se nourrissent ainsi des spécimens qui vivent comme eux autour de l'île de Vylbrand. Ils ont pour particularité de pouvoir réguler leur sécrétion de suc gastrique afin de rapporter des poissons à leur progéniture sans les avoir digérés. Ils sont également capables d'en fabriquer en abondance pour en projeter sur ce qu'ils considèrent comme une menace.
#. column 0: Apkallu
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:154:0:8"
msgid "These large, flightless seabirds dwell on the coastlines of Vylbrand. Though apkallu move on land with an awkward waddle, they use their flipper-like wings to glide through the water at impressive speeds. Able to adjust their stomach acids at will, the green-feathered cloudkin store fish in their bellies for feeding their young, but have also been known to spit caustic fluids at predators."
msgstr "Эти крупные нелетающие морские птицы обитают на побережьях Вилбранда. По суше апкаллу переваливаются неуклюже, зато их крылья-ласты позволяют им стремительно скользить под водой. Они умеют менять кислотность желудочного сока и запасают в желудке рыбу, чтобы кормить птенцов. Известно и другое: при опасности апкаллу плюются едкой жидкостью."

#. ja: コリブリ
#. de: Kolibri
#. fr: colibri
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The distinctive beak of the colorful colibri is said to have evolved from its preference to feed on the nectar of tropical blooms, though its obsession with shiny objects also leads the bird to occasionally swallow shellfish whole. With sufficient time and effort, it is possible to train this native of the south seas to mimic words from the common tongue.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:155:0:0"
msgid "Colibri"
msgstr "Колибри"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Kolibris
#. fr: colibris
#. column 0: Colibri
#. column 8: The distinctive beak of the colorful colibri is said to have evolved from its preference to feed on the nectar of tropical blooms, though its obsession with shiny objects also leads the bird to occasionally swallow shellfish whole. With sufficient time and effort, it is possible to train this native of the south seas to mimic words from the common tongue.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:155:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 南洋原産の色鮮やかな鳥。花の蜜を吸うために、独特の形状のくちばしを持つに至ったといわれている。光り物に興味を示して、貝などを丸呑みにすることも。また、訓練次第では人語をマネして発話することができるようだ。
#. de: Ein fröhlich-bunter Vogel aus den südlichen Landen. Mit ihrem eigenartig geformten Schnabel gelangen sie an den Nektar tropischer Blüten. Sie zeichnen sich durch eine Sammelleidenschaft von kleinen, glitzernden Gegenständen aus und sind sogar in der Lage, gesprochene Sprache zu imitieren.
#. fr: La nature a doté cet oiseau des îles méridionales d'un bec long pour qu'il puisse accéder au nectar des fleurs. Il semble également apprécier ce qui brille et avale parfois tout ronds les coquillages qui ont le malheur de briller au soleil. On raconte aussi à son sujet qu'avec un peu d'en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ment il serait capable d'imiter les humains et de répéter des phrases apprises par cœur.
#. column 0: Colibri
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:155:0:8"
msgid "The distinctive beak of the colorful colibri is said to have evolved from its preference to feed on the nectar of tropical blooms, though its obsession with shiny objects also leads the bird to occasionally swallow shellfish whole. With sufficient time and effort, it is possible to train this native of the south seas to mimic words from the common tongue."
msgstr "Считается, что характерный клюв яркого колибри развился благодаря его любви к нектару тропических цветов. Однако птица так падка и на блестящие предметы, что иногда проглатывает ракушки целиком. Если приложить время и усилия, уроженца южных морей можно научить повторять слова на всеобщем языке."

#. ja: 魔導デスクロー
#. de: Magitek-Todesklaue
#. fr: griffe de mort magitek
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A redesign of the Allagan “iron claw,” the magitek death claw is kept aloft by the twin rotors housed within its main trunk. While the claw's curved talons are often employed to transport military cargo, it is also deployed on the battlefield to immobilize enemy soldiers.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:156:0:0"
msgid "Magitek Death Claw"
msgstr "Магитек-коготь смерти"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Magitek-Todesklauen
#. fr: griffes de mort magitek
#. column 0: Magitek Death Claw
#. column 8: A redesign of the Allagan “iron claw,” the magitek death claw is kept aloft by the twin rotors housed within its main trunk. While the claw's curved talons are often employed to transport military cargo, it is also deployed on the battlefield to immobilize enemy soldiers.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:156:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アラグの古代兵器「アイアンクロー」を再設計した魔導兵器。胴体に内包されたツインローターによって空中を浮遊する。かぎ爪状の稼働肢によって、さまざまな物資を運搬できるほか、戦闘時には敵兵を捕縛することも可能。
#. de: Diese Weiterentwicklung der antiken allagischen Magitek-Waffe „Eisenklaue“ kann sich mithilfe des im Rumpf befindlichen Doppelrotors in die Lüfte erheben und schwere Lasten mit seinen Greifern transportieren. Allerdings wird auch dieser Apparat eher zu Kampfzwecken eingesetzt.
#. fr: Cette arme magitek n'est autre qu'une griffe de fer allagoise rénovée et améliorée. Son double système d'hélices lui permet de décoller tandis que ses griffes acérées lui permettent aussi bien de transporter des objets que de saisir un ennemi lors d'un combat.
#. column 0: Magitek Death Claw
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:156:0:8"
msgid "A redesign of the Allagan “iron claw,” the magitek death claw is kept aloft by the twin rotors housed within its main trunk. While the claw's curved talons are often employed to transport military cargo, it is also deployed on the battlefield to immobilize enemy soldiers. "
msgstr "Переделанное аллагское оружие «железный коготь». Магитек-коготь смерти держится в воздухе благодаря двум роторам в корпусе. Его изогнутые клешни часто используют для перевозки военных грузов, но на поле боя он способен обездвижить и вражеских солдат."

#. ja: リクイドフレイム
#. de: Flüssige Flamme
#. fr: flamme liquide
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: During a bid to duplicate the success of the kobolds and their cultivation of voidsent bombs, Sharlayan alchemists developed the creation of liquid flame almost by accident. Following this serendipitous event, the amorphous entity was bound to serve as an arcane guardian.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:157:0:0"
msgid "Liquid Flame"
msgstr "Жидкое пламя"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Flüssige Flammen
#. fr: flammes liquides
#. column 0: Liquid Flame
#. column 8: During a bid to duplicate the success of the kobolds and their cultivation of voidsent bombs, Sharlayan alchemists developed the creation of liquid flame almost by accident. Following this serendipitous event, the amorphous entity was bound to serve as an arcane guardian.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:157:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: シャーレアンの錬金術師が創り出した魔法生物。コボルド族が低級妖異「ボム」の培養を行っていたことを知った錬金術師が、その技術の再現を試みた際に、半ば偶然に誕生した。その後、使い魔として用いられていたらしい。
#. de: Die Goldschmiede der Sharlayaner riefen dieses magische Wesen bei dem Versuch ins Leben, eine verbesserte Variante der  Bomber, die sich die Kobolde dienbar gemacht haben, zu schaffen. Wenn der Versuch auch eher zufällig glückte, wurden die flüssigen Flammen zu hilfreichen Dienern.
#. fr: Ce sont les alchimistes sharlayanais qui ont accidentellement créé cette entité arcanique alors qu'ils voulaient simplement fabriquer un bombo. Ils avaient entendu dire que les Kobolds en étaient capables et pensaient pouvoir y arriver eux aussi. Cette créature n'était certes pas celle qu'ils pensaient créer, mais ça ne les a pas empêchés de la mettre à leur service.
#. column 0: Liquid Flame
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:157:0:8"
msgid "During a bid to duplicate the success of the kobolds and their cultivation of voidsent bombs, Sharlayan alchemists developed the creation of liquid flame almost by accident. Following this serendipitous event, the amorphous entity was bound to serve as an arcane guardian."
msgstr "Магическое существо, созданное алхимиками Шарлаяна. Узнав, что племя кобольдов выращивает низших пустотников-бомб, алхимики попытались повторить их методику — и почти случайно создали жидкое пламя. Позже его, по-видимому, использовали как фамильяра."

#. ja: シープ
#. de: Schaf
#. fr: agneau égaré
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Highlanders first domesticated sheep in the Age of Endless Frost. Seeking to increase wool yield, they began a program of selective breeding that resulted in the cloud-like appearance of the modern species. Over the years, a goodly number of sheep have been separated from their shepherds, and it is not uncommon to see wild flocks grazing the fields of La Noscea or the plains of Coerthas.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:158:0:0"
msgid "Lost Lamb"
msgstr "Заблудший ягнёнок"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Schafe
#. fr: agneaux égarés
#. column 0: Lost Lamb
#. column 8: Highlanders first domesticated sheep in the Age of Endless Frost. Seeking to increase wool yield, they began a program of selective breeding that resulted in the cloud-like appearance of the modern species. Over the years, a goodly number of sheep have been separated from their shepherds, and it is not uncommon to see wild flocks grazing the fields of La Noscea or the plains of Coerthas.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:158:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 大氷雪時代にハイランダーによって家畜化された羊。より多くの羊毛が得られるよう品種改良が重ねられた結果、綿花のように丸々と毛を蓄えるようになった。ラノシアやクルザスでは、野生化した姿を目にすることもある。
#. de: Hochländer domestizierten im Zeitalter des langen Eises eine wilde Schafsart und züchteten daraus eine neue Art mit besonders hohem Wollertrag. Nachkommen dieser runden und knuffeligen Schafsart haben wieder ihren Weg in die freie Wildbahn von La Noscea und Coerthas gefunden, wo sie in großer Zahl anzutreffen sind.
#. fr: Ces moutons ont été domestiqués par les Hyurgoths à l'époque où Éorzéa était recouverte d'un épais manteau de neige et de glace. Des croisements ont été faits sur plusieurs générations afin d'obtenir toujours plus de laine de la meilleure qualité possible. C'est pour ça qu'il ressemble aujourd'hui à de grosses boules de coton sur pattes. Certains spécimens ont retrouvé leur liberté et vivent à l'état sauvage dans la Noscea et le Coerthas.
#. column 0: Lost Lamb
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:158:0:8"
msgid "Highlanders first domesticated sheep in the Age of Endless Frost. Seeking to increase wool yield, they began a program of selective breeding that resulted in the cloud-like appearance of the modern species. Over the years, a goodly number of sheep have been separated from their shepherds, and it is not uncommon to see wild flocks grazing the fields of La Noscea or the plains of Coerthas."
msgstr "Овец впервые одомашнили горцы в Век вечного мороза. Желая получать больше шерсти, они занялись селекцией, и в итоге нынешние овцы стали похожи на пушистые облачка. Со временем многие отбились от пастухов, и теперь одичавшие стада нередко пасутся на полях Ла-Носкейи и равнинах Коэртаса."

#. ja: レターモーグリ
#. de: Mogry-Postbote
#. fr: Mog postier
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Once we saw how much we were appreciated, we knew we'd found our new calling!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:159:0:0"
msgid "Delivery Moogle"
msgstr "Почтовый мугл"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Mogry-Postboten
#. fr: Mogs postiers
#. column 0: Delivery Moogle
#. column 8: “Once we saw how much we were appreciated, we knew we'd found our new calling!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:159:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「いつの間にか、旅のミリョクの虜に<br>なってしまったクポ！<br>そこでモグは、「配達士」になったクポ！」<br>配達士：レターモーグリ
#. de: „Wenn es nach mir ginge, würde ich es mir im Wipfel einer großen Eiche bequem machen und von einer wunderschönen Mogry-Dame mit einem regenbogenfarbenen Puschel träumen, kupo!“
#. fr: “Au début, c'était pas rassurant de survoler toutes ces terres inconnues, mais je suis tombé amoureux de la vue de là-haut et j'ai décidé de continuer à livrer le courrier. C'est ainsi que je suis finalement devenu ”postier“, kupo kupo<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Delivery Moogle
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:159:0:8"
msgid "“Once we saw how much we were appreciated, we knew we'd found our new calling!”"
msgstr "«Когда мы увидели, как нас ценят, то поняли: вот оно, наше новое призвание!»"

#. ja: 魔導コロッサス
#. de: Magitek-Colossus
#. fr: colosse magitek
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The colossus is an autonomous suit of magitek armor that fuses the design of the Allagan iron giant with the mechanical mobility of the Garlean vanguard. Able to switch weapons as easily as a regular soldier, the colossus is valued for its versatility on the battlefield.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:160:0:0"
msgid "Magitek Colossus"
msgstr "Магитек-колосс"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Magitek-Colossi
#. fr: colosses magitek
#. column 0: Magitek Colossus
#. column 8: The colossus is an autonomous suit of magitek armor that fuses the design of the Allagan iron giant with the mechanical mobility of the Garlean vanguard. Able to switch weapons as easily as a regular soldier, the colossus is valued for its versatility on the battlefield.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:160:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アラグの古代兵器「鉄巨人」の設計と、魔導ヴァンガードで培った機体制御技術を融合させた無人型魔導アーマー。より人型に近いフォルムを実現したことで、武装交換が容易になるなど、格段に汎用性が増している。
#. de: Diese beeindruckende Kampfmaschine ist eine Kombination aus dem antiken allagischen Eisengiganten und dem Magitek-Frontbrecher. Die humanoide Form macht Wartungsarbeiten intuitiver und übt einen nicht unerheblichen psychologischen Effekt auf seine Gegner aus.
#. fr: Cette armure magitek sans pilote est le fruit d'un croisement entre un géant d'acier construit par les Allagois et un fuselage au programme de contrôle imaginé par les Garlemaldais pour leurs avant-gardes magitek. Son apparence humanoïde lui permet de manipuler un large éventail d'armes et d'effectuer toutes sortes de tâches.
#. column 0: Magitek Colossus
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:160:0:8"
msgid "The colossus is an autonomous suit of magitek armor that fuses the design of the Allagan iron giant with the mechanical mobility of the Garlean vanguard. Able to switch weapons as easily as a regular soldier, the colossus is valued for its versatility on the battlefield."
msgstr "Колосс — автономный магитековый доспех, сочетающий конструкцию аллагского железного гиганта с подвижностью гарлеанского авангарда. Он может менять оружие не хуже обычного солдата, и эта универсальность делает его ценным бойцом на поле боя."

#. ja: ストリックス
#. de: Strix
#. fr: Strix
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A guardian bound to the Rare Tomes Room, the highest floor of the Great Gubal Library. Similar to skatenes, Strix is an owl which has been enchanted with heightened intelligence. Strix's comparatively vast intellect, however, grants the creature command over spells of formidable potency.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:161:0:0"
msgid "Strix"
msgstr "Стрикс"

