msgstr "0"

#. ja: グブラ幻想図書館の最上層に位置する「稀覯書庫」にて、番人を務めていた使い魔。基本的にはスカネテと同様に、魔法によって知恵を与えたフクロウである。しかし、その知識量はすさまじく、高位魔法をも使いこなす。
#. de: Der Aufpasser in der Abteilung für seltene Schriften im obersten Stock der Großen Gubal-Bibliothek war einst eine gewöhnliche Eule, die ähnlich wie die Skatenen auf magischem Wege mit Verstand ausgestattet wurde. Strix reagierte besonders gut auf den Intelligenzzauber und lernte sogar komplizierte Zaubersprüche zu beherrschen.
#. fr: Cette créature garde la section interdite au sommet de la Grande bibliothèque de Gubal. Tout comme les skate'nes, cette chouette dispose de con<shy>nais<shy>san<shy>ces en magie, mais les siennes sont si vastes qu'elle peut utiliser des sorts bien plus puissants.
#. column 0: Strix
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:161:0:8"
msgid "A guardian bound to the Rare Tomes Room, the highest floor of the Great Gubal Library. Similar to skatenes, Strix is an owl which has been enchanted with heightened intelligence. Strix's comparatively vast intellect, however, grants the creature command over spells of formidable potency."
msgstr "Стрикс — фамильяр, охранявший Зал редких книг на верхнем этаже Большой библиотеки Губала. Как и скатены, он представляет собой сову, чей разум усилили магией. Однако интеллект Стрикса куда выше, и он владеет чрезвычайно мощными заклинаниями."

#. ja: 晴嵐のトゾル・ファトトル
#. de: Tozol Huatotl
#. fr: Tozol Huatotl
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Tozol is of the Huatotl bloodline─one of the four great Ixali families said to be descended from the “Skysent.” Numbered among the few ritualists capable of performing the rites of primal summoning, Tozol attempted to call forth the capricious Garuda in the stronghold of Xelphatol.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:162:0:0"
msgid "Tozol Huatotl"
msgstr "Тозол Хуатотль"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Tozol Huatotl
#. column 0: Tozol Huatotl
#. column 8: Tozol is of the Huatotl bloodline─one of the four great Ixali families said to be descended from the “Skysent.” Numbered among the few ritualists capable of performing the rites of primal summoning, Tozol attempted to call forth the capricious Garuda in the stronghold of Xelphatol.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:162:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: イクサル族社会に君臨する四つの有力家系「天下りし者」のひとつ、ファトトル家直系の人物。神降ろしの儀式を執り行うことができる、数少ない高位司祭のひとりであり、ゼルファトルにてガルーダ召喚を試みていた。
#. de: Tozol gehört einem der vier herrschenden Ixal-Clans an und ist als Hohepriester einer der ganz wenigen, der eine Primae-Beschwörung durchführen kann. Er war es auch, der Garuda in Xelphatol anrief.
#. fr: Le sang des Huatotl coule dans les veines de cette créature, que les Ixali considèrent comme l'un des quatre guides descendus des cieux pour leur montrer le chemin. Il est l'un des rares à pouvoir officier dans leur cérémonie et a déjà tenté d'invoquer Garuda à Xelphatol.
#. column 0: Tozol Huatotl
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:162:0:8"
msgid "Tozol is of the Huatotl bloodline─one of the four great Ixali families said to be descended from the “Skysent.” Numbered among the few ritualists capable of performing the rites of primal summoning, Tozol attempted to call forth the capricious Garuda in the stronghold of Xelphatol."
msgstr "Тозол принадлежит к роду Уатотль — одной из четырёх великих семей иксалей, которые, как говорят, произошли от «посланных с небес». Он входит в число немногих жрецов, способных проводить обряд призыва праймала. Именно Тозол попытался призвать капризную Гаруду в крепости Кселфатола."

#. ja: アレキサンダー・プライム
#. de: Prim-Alexander
#. fr: Primo-Alexander
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Alexander Prime served as the last line of defense for the mechanical primal's innermost core. As an integral element of the core's central control system, Alexander Prime exhibited a limited ability to manipulate temporal reality, and sought to smite intruders with its divine judgment.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:163:0:0"
msgid "Alexander Prime"
msgstr "Александр Прайм"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Primo-Alexander
#. column 0: Alexander Prime
#. column 8: Alexander Prime served as the last line of defense for the mechanical primal's innermost core. As an integral element of the core's central control system, Alexander Prime exhibited a limited ability to manipulate temporal reality, and sought to smite intruders with its divine judgment.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:163:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 機工城「アレキサンダー」の真なるコアを防衛していた「最後の砦」。コアの制御を行う中枢機関の一部でもあるため、限定的ながら時間操作も可能とする。理想郷に仇成す存在には、「聖なる審判」を下すという。
#. de: Die letzte Schutzvorrichtung im Kern von Alexander ist Teil des innersten Mechanismus und als solche sogar in der Lage, den Fluss der Zeit zu ändern. Manche sagen, dass sein „heiliges Urteil“ Zugang zum „Paradies“ verschafft.
#. fr: Il s'agit du dernier rempart qui protège le cœur du géant mécanique. Il fait d'ailleurs partie des éléments qui y ont accès et peut donc permettre d'en prendre temporairement le contrôle. On raconte à Idyllée qu'il fera s'abattre le Jugement divin d'Alexander sur ceux qui oseront menacer les habitants de la région.
#. column 0: Alexander Prime
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:163:0:8"
msgid "Alexander Prime served as the last line of defense for the mechanical primal's innermost core. As an integral element of the core's central control system, Alexander Prime exhibited a limited ability to manipulate temporal reality, and sought to smite intruders with its divine judgment."
msgstr "Прайм-Александр был последним рубежом обороны перед сокровенным ядром механического праймала. Как часть центральной системы управления ядром, он мог в ограниченной степени управлять временем и стремился поразить незваных гостей божественным судом."

#. ja: 気さくな三兄弟
#. de: Brendt, Brennan & Bremondt
#. fr: Brendt, Brennan & Bremondt
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Become the sort of storied personage I can brag about havin' met, an' I'll consider us square.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:164:0:0"
msgid "Brendt, Brennan, & Bremondt"
msgstr "Брент, Бреннан и Бремондт"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Brendt, Brennan & Bremondt
#. column 0: Brendt, Brennan, & Bremondt
#. column 8: “Become the sort of storied personage I can brag about havin' met, an' I'll consider us square.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:164:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「お前さんと出会ったことが俺の自慢になるように<br>立派な冒険者になっておくれよ！」<br>気さくな三兄弟：ブレモンダ／ブレモンデ／ブレモンド
#. de: „Dass du ein großer Held wirst und ich dann allen erzählen kann, dass wir uns kennen! Na, wie klingt das?“
#. fr: “Ah, c'est toi<nbsp>! J'racontais juste à mes frères la fois où des Amalj'aa m'ont sauvé des lames de cuivre. <switch $gn70><case>Dur à croire, je sais, mais c'est la vérité<nbsp>!<case>Dur à croire, je sais, mais c'est la vérité<nbsp>!<case>T'étais avec moi, tu t'souviens<nbsp>?</switch>”<br>“<switch $gn70><case>Tu peux pas imaginer comme je suis fier de t'avoir rencontré<if $gn4>e</if> à tes débuts. Dès l'instant où je t'ai vu<if $gn4>e</if>, j'ai tout de suite su que tu étais voué<if $gn4>e</if> à un avenir brillant.<case>Tu as débuté comme un<if $gn4>e</if> simple <if $gn4>aventurière<else>aventurier</if>, et maintenant tu es <if $gn4>l'héroïne<else>le héros</if> du peuple. Quel bel exemple de réussite<nbsp>!<case>Tu as débuté comme un<if $gn4>e</if> simple <if $gn4>aventurière<else>aventurier</if>, et maintenant tu es <if $gn4>l'héroïne<else>le héros</if> du peuple. Quel bel exemple de réussite<nbsp>!</switch>”<br>“Je suis sûr que l'ère qui arrive sera bénéfique pour le commerce comme pour Éorzéa. Je suis content de t'avoir rencontré<if $gn4>e</if>, <switch $gn70><case>tu sais.<case> tu sais.<case> et à tes débuts en plus<nbsp>!</switch>”
#. column 0: Brendt, Brennan, & Bremondt
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:164:0:8"
msgid "“Become the sort of storied personage I can brag about havin' met, an' I'll consider us square.”"
msgstr "«Стань таким прославленным героем, чтобы я мог хвастаться знакомством с тобой, и будем квиты»"

#. ja: サンクレッド（蒼天）
#. de: Thancred (Heavensward)
#. fr: Thancred (Heavensward)
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “If nothing else, you might have warned me that I would emerge from the Lifestream in the altogether.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:165:0:0"
msgid "Heavensward Thancred"
msgstr "Танкрет (Heavensward)"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Thancred (Heavensward)
#. column 0: Heavensward Thancred
#. column 8: “If nothing else, you might have warned me that I would emerge from the Lifestream in the altogether.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:165:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「削った黒曜石をナイフ代わりに、<br>魔物を仕留めて肉と皮を手に入れる、<br>正にサバイバル生活……」<br>暁の血盟：サンクレッド
#. de: „Ein Obsidiansplitter diente mir als Messer, mit dem ich auf die Jagd nach Fleisch und Fellen ging. Es war ein harter Kampf ums Überleben, sag ich euch.“
#. fr: “J'ai été obligé de chasser des monstres pour me vêtir et me nourrir, armé uniquement d'un éclat d'obsidienne<nbsp>! Vous vous rendez compte<nbsp>!?”
#. column 0: Heavensward Thancred
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:165:0:8"
msgid "“If nothing else, you might have warned me that I would emerge from the Lifestream in the altogether.”"
msgstr "«Пришлось охотиться на чудовищ, чтобы добыть мясо и шкуры. А ножом мне служил обломок обсидиана. Вот это была жизнь на выживание...»"

#. ja: ヤ・シュトラ（蒼天）
#. de: Y'shtola (Heavensward)
#. fr: Y'shtola (Heavensward)
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “If the Ascians will go to any lengths to resurrect their god, then we must needs be as committed to our cause─to unmask them and their schemes, and to crush them both utterly.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:166:0:0"
msgid "Heavensward Y'shtola"
msgstr "Я'штола (Heavensward)"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Y'shtola (Heavensward)
#. column 0: Heavensward Y'shtola
#. column 8: “If the Ascians will go to any lengths to resurrect their god, then we must needs be as committed to our cause─to unmask them and their schemes, and to crush them both utterly.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:166:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「あらゆる戦いを超えて、<br>マトーヤが求めた「世界の真理」を、<br>マトーヤよりも遠くまで視るために……」<br>暁の血盟：ヤ・シュトラ
#. de: „Ich werde auf jeden Fall weitermachen. Um am Ende das zu erblicken, was Matoya suchte: die Wahrheit über diese Welt ... und noch mehr.“
#. fr: “Quoi qu'il arrive, nous ne devons pas relâcher nos efforts. Matoya nous a déjà beaucoup aidés, mais elle ne sera pas à nos côtés éter<shy>nel<shy>le<shy>ment. Si nous voulons qu'elle soit fière de nous, nous devons poursuivre son œuvre et lever le voile des apparences qui recouvre la vérité profonde de notre monde.”
#. column 0: Heavensward Y'shtola
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:166:0:8"
msgid "“If the Ascians will go to any lengths to resurrect their god, then we must needs be as committed to our cause─to unmask them and their schemes, and to crush them both utterly.”"
msgstr "«Если асцианы готовы на всё, чтобы воскресить своего бога, мы должны с той же решимостью взяться за своё дело: разоблачить их и их замыслы, а затем уничтожить и тех и других»."

#. ja: ネール・ヴァン・ダーナス
#. de: Nael van Darnus
#. fr: Nael van Darnus
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “The hour of cleansing is at hand—by my searing light shall the world be purged of its taint.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:167:0:0"
msgid "Nael van Darnus"
msgstr "Наэль ван Дарнус"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Nael van Darnus
#. column 0: Nael van Darnus
#. column 8: “The hour of cleansing is at hand—by my searing light shall the world be purged of its taint.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:167:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「浄化の時は近い……余の招きし美しき光が、<br>すべての穢れを焼き尽くさん」<br>第VII軍団軍団長：ネール・ヴァン・ダーナス
#. de: „Die Zeit der Läuterung ist nah ... Ich bringe euch das Licht, das die Sünde aus euren Seelen brennen wird.“
#. fr: “Le temps de la purification est proche. Le monde sera purifié de sa souillure par ma lumière sacrée.”
#. column 0: Nael van Darnus
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:167:0:8"
msgid "“The hour of cleansing is at hand—by my searing light shall the world be purged of its taint.”"
msgstr "«Час очищения близок — мой испепеляющий свет смоет всю скверну с мира»."

#. ja: ソフィア
#. de: Sophia
#. fr: Sophia
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: One of the three eikons who comprise the Warring Triad. Summoned by the diverse peoples of an ancient Meracydian nation, the “Goddess,” as she was simply known, was revered as an entity of enlightenment. Legends tell that Sophia brought together tribes of disparate form by imbuing their souls with a transcendent understanding of balance and harmony.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:168:0:0"
msgid "Sophia"
msgstr "София"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Sophia
#. column 0: Sophia
#. column 8: One of the three eikons who comprise the Warring Triad. Summoned by the diverse peoples of an ancient Meracydian nation, the “Goddess,” as she was simply known, was revered as an entity of enlightenment. Legends tell that Sophia brought together tribes of disparate form by imbuing their souls with a transcendent understanding of balance and harmony.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:168:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「三闘神」の一柱。メラシディアに存在した多民族国家において信仰されていた、叡智を司る神らしい。異なる姿形の諸種族をまとめあげるために、「均衡」と「調和」という叡智を人々の心魂に吹き込んだという神話が残る。
#. de: Eine der drei Ikonen der Kriegstriade. Sophia wurde von den vielfältigen Völkern des südlichen Kontinents Meracydia verehrt als Göttin, die Streitigkeiten schlichtet und für ausgleichende Gerechtigkeit zwischen den Völkern sorgt.
#. fr: Cette divinité de la Triade guerrière était célébrée dans la cité cosmopolite de Méracydia. La population pensait que sa déesse de la sagesse avait insufflé “équilibre” et “harmonie” dans le cœur des hommes afin que les membres de cette communauté aux multiples visages puissent vivre en paix.
#. column 0: Sophia
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:168:0:8"
msgid "One of the three eikons who comprise the Warring Triad. Summoned by the diverse peoples of an ancient Meracydian nation, the “Goddess,” as she was simply known, was revered as an entity of enlightenment. Legends tell that Sophia brought together tribes of disparate form by imbuing their souls with a transcendent understanding of balance and harmony."
msgstr "Одна из трёх эйконов Воюющей Триады. Её призвали многочисленные народы древнего государства Мерасидии. Софию почитали как богиню мудрости и просветления. Согласно легендам, она объединила племена, столь непохожие друг на друга, вложив в их души высшее понимание равновесия и гармонии."

#. ja: オポオポ
#. de: Opo-Opo
#. fr: opo-opo
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: These monkey-like beastkin are found inhabiting densely forested regions, with each colony consisting of several dozen individuals led by a single alpha. Possessed of long tails and opposable thumbs, opo-opos are often seen leaping nimbly from tree branch to tree branch in search of fruit─their favored food. In recent years, however, several colonies have discovered a taste for beans, leaving many a farmer cursing over their plundered fields.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:169:0:0"
msgid "Opo-opo"
msgstr "Опо-опо"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Opo-Opos
#. fr: opo-opo
#. column 0: Opo-opo
#. column 8: These monkey-like beastkin are found inhabiting densely forested regions, with each colony consisting of several dozen individuals led by a single alpha. Possessed of long tails and opposable thumbs, opo-opos are often seen leaping nimbly from tree branch to tree branch in search of fruit─their favored food. In recent years, however, several colonies have discovered a taste for beans, leaving many a farmer cursing over their plundered fields.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:169:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 森林地帯に棲息する猿。ボスを中心に数十頭からなるコロニーを築く。長い尾や拇指対向性のある手を使い、普段は巧みに木々の間を移動する。主食の木の実を集めるが、近年は豆の味を覚えてしまい、畑を荒らすことも増えてきた。
#. de: Diese affenartigen Wesen sind in Waldgebieten heimisch, wo sie sich um Anführer scharen und Gruppen bilden. Mithilfe ihrer langen Schwänze und scharfen Krallen bewegen sie sich sicher zwischen den Baumkronen. Neben Früchten sind sie leider auch auf den Geschmack von Bohnen gekommen und verwüsten immer öfter die Felder.
#. fr: Organisées sous la coupe d'un meneur, ces colonies de singes peuvent compter jusqu'à plusieurs dizaines d'individus et n'occupent que les plus vastes forêts. Leurs pouces opposables sont leurs plus gros atouts. Grâce à eux, ils peuvent se balancer de branche en branche et cueillir les fruits dont ils raffolent. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, voilà quelques années qu'ils ont pris goût aux haricots et profitent de leur agilité pour piller sans vergogne les récoltes des fermiers.
#. column 0: Opo-opo
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:169:0:8"
msgid "These monkey-like beastkin are found inhabiting densely forested regions, with each colony consisting of several dozen individuals led by a single alpha. Possessed of long tails and opposable thumbs, opo-opos are often seen leaping nimbly from tree branch to tree branch in search of fruit─their favored food. In recent years, however, several colonies have discovered a taste for beans, leaving many a farmer cursing over their plundered fields."
msgstr "Эти похожие на обезьян зверолюди обитают в густых лесах. Каждая их колония насчитывает несколько десятков особей во главе с вожаком. Длинный хвост и хватательные пальцы помогают опо-опо ловко перепрыгивать с ветки на ветку в поисках любимых фруктов. Однако в последние годы некоторые колонии распробовали бобы — и теперь немало фермеров проклинают опустошённые поля."

#. ja: アダマンタス
#. de: Adaman-Taimai
#. fr: adamankhélone
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Native to the Near Eastern island of Thavnair, adamantoises were introduced to Eorzea towards the end of the Sixth Astral Era. Dodo eggs were commonly imported for feast days, and it was to one of these shipments that a batch of adamantoise eggs was mistakenly added. A number of the creatures hatched and fled into the wild, where they established themselves in the local ecosystems. In Gridania, the question of the adamantoise's place in the natural order is yet debated with some fervor.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:170:0:0"
msgid "Adamantoise"
msgstr "Адамантойс"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Adaman-Taimai
#. fr: adamankhélones
#. column 0: Adamantoise
#. column 8: Native to the Near Eastern island of Thavnair, adamantoises were introduced to Eorzea towards the end of the Sixth Astral Era. Dodo eggs were commonly imported for feast days, and it was to one of these shipments that a batch of adamantoise eggs was mistakenly added. A number of the creatures hatched and fled into the wild, where they established themselves in the local ecosystems. In Gridania, the question of the adamantoise's place in the natural order is yet debated with some fervor.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:170:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: サベネア島原産の巨大陸亀。第六星暦末期に祝祭用に輸入された「ドードーの卵」の中に、アダマンタスのものが混入。その一部が孵化して野生化してしまった。グリダニアでは、森の一部と認めるべきか、論争が尽きない。
#. de: Diese Riesenschildkröten stammen ursprünglich von der Insel Thavnair. Ende der Sechsten Ära des Lichts wurden aus festlichem Anlass von den östlichen Inseln Dodo-Eier eingeführt, unter die allerdings auch ein paar Exemplare dieser Schildkröte gemischt waren. Sie wurden in Gridania heimisch, doch die Aus<shy>einander<shy>set<shy>zungen, ob sie als Teil des Finsterwaldes anerkannt werden sollten, nehmen kein Ende.
#. fr: Cette tortue est originaire de l'île proche-orientale de Thavnair. Autrefois absente de celle-ci, cette espèce s'y est établie lors de la 6e ère astrale quand des visiteurs y apportèrent pour un festival une cargaison d'œufs de dodo, avec cachés parmi eux quelques œufs d'adamankhélone. Quant à savoir si leur carapace devrait compter comme une étendue forestière ou non, les naturalistes de Gridania ne sont toujours pas arrivés à un consensus.
#. column 0: Adamantoise
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:170:0:8"
msgid "Native to the Near Eastern island of Thavnair, adamantoises were introduced to Eorzea towards the end of the Sixth Astral Era. Dodo eggs were commonly imported for feast days, and it was to one of these shipments that a batch of adamantoise eggs was mistakenly added. A number of the creatures hatched and fled into the wild, where they established themselves in the local ecosystems. In Gridania, the question of the adamantoise's place in the natural order is yet debated with some fervor. "
msgstr "Адамантойсы родом с острова Тавнаир на Ближнем Востоке. В конце Шестой астральной эры их завезли в Эорзею. К праздничным дням часто доставляли яйца додо, и однажды в такую партию по ошибке попали яйца адамантойсов. Вылупившиеся черепахи разбежались по окрестностям и прижились в местной природе. В Гридании до сих пор жарко спорят, какое место адамантойсам отведено в естественном порядке вещей."

#. ja: 魔導ヴァンガード
#. de: Magitek-Frontbrecher
#. fr: avant-garde magitek
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The main duty of the autonomous vanguard is to put its cermet drills to work boring through castle gates and defensive bulwarks. True to its name, the vanguard is also employed as an advance troop unit, as well as fulfilling the role of base sentinel by destroying enemy siege weaponry. Heavy infantry variations with enhanced armor and shock troop units with increased mobility are also known to exist.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:171:0:0"
msgid "Magitek Vanguard"
msgstr "Магитех-авангард"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Magitek-Frontbrecher
#. fr: avant-gardes magitek
#. column 0: Magitek Vanguard
#. column 8: The main duty of the autonomous vanguard is to put its cermet drills to work boring through castle gates and defensive bulwarks. True to its name, the vanguard is also employed as an advance troop unit, as well as fulfilling the role of base sentinel by destroying enemy siege weaponry. Heavy infantry variations with enhanced armor and shock troop units with increased mobility are also known to exist.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:171:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: サーメット製ドリルによる城門・防壁の破砕を主任務とする無人型魔導アーマー。文字通り先兵として運用される他、攻城兵器対策として拠点防衛にも用いられる。装甲を強化した重装型、機動性を増した強襲型などが存在。
#. de: Diese Kampfmaschine wurde dazu konzipiert, mithilfe ihres Cermet-Bohrarms jegliche Mauern und Tore zu durchbrechen. Sie werden bei Angriffen in der Vorhut eingesetzt und kommen auch bei der Verteidigung zum Einsatz, um gegnerische Belagerungswaffen unschädlich zu machen. Es existieren auch besonders stark gepanzerte sowie besonders bewegliche Versionen.
#. fr: Cette armure magitek sans pilote a été conçue afin de briser les défenses ennemies en étant intégrée aux premières lignes. Portes blindées ou remparts, rien ne lui résiste grâce à sa foreuse en cermet. Elle peut aussi être utilisée en guise de protection lors des assauts et être équipée de plaques de blindage ou sacrifier ces dernières pour maximiser ses capacités offensives. Cette modularité en fait d'elle une arme multifonction que tout soldat garlemaldais rêve d'avoir à ses côtés.
#. column 0: Magitek Vanguard
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:171:0:8"
msgid "The main duty of the autonomous vanguard is to put its cermet drills to work boring through castle gates and defensive bulwarks. True to its name, the vanguard is also employed as an advance troop unit, as well as fulfilling the role of base sentinel by destroying enemy siege weaponry. Heavy infantry variations with enhanced armor and shock troop units with increased mobility are also known to exist."
msgstr "Главная задача автономного авангарда — пробивать ворота и укрепления церметовыми бурами. Как и следует из названия, его используют в передовых отрядах, а также для защиты баз: он уничтожает вражеские осадные орудия. Существуют и тяжёлые модели с усиленной бронёй, и штурмовые — с повышенной манёвренностью."

#. ja: 魔導ガンシップ
#. de: Magitek-Kanonenschiff
#. fr: vaisseau magitek
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: This compact airship was developed by the imperial army for ground suppression initiatives, as well as non-combat tasks which utilize its auxiliary limbs. Also capable of transporting small squads, magitek gunships are assigned to a wide range of units, from engineering corps to troop deployment details.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:172:0:0"
msgid "Magitek Gunship"
msgstr "Магитех-ганшип"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Magitek-Kanonenschiffe
#. fr: vaisseaux magitek
#. column 0: Magitek Gunship
#. column 8: This compact airship was developed by the imperial army for ground suppression initiatives, as well as non-combat tasks which utilize its auxiliary limbs. Also capable of transporting small squads, magitek gunships are assigned to a wide range of units, from engineering corps to troop deployment details.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:172:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ガレマール帝国軍の小型戦闘飛空艇。対地制圧任務に用いられるほか、補助クローアームを活かした作業にも利用される。数名程度なら兵員を輸送することも可能で、工兵隊から輸送隊に至るまで、さまざまな部隊に配備されている。
#. de: Ein waffenstarrendes Luftschiff der garleischen Invasionsstreitkräfte. Es wird zur Unterdrückung gegnerischer Bodentruppen eingesetzt und kann dank seines Greifarms auch Rettungsmissionen durchführen. Manchmal setzt es auch kleine Trupps hinter feindlichen Linien ab.
#. fr: Cet aéronef militaire garlemaldais de petite taille est spécialisé dans les missions d'attaque au sol et dispose de bras mécaniques utiles dans un large éventail de situations. Il peut aussi transporter du matériel ou une poignée de soldats à l'intérieur de sa cuirasse, faisant de lui un appareil très versatile qui complémente de nombreux bataillons.
#. column 0: Magitek Gunship
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:172:0:8"
msgid "This compact airship was developed by the imperial army for ground suppression initiatives, as well as non-combat tasks which utilize its auxiliary limbs. Also capable of transporting small squads, magitek gunships are assigned to a wide range of units, from engineering corps to troop deployment details."
msgstr "Этот компактный дирижабль создан имперской армией для подавления наземных сил и выполнения задач, где пригодятся его вспомогательные манипуляторы. Он может перевозить небольшие отряды и служит в самых разных подразделениях — от инженерных корпусов до транспортных частей."

#. ja: バニー
#. de: Goldhäschen
#. fr: Abbelina
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “You look lost, honey. Why don't I show you around?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:173:0:0"
msgid "Gold Saucer Attendant"
msgstr "Служительница Золотого блюдца"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Goldhäschen
#. fr: Abbelina
#. column 0: Gold Saucer Attendant
#. column 8: “You look lost, honey. Why don't I show you around?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:173:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「ゴールドソーサーへようこそ。<br>あなたも、ステキな夢の世界を楽しんでね！」<br>マンダヴィル・ゴールドソーサー：バニー
#. de: „Hast du dich verlaufen, Süßer? Komm, ich zeig dir alles.“
#. fr: “Bienvenue au Gold Saucer. Ici, tous vos rêves peuvent devenir réalité<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Gold Saucer Attendant
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:173:0:8"
msgid "“You look lost, honey. Why don't I show you around?”"
msgstr "«Заблудился, милый? Давай я тебе всё покажу»."

#. ja: ラーヴァスコーピオン
#. de: Lavaskorpion
#. fr: scorpion de lave
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A creature of living lava, this hulking nightmare lurked in the pools of magma hidden within the heart of Sohm Al. When the dragons were no longer present to keep the scorpion in check, the ancient menace resurfaced and began agitating the mountain's volcanic core with its wild thrashing.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:174:0:0"
msgid "Lava Scorpion"
msgstr "Лавовый скорпион"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Lavaskorpione
#. fr: scorpions de lave
#. column 0: Lava Scorpion
#. column 8: A creature of living lava, this hulking nightmare lurked in the pools of magma hidden within the heart of Sohm Al. When the dragons were no longer present to keep the scorpion in check, the ancient menace resurfaced and began agitating the mountain's volcanic core with its wild thrashing.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:174:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 霊峰「ソーム・アル」中心部にあるマグマ溜まりに棲息していた大型溶岩生物。ドラゴン族の魔力により封じられていたが、守り手不在の状況で目覚め、暴れ出したらしい。この存在により、霊峰の火山活動が活発化していた。
#. de: Diese von Kristallen ummantelten Wesen leben in der Lava im Zentrum des Bergmassivs Sohm Al. Lange Zeit von der Magie der Drachen im Zaum gehalten, sind sie nun in Abwesenheit ihrer einstigen Wächter umso wilder. Mit der Zunahme ihrer Aktivität hat auch die vulkanische Aktivität im Bergmassiv zugenommen.
#. fr: Les scorpions de lave habitent les piscines de magma du cœur de Sohm Al. Le nombre de ces arachnides, autrefois limité par la magie des dragons, augmente récemment petit à petit, et plus ils grouillent sous la montagne, plus celle-ci se met à gronder.
#. column 0: Lava Scorpion
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:174:0:8"
msgid "A creature of living lava, this hulking nightmare lurked in the pools of magma hidden within the heart of Sohm Al. When the dragons were no longer present to keep the scorpion in check, the ancient menace resurfaced and began agitating the mountain's volcanic core with its wild thrashing. "
msgstr "Эта громадная тварь, сотканная из живой лавы, таилась в магматических озёрах в сердце Сом Аль. Пока драконы держали скорпиона в узде, он не показывался. Но древняя угроза пробудилась, когда драконы исчезли, и принялась бесчинствовать, тревожа вулканическое жерло горы."

#. ja: 魔導プレデター
#. de: Magitek-Prädator
#. fr: prédateur magitek
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The most recent model in the Empire's line of piloted magitek armor. Though based on the reaper design, the predator has been outfitted with bladed arms to improve its close-quarter combat capabilities and also features simplified armor plating for enhanced mobility.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:175:0:0"
msgid "Magitek Predator"
msgstr "Магитех-хищник"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Magitek-Prädatoren
#. fr: prédateurs magitek
#. column 0: Magitek Predator
#. column 8: The most recent model in the Empire's line of piloted magitek armor. Though based on the reaper design, the predator has been outfitted with bladed arms to improve its close-quarter combat capabilities and also features simplified armor plating for enhanced mobility.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:175:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ガレマール帝国軍が開発した最新鋭の騎乗型魔導アーマー。「リーパー」を原形としながらも、近接戦闘能力を増すために格闘アームを追加している。また、生産性を向上するため、装甲形状が簡略化されているのも特徴のひとつ。
#. de: Die allerneueste Magitek-Kampfrüstung der Garlear. Das Schnitter-Design wurde mit einem Kampfarm für den Nahkampf verstärkt. Um größere Stückzahlen produzieren zu können, wurde die Form der Panzerung bei diesem Modell vereinfacht.
#. fr: Ce véhicule est le nec plus ultra de l'armure magitek impériale. Les ingénieurs garlemaldais se sont basés sur le modèle éprouvé de la faucheuse magitek et l'ont dotée d'une cuirasse renforcée pour des capacités de combat au corps à corps accrues. De plus, la structure simplifiée de son blindage a permis d'accroître les capacités de production sans aucune concession.
#. column 0: Magitek Predator
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:175:0:8"
msgid "The most recent model in the Empire's line of piloted magitek armor. Though based on the reaper design, the predator has been outfitted with bladed arms to improve its close-quarter combat capabilities and also features simplified armor plating for enhanced mobility."
msgstr "Новейшая модель пилотируемой магитех-брони Империи. За основу взята конструкция жнеца, но для ближнего боя хищника оснастили клинковыми манипуляторами. Упрощённая броня позволяет ему двигаться быстрее."

#. ja: 魔導スカイアーマー
#. de: Magitek-Himmelspanzer
#. fr: armure aérienne magitek
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: An airborne unit constructed to accommodate a single pilot, sky armor is designed for maximum maneuverability. Previous flying models such as the juggernaut have, by necessity, been built on an enormous scale, but by implementing the advances made in the invention of the reaper, imperial engineers have succeeded in creating significantly smaller vessels.
#, aeria-term-model-exception: Armor e111a2c58263
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:176:0:0"
msgid "Magitek Sky Armor"
msgstr "Магитех-скайармор"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Magitek-Himmelspanzer
#. fr: armures aériennes magitek
#. column 0: Magitek Sky Armor
#. column 8: An airborne unit constructed to accommodate a single pilot, sky armor is designed for maximum maneuverability. Previous flying models such as the juggernaut have, by necessity, been built on an enormous scale, but by implementing the advances made in the invention of the reaper, imperial engineers have succeeded in creating significantly smaller vessels.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:176:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ガレマール帝国軍の単座式スカイアーマー。これまで飛行型魔導アーマーは、「ジャガーノート」など大型のものが多かったが、「リーパー」の技術を応用することで大幅に小型化することに成功。小回りの利く機体として完成した。
#. de: Dieser einsitzige Himmelspanzer der garleischen Streitkräfte ist wegen seiner Wendigkeit gefürchtet. Bisherige fliegende Magitek-Kampf<shy>maschinen wie der Schlachtkreuzer waren sehr groß, doch mit der Schnitter-Technologie gelang den Garlearn die Herstellung dieses kompakten Modells.
#. fr: Une armure aérienne monoplace. Les armures aériennes magitek comme le juggernaut étaient jusqu'à maintenant pour la plupart imposantes et nécessitaient plusieurs soldats pour les piloter. Cependant, grâce aux avancées technologiques réalisées lors de la conception de la faucheuse magitek, l'empire de Garlemald a rapidement pu lancer la production de ce modèle miniaturisé à la manœuvrabilité accrue.
#. column 0: Magitek Sky Armor
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:176:0:8"
msgid "An airborne unit constructed to accommodate a single pilot, sky armor is designed for maximum maneuverability. Previous flying models such as the juggernaut have, by necessity, been built on an enormous scale, but by implementing the advances made in the invention of the reaper, imperial engineers have succeeded in creating significantly smaller vessels."
msgstr "Этот летательный аппарат рассчитан на одного пилота и создан для максимальной манёвренности. Предыдущие модели, например джаггернаут, из-за особенностей конструкции были огромны. Но имперским инженерам удалось применить достижения, полученные при разработке жнеца, и значительно уменьшить размер машины."

#. ja: 鉄仮面
#. de: Der Greif
#. fr: Le Griffon
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “You say no mortal should wield these eyes? Then I shall gladly become a demon! I will suckle on the souls of the hopeless, and liberate the homeland they no longer deserve!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:177:0:0"
msgid "The Griffin"
msgstr "Грифон"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Le Griffon
#. column 0: The Griffin
#. column 8: “You say no mortal should wield these eyes? Then I shall gladly become a demon! I will suckle on the souls of the hopeless, and liberate the homeland they no longer deserve!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:177:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「この化け物の「眼」が、人に扱えぬというのなら、<br>喜んで「鬼」にでもなってみせよう！」<br>鉄仮面：イルベルド
#. de: „Wenn die Kraft in diesen Augen nicht für Sterbliche ist ... dann muss ich meine sterbliche Seele eben aufgeben! Was soll's! Lieber ein Ungeheuer als ein Leben in Schmach und Schande!“
#. fr: “Si un humain ne peut résister à la puissance de ces Yeux, alors je suis prêt à me transformer en monstre pour jouir de leur pouvoir<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: The Griffin
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:177:0:8"
msgid "“You say no mortal should wield these eyes? Then I shall gladly become a demon! I will suckle on the souls of the hopeless, and liberate the homeland they no longer deserve!”"
msgstr "«Говорите, смертным нельзя пользоваться этими глазами? Тогда я с радостью стану демоном! Я буду питаться душами отчаявшихся и освобожу родину, которой они больше не достойны!»"

#. ja: ローランド
#. de: Roland
#. fr: Roland
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Something tells me you understand that which I have told you─that you, perchance, share a similar dream.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:178:0:0"
msgid "Roland"
msgstr "Роланд"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Roland
#. column 0: Roland
#. column 8: “Something tells me you understand that which I have told you─that you, perchance, share a similar dream.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:178:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「……そう、ここは全ての者が「自由」を手にして、<br>一時の娯楽に心をひたし、明日への活力を得るための場所」<br>マンダヴィル・ゴールドソーサー副支配人：ローランド
#. de: „Ich bin mir sicher, dass auch du verstehst, wovon ich rede. Aber ich möchte dich nicht länger aufhalten. Der Gold Saucer und all seine Wunder warten auf dich.“
#. fr: “Vous l'aurez compris<nbsp>: l'oppression n'existe pas ici. Tout le monde est libre. À vous de vous ressourcer dans ce temple du divertissement avant de vous jeter à corps perdu dans les batailles de demain.”
#. column 0: Roland
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:178:0:8"
msgid "“Something tells me you understand that which I have told you─that you, perchance, share a similar dream.”"
msgstr "«Что-то мне подсказывает, что ты понимаешь мои слова... Может, и мечта у нас с тобой одна?»"

#. ja: ディアボロス・ホロー
#. de: Nihil-Diabolos
#. fr: Diabolos nihil
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: By absorbing the power of Scathach, Diabolos's own might was enhanced by an order of magnitude. Encased in armor of hardened shadow, and commanding ruinous new magicks, the master of nightmare boasted a strength to rival the greatest entities of the voidsent hierarchy.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:179:0:0"
msgid "Diabolos Hollow"
msgstr "Пустотный Диаболос"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Diabolos nihil
#. column 0: Diabolos Hollow
#. column 8: By absorbing the power of Scathach, Diabolos's own might was enhanced by an order of magnitude. Encased in armor of hardened shadow, and commanding ruinous new magicks, the master of nightmare boasted a strength to rival the greatest entities of the voidsent hierarchy.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:179:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 影の女王「スカアハ」の力を吸収し、さらなる力を得た妖異ディアボロス。硬質化させた影で、全身をよろっているほか、影の手を翼状に展開して飛翔能力を強化している。その力は、妖異十二階位の第一位にも匹敵するだろう。
#. de: Diabolos hat die Kraft der Schattenkönigin Scathach in sich aufgenommen und ist noch mächtiger geworden. Geschützt durch eine Rüstung aus vulkanisiertem Schatten schwingt er sich mit flügelförmigen Schattenarmen geschwinder empor als je zuvor. Auf der zwölfstufigen Skala für Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>te gebührt Nihil-Diabolos der höchste Rang.
#. fr: La forme que le démon Diabolos a prise après avoir absorbé la puissance de Scáthach, la Reine des ombres. Enveloppé d'un manteau d'ombre quasi impénétrable, il commande des magies encore plus dévastatrices qui le placent à coup sûr en tête de liste dans la Hiérarchie du néant.
#. column 0: Diabolos Hollow
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:179:0:8"
msgid "By absorbing the power of Scathach, Diabolos's own might was enhanced by an order of magnitude. Encased in armor of hardened shadow, and commanding ruinous new magicks, the master of nightmare boasted a strength to rival the greatest entities of the voidsent hierarchy."
msgstr "Поглотив силу Скатах, Диаболос многократно усилился. Облачённый в броню из затвердевшей тени и владеющий новыми разрушительными чарами, повелитель кошмаров стал силой, способной соперничать с величайшими исчадиями Пустоты."

#. ja: アームドウェポン
#. de: Panzerwaffe
#. fr: arme blindée
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Heavily armored and heavily armed, this magitek weapon maintains stability by shifting weight over its multiple mechanical legs. The pilot sits ensconced within a sealed cockpit, protected from the weapon's explosive firepower─a notable improvement over previous designs.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:180:0:0"
msgid "Armored Weapon"
msgstr "Бронированное оружие"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Panzerwaffen
#. fr: armes blindées
#. column 0: Armored Weapon
#. column 8: Heavily armored and heavily armed, this magitek weapon maintains stability by shifting weight over its multiple mechanical legs. The pilot sits ensconced within a sealed cockpit, protected from the weapon's explosive firepower─a notable improvement over previous designs.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:180:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ガレマール帝国軍の大型装甲魔導アーマー。多脚方式を採用することで安定性を増し、より多くの武装を搭載することが可能になった。また、操縦席を密閉型にすることで、搭乗員の安全性が向上しているのも特徴と言える。
#. de: Diese riesige Magitek-Kampfmaschine der Garlear wird durch zusätzliche Beine stabilisiert, wodurch noch mehr Waffen an ihr installiert werden können. Die Besatzung ist besonders gut geschützt, da die Pilotensitze hermetisch verschlossen sind.
#. fr: Un des plus gros modèles d'armure magitek blindée. Grâce à la stabilité que lui confèrent ses multiples pattes, ce véhicule est capable de transporter un véritable arsenal tout en conservant sa mobilité. Le poste de commande a la particularité d'être entièrement clos, garantissant ainsi de meilleures chances de survie au pilote.
#. column 0: Armored Weapon
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:180:0:8"
msgid "Heavily armored and heavily armed, this magitek weapon maintains stability by shifting weight over its multiple mechanical legs. The pilot sits ensconced within a sealed cockpit, protected from the weapon's explosive firepower─a notable improvement over previous designs."
msgstr "Эта магитех-машина крепко бронирована и вооружена. Для устойчивости она перераспределяет вес на многочисленные механические ноги. Пилот укрыт в герметичной кабине, защищающей его от взрывной мощи оружия, — заметное улучшение по сравнению с прежними моделями."

#. ja: ギギ
#. de: Gigi
#. fr: Gigi
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “BuT hOw CaN i EvEr Be AcCePtEd As YoUr SoN iF i ReMaIn A mAmMeT?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:181:0:0"
msgid "Gigi"
msgstr "Гиги"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Gigi
#. column 0: Gigi
#. column 8: “BuT hOw CaN i EvEr Be AcCePtEd As YoUr SoN iF i ReMaIn A mAmMeT?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:181:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「こんな魔法人形のままでも……<br>父上は、ボクを息子にしてくれるの？」<br>魔法人形：ギギ
#. de: „Ich bin Vivi, Quans Enkelkind! Und ich bin Gigi, Hildibrands Sohn!“
#. fr: “Mais je ne suis qu'un pantin... une vulgaire marionnette. J'ai peur qu'avec cette apparence, vous ne puissiez jamais m'aimer comme un vrai petit garçon.”
#. column 0: Gigi
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:181:0:8"
msgid "“BuT hOw CaN i EvEr Be AcCePtEd As YoUr SoN iF i ReMaIn A mAmMeT?”"
msgstr "«Но каК же мЕня прИмуТ в вАшу семЬю, есЛи я таК и осТанусЬ маРионеткой?»"

#. ja: ズルワーン
#. de: Zurvan
#. fr: Zurvan
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: One of the three eikons who comprise the Warring Triad. Worshipped by a centaur-like race on Meracydia, Zurvan was known as the deity of eternity, or “He who standeth above all other gods.” Brought into being by his followers as a symbol of overwhelming victory, this entity's frightful appearance and merciless appetite for justice earned him the title of the “Demon.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:182:0:0"
msgid "Zurvan"
msgstr "Зурван"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Zurvan
#. column 0: Zurvan
#. column 8: One of the three eikons who comprise the Warring Triad. Worshipped by a centaur-like race on Meracydia, Zurvan was known as the deity of eternity, or “He who standeth above all other gods.” Brought into being by his followers as a symbol of overwhelming victory, this entity's frightful appearance and merciless appetite for justice earned him the title of the “Demon.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:182:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「三闘神」の一柱。南方大陸メラシディアの人馬種族が崇めていた存在で、すべての神々の頂点に君臨する永劫の神と考えられていた。それゆえ、「勝利」の象徴ともされ、鬼の形相で悪を倒す、荒々しい神格として召喚されている。
#. de: Eine der drei Ikonen der Kriegstriade. Auf dem südlichen Kontinent Meracydia von einem zentauren-ähnlichen Volk verehrt, verkörpert er den ewig währenden Sieg. Dieser wilden Gottheit wird nachgesagt, selbst über andere Götter zu herrschen. Trotz seiner dämonischen Erscheinung wird er angerufen, um das Böse zu besiegen.
#. fr: Ce pilier de la triade guerrière est vénéré par les centaures du continent austral de Méracydia qui voient en lui un être suprême et éternel, un Dieu parmi les Dieux. Ces hommes-bêtes en ont fait leur divinité tutélaire et invoquent Zurvan sous la forme d'un Primordial violent et démoniaque incarnant la victoire contre leurs envahisseurs.
#. column 0: Zurvan
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:182:0:8"
msgid "One of the three eikons who comprise the Warring Triad. Worshipped by a centaur-like race on Meracydia, Zurvan was known as the deity of eternity, or “He who standeth above all other gods.” Brought into being by his followers as a symbol of overwhelming victory, this entity's frightful appearance and merciless appetite for justice earned him the title of the “Demon.”"
msgstr "Один из трёх эйконов Воюющей Триады. Зурвана почитали кентавроподобные народы Мерасидии как бога вечности, «превыше всех иных богов». Его призвали как символ безоговорочной победы. Ужасный облик и беспощадная жажда справедливости снискали ему прозвище «Демон»."

#. ja: ナマズオ
#. de: Namazuo
#. fr: Namazu
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A beast tribe native to the Far East. Short and squat, the Namazu are nevertheless excellent swimmers, and subsist mainly on a diet of harpooned fish. Though proximity to the settlements of other races has done much to civilize these sociable creatures, a significant number of their clans yet remain wild and savage.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:183:0:0"
msgid "Namazu"
msgstr "Намазу"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Namazu
#. column 0: Namazu
#. column 8: A beast tribe native to the Far East. Short and squat, the Namazu are nevertheless excellent swimmers, and subsist mainly on a diet of harpooned fish. Though proximity to the settlements of other races has done much to civilize these sociable creatures, a significant number of their clans yet remain wild and savage.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:183:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 東方地域に棲まう獣人種族。ずんぐりとしているが泳ぎに長け、主に刺突漁によって魚を捕らえて生活している。他種族の街に寄り添って暮らす、文明化された者もいるが、未だ野生の者も少なくない。
#. de: Die kleinen, stämmigen Namazuo sind ausgezeichnete Schwimmer und in den Flüssen des Fernen Ostens heimisch, wo sie mit ihren Harpunen auf die Fischjagd gehen. Während manche von ihnen wild und gefährlich sind, wagen sich nicht wenige in die Städte und leben friedlich Seite an Seite mit den anderen Bewohnern.
#. fr: Une créature petite et trapue qu'il n'est pas rare de croiser dans les contrées orientales. Elle nage ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment bien et se nourrit de proies qu'elle pêche au harpon. Elle n'a pas peur de s'approcher des cités peuplées par d'autres races, et certains Namazu se sont même civilisés. Un bon nombre d'entre eux vivent cependant encore à l'état sauvage.
#. column 0: Namazu
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:183:0:8"
msgid "A beast tribe native to the Far East. Short and squat, the Namazu are nevertheless excellent swimmers, and subsist mainly on a diet of harpooned fish. Though proximity to the settlements of other races has done much to civilize these sociable creatures, a significant number of their clans yet remain wild and savage."
msgstr "Племя зверолюдей с Дальнего Востока. Намазу невысоки и коренасты, зато отлично плавают и питаются главным образом рыбой, добытой острогой. Соседство с поселениями других народов во многом облагородило этих общительных созданий, но многие их кланы всё ещё живут в дикой природе."

#. ja: コウジン
#. de: Kojin
#. fr: Kojin
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: This marine race of beastmen has lived in the Ruby Sea for generations. As at home underwater as they are on land, they have flourished on the bounty of the ocean. The Kojin revere the kami─a legion of gods found within the great and the small─and strive ceaselessly to collect those objects in which they believe their deities reside.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:184:0:0"
msgid "Kojin"
msgstr "Кодзин"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Kojin
#. fr: Kojin
#. column 0: Kojin
