msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:184:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 紅玉海に古来より棲まう海洋民。水中での活動に長け、豊かな海の恵みを糧として暮らしてきた。物に宿る八百万の神を信じており、その依り代となる名品や逸品の類いを集めることに余念がない。
#. de: Die Kojin sind ein Wilder Stamm des Meeres, der seit undenklichen Zeiten die Rubinsee bevölkert. Sie verehren unzählige <i>Kami</i> - Gottheiten oder Geister, welche in Dingen hausen. Daher erklärt sich auch ihre Vorliebe für besonders kunstfertige Gegenstände, die sie wie besessen sammeln.
#. fr: Les Kojin sont des hommes-bêtes aquatiques qui ont élu domicile dans la Mer de Rubis. Ils se nourrissent es<shy>sen<shy>tiel<shy>le<shy>ment des produits qu'ils y trouvent et leurs croyances animistes leur font voir des dieux dans presque toutes les créatures et les objets qui les entourent et qu'ils rassemblent avec ardeur.
#. column 0: Kojin
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:184:0:8"
msgid "This marine race of beastmen has lived in the Ruby Sea for generations. As at home underwater as they are on land, they have flourished on the bounty of the ocean. The Kojin revere the kami─a legion of gods found within the great and the small─and strive ceaselessly to collect those objects in which they believe their deities reside."
msgstr "Этот морской народ зверолюдей издавна живёт в Рубиновом море. Кодзин одинаково вольготно чувствуют себя и под водой, и на суше, процветая за счёт даров океана. Они почитают ками — легион богов, обитающих во всём, большом и малом, — и неустанно собирают вещи, в которых, по их вере, живут божества."

#. ja: アナンタ
#. de: Ananta
#. fr: Ananta
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The Ananta are a people native to the Fringes of Gyr Abania. A race consisting entirely of females, they resemble women from the waist up, but take the form of undulating serpents from the waist down. They are known for their elegant metallic jewelry, which they shape with the caress of magic rather than by the blow of a hammer.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:185:0:0"
msgid "Ananta"
msgstr "Ананта"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Ananta
#. fr: Ananta
#. column 0: Ananta
#. column 8: The Ananta are a people native to the Fringes of Gyr Abania. A race consisting entirely of females, they resemble women from the waist up, but take the form of undulating serpents from the waist down. They are known for their elegant metallic jewelry, which they shape with the caress of magic rather than by the blow of a hammer.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:185:0:2"
