#. ja: 「了解です！<br>どんなことがあっても必ず！」<br>アラミゴ解放軍：メ・ナーゴ
#. de: „Juhu, geschafft! Sieeeeeg!!! Wir haben gewonnen!“
#. fr: “Aprrrès toutes les louanges qu'on m'a faites sur toi, je suis contente d'avoir enfin eu l'occasion de te voir te battre, <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>.”
#. column 0: M'naago
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:186:0:8"
msgid "“I won't let you down, sir!”"
msgstr "«Не подведу вас, сэр!»"

#. ja: コトカゼ
#. de: Kotokaze
#. fr: Kotokaze
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “We would welcome your custom, miss.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:187:0:0"
msgid "Kotokaze"
msgstr "Котокадзэ"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Kotokaze
#. column 0: Kotokaze
#. column 8: “We would welcome your custom, miss.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:187:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「美味い酒と肴を用意してるから、<br>いつでも来とくれ」<br>「潮風亭」女将：コトカゼ
#. de: „Ihr seid als meine Gäste jederzeit herzlich willkommen.“
#. fr: “Soyez les bienvenus dans notre taverne<nbsp>! Nous avons une nouvelle cuvée de <i>saké</i>, notre fameux alcool de riz local, je ne vous dis que ça<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Kotokaze
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:187:0:8"
msgid "“We would welcome your custom, miss.”"
msgstr "«Будем рады видеть вас у нас, барышня»."

#. ja: マンモス
#. de: Mammut
#. fr: mammouth
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: These lumbering, herbivorous beastkin inhabit chilly plains and snowy mountainsides, protected from the elements by thick matted hides. Ordinarily placid in temperament, mammoths are known to become aggressive if startled, thrashing about with their long, curved tusks. Even the largest of predators will give these creatures a wide berth, preferring to avoid the risk of injury or death.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:188:0:0"
msgid "Mammoth"
msgstr "Мамонт"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Mammuts
#. fr: mammouths
#. column 0: Mammoth
#. column 8: These lumbering, herbivorous beastkin inhabit chilly plains and snowy mountainsides, protected from the elements by thick matted hides. Ordinarily placid in temperament, mammoths are known to become aggressive if startled, thrashing about with their long, curved tusks. Even the largest of predators will give these creatures a wide berth, preferring to avoid the risk of injury or death.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:188:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 寒冷地や冷涼な山間部などに棲息する大型草食動物。基本的には温厚だが、不用意に近づくと興奮状態に陥り、大きな牙を振り回して暴れ始める。そのため、大型肉食獣も、滅多なことでは狩りの対象としないようだ。
#. de: Diese gigantischen Pflanzenfresser sind für gewöhnlich in kalten Bergregionen anzutreffen. Sie sind sanftmütig, doch einmal gereizt geraten sie in eine wilde Rage und greifen mit ihren gewaltigen Stoßzähnen an. Jäger, die ein Mammut erlegen, können sich über Fleischvorräte für mehrere Wochen freuen.
#. fr: Un gigantesque herbivore qui peuple les terres froides et les régions montagneuses gelées. C'est une créature douce, mais qui peut être prise de panique si elle est approchée sans précaution. Elle peut alors provoquer des blessures graves en attaquant avec ses larges défenses. C'est d'ailleurs pour cette raison que les grands carnivores le prennent rarement pour cible.
#. column 0: Mammoth
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:188:0:8"
msgid "These lumbering, herbivorous beastkin inhabit chilly plains and snowy mountainsides, protected from the elements by thick matted hides. Ordinarily placid in temperament, mammoths are known to become aggressive if startled, thrashing about with their long, curved tusks. Even the largest of predators will give these creatures a wide berth, preferring to avoid the risk of injury or death."
msgstr "Эти неповоротливые травоядные зверолюди обитают на холодных равнинах и заснеженных горных склонах. От непогоды их защищает густая свалявшаяся шерсть. Обычно мамонты миролюбивы, но, испугавшись, могут взбеситься и пустить в ход длинные изогнутые бивни. Даже самые крупные хищники обходят их стороной, не желая рисковать жизнью и здоровьем."

#. ja: フォーバッド
#. de: Phoebad
#. fr: phoebad
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Phoebads are a type of golem that occur naturally in areas rich in salt crystals, such as Loch Seld and other similar bodies of water. In folklore, phoebads are said to have once been people who defied the revelations of Rhalgr, and were transformed as punishment for their disobedience.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:189:0:0"
msgid "Phoebad"
msgstr "Фебад"

