msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:189:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ロッホ・セル湖など塩が豊富な場所に自然発生するゴーレムの一種。ギラバニア地方には、振り返らず街を出るようにとの壊神の啓示を受けながらも、振り返ってしまった女の成れの果てだという逸話が伝わる。
#. de: Phoebad sind eine Art Golem, die am Seldsee und in anderen salzigen Gebieten spontan aus der Umgebung entstehen. Einer abanischen Legende nach geht der erste Phoebad auf eine Frau zurück, welche der Zerstörer mit der Warnung, sie solle sich nicht umdrehen, aus ihrer Stadt verbannte - und die sich dennoch umdrehte.
#. fr: Un golem qui se forme na<shy>tu<shy>rel<shy>le<shy>ment dans les régions comme celle du lac Seld, car le sel y abonde. Une légende gyrabanienne raconte également que le Destructeur aurait ordonné à une femme de quitter la ville où elle habitait sans se retourner, mais que celle-ci fut changée en phoebad lorsqu'elle jeta un coup d'œil par-dessus son épaule.
#. column 0: Phoebad
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:189:0:8"
msgid "Phoebads are a type of golem that occur naturally in areas rich in salt crystals, such as Loch Seld and other similar bodies of water. In folklore, phoebads are said to have once been people who defied the revelations of Rhalgr, and were transformed as punishment for their disobedience."
msgstr "Фебады — разновидность големов, которые естественным образом появляются в местах, богатых кристаллами соли, например у озера Селд. По преданиям, когда-то они были людьми, ослушавшимися откровений Ралгра, и за неповиновение превратились в големов."

#. ja: スサノオ
#. de: Susano
#. fr: Susano
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A deity summoned forth by the Kojin, Susano resided in three sacred receptacles. As well as being one of the greatest kami, this entity is also revered as the god of the sea. The Lord of the Revel rejoices in both battle and banquet, meeting all challengers with jubilant and unrestrained ferocity.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:190:0:0"
msgid "Susano"
msgstr "Сусано"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Susano
#. column 0: Susano
#. column 8: A deity summoned forth by the Kojin, Susano resided in three sacred receptacles. As well as being one of the greatest kami, this entity is also revered as the god of the sea. The Lord of the Revel rejoices in both battle and banquet, meeting all challengers with jubilant and unrestrained ferocity.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:190:0:2"
