#. ja: 「ブワッハッハッハッ！<br>オラにも、ツキが回ってきたぞお！」<br>第XII軍団：グリーンワート
#. de: „Jetzt seid ihr dran, ihr Würmer! Ich mach euch fertig!“
#. fr: “Cette fois justement, j'aurai ma vengeance<nbsp>! Et lorsque je t'aurai tué<if $gn4>e</if>, mes supérieurs seront forcés de me rendre le rang qui m'est dû<nbsp>! Bouahaha<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Grynewaht
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:192:0:8"
msgid "“It's like all my namedays have come at once!”"
msgstr "«Бвахахаха! Да мне наконец-то улыбнулась удача!»"

#. ja: ラショウ
#. de: Rasho
#. fr: Rasho
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Men who revere manners and tradition can be found the world over. But not here.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:193:0:0"
msgid "Rasho"
msgstr "Рашо"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Rasho
#. column 0: Rasho
#. column 8: “Men who revere manners and tradition can be found the world over. But not here.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:193:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「…………正すべきところはいろいろあるが、<br>俺たちとて、行儀の悪いクソガキの集まりだ」<br>海賊衆の頭領：ラショウ
#. de: „Das lässt mich hoffen, dass wir mit euch auf die richtige Karte gesetzt haben.“
#. fr: “Si vous pensiez trouver ici des gens à cheval sur l'étiquette, vous avez frappé à la mauvaise porte. Je vous rappelle que nous sommes des pirates. Il y en a même certains qui jurent à chaque fois qu'ils ouvrent la bouche, et d'autres qui ne se sont pas lavés depuis plus de trois jours.”
#. column 0: Rasho
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:193:0:8"
msgid "“Men who revere manners and tradition can be found the world over. But not here.”"
msgstr "«Во всём мире найдутся те, кто чтит манеры и традиции. Только не здесь»."

#. ja: シリナ
#. de: Cirina
#. fr: Cirina
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “The Mol hearken to the whispers of the elder gods, which guide us in our daily lives.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:194:0:0"
msgid "Cirina"
msgstr "Цирина"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Cirina
#. column 0: Cirina
#. column 8: “The Mol hearken to the whispers of the elder gods, which guide us in our daily lives.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:194:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「私たちモル族は、神様からの言葉……<br>「神託」を受けて、日々を暮しています」<br>モル族の乙女：シリナ
#. de: „Wir Mol richten unser Leben nach den Worten der Götter aus.“
#. fr: “Notre tribu converse avec les êtres divins. Leurs oracles nous guident dans la vie de tous les jours. ”
#. column 0: Cirina
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:194:0:8"
msgid "“The Mol hearken to the whispers of the elder gods, which guide us in our daily lives.”"
msgstr "«Мы, племя Мол, внемлем шёпоту древних богов... Их слова направляют нас в повседневной жизни»."

#. ja: マグナイ
#. de: Magnai
#. fr: Magnai
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “We shall not speak as equals. Born of the Sun are Oronir, and born of the earth are you.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:195:0:0"
msgid "Magnai"
msgstr "Магнай"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Magnai
#. column 0: Magnai
#. column 8: “We shall not speak as equals. Born of the Sun are Oronir, and born of the earth are you.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:195:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「余輩らオロニル族は、太陽神アジムの子。<br>神の子とは、契約ごときで成れるものではない」<br>オロニル族の長兄：マグナイ
#. de: „Der große Kampf steht kurz bevor, und wir haben vor, daraus als Sieger hervorzugehen.“
#. fr: “Les Oronir sont les fils d'Azim. Aucune alliance ne peut permettre à qui que ce soit de devenir l'enfant d'un Dieu.”
#. column 0: Magnai
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:195:0:8"
msgid "“We shall not speak as equals. Born of the Sun are Oronir, and born of the earth are you.”"
msgstr "«Мы, оронеры, дети бога солнца Азима. Дитя бога не станешь оттого, что заключишь с ним договор»."

#. ja: サドゥ
#. de: Sadu
#. fr: Sadu
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “None are braver than the Dotharl, for we do not fear death.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:196:0:0"
msgid "Sadu"
msgstr "Саду"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Sadu
#. column 0: Sadu
#. column 8: “None are braver than the Dotharl, for we do not fear death.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:196:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「そうだ、ドタール族はもっとも勇敢な戦士。<br>死ですら、オレたちにとっては恐れるものじゃない」<br>ドタール族の族長：サドゥ
#. de: „Erschöpft? Willst du uns beleidigen? Wir Dotharl kennen keine Müdigkeit!“
#. fr: “Les Dotharl sont sans doute les plus courageux des guerriers, puisque nous ne craignons rien, pas même la mort.”
#. column 0: Sadu
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:196:0:8"
msgid "“None are braver than the Dotharl, for we do not fear death.”"
msgstr "«Да, дотарлы — самые храбрые воины. Мы не боимся даже смерти»."

#. ja: 神龍
#. de: Shinryu
#. fr: Shinryu
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A deity of destruction, born not of faith, but of a desire for vengeance. Drawing on the power of his brethren's sacrifice and the eyes of a great wyrm, Ilberd summoned Shinryu to annihilate the forces of the Garlean Empire. This entity is surmised to have taken the form of a dragon as part of its purpose in emulating─and ultimately overshadowing─the devastation wrought by the elder primal Bahamut.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:197:0:0"
msgid "Shinryu"
msgstr "Синрю"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Shinryu
#. column 0: Shinryu
#. column 8: A deity of destruction, born not of faith, but of a desire for vengeance. Drawing on the power of his brethren's sacrifice and the eyes of a great wyrm, Ilberd summoned Shinryu to annihilate the forces of the Garlean Empire. This entity is surmised to have taken the form of a dragon as part of its purpose in emulating─and ultimately overshadowing─the devastation wrought by the elder primal Bahamut.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:197:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 信仰に寄らない破壊の神。イルベルドが帝国軍を滅ぼすため、同胞の犠牲と竜の眼を用いて召喚した。その姿がドラゴン状を成しているのは、バハムートを超える者として召喚されたことに由来するものと推測される。
#. de: Der Verräter Ilberd, geblendet von dem Wahn, seine Heimat aus den Klauen der Garlear zu befreien, beschwor allein mithilfe der Kraft zweier Drachen<shy>augen diese zerstörerische Gottheit. Aufgrund seiner Drachengestalt geht man davon aus, dass Shinryu in Kraft Bahamut mindestens ebenbürtig ist.
#. fr: Un dieu de la destruction sans culte officiel. Ilberd l'a invoqué en utilisant un œil de dragon et en sacrifiant de nombreux frères d'armes. S'il a cette forme de dragon, c'est parce qu'il est devenu encore plus puissant que Bahamut.
#. column 0: Shinryu
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:197:0:8"
msgid "A deity of destruction, born not of faith, but of a desire for vengeance. Drawing on the power of his brethren's sacrifice and the eyes of a great wyrm, Ilberd summoned Shinryu to annihilate the forces of the Garlean Empire. This entity is surmised to have taken the form of a dragon as part of its purpose in emulating─and ultimately overshadowing─the devastation wrought by the elder primal Bahamut."
msgstr "Божество разрушения, порождённое не верой, а жаждой мести. Ильберд использовал жертву своих соратников и глаза великого дракона, чтобы призвать Синрю и уничтожить силы Гарлеанской империи. Полагают, что драконий облик Синрю был призван повторить, а затем превзойти разрушения, учинённые древним праймалом Бахамутом."

#. ja: ヨツユ
#. de: Yotsuyu
#. fr: Yotsuyu
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “My appetite for your agony is as an abyss─bottomless. Insatiable.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:198:0:0"
msgid "Yotsuyu"
msgstr "Ёцуя"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Yotsuyu
#. column 0: Yotsuyu
#. column 8: “My appetite for your agony is as an abyss─bottomless. Insatiable.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:198:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「あたしの腹は底なしの沼……<br>満足にはまだ、ほど遠い……」<br>ドマ代理総督：ヨツユ
#. de: „Ich bin das ewige Gejammer von euch Verlierern allmählich leid.“
#. fr: “Mon âme est comme un puits sans fond, et il vous faudra encore souffrir un peu pour faire de moi une femme comblée...”
#. column 0: Yotsuyu
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:198:0:8"
msgid "“My appetite for your agony is as an abyss─bottomless. Insatiable.”"
msgstr "«Мой голод по вашим страданиям — бездонная пропасть. Насыщения ей не будет»."

#. ja: クルル・バルデシオン
#. de: Krile
#. fr: Krile Baldesion
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Would you care to attempt a more dextrous deflection?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:199:0:0"
msgid "Krile"
msgstr "Крилэ"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Krile Baldesion
#. column 0: Krile
#. column 8: “Would you care to attempt a more dextrous deflection?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:199:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「……あらあら？<br>そんな頼み方でいいのかな？」<br>暁の血盟：クルル・バルデシオン
#. de: „Ich entschuldige mich für den kleinen Streich, den ich dir gespielt habe.“
#. fr: “C'est donc vous, <if $gn4>la fameuse Guerrière<else>le fameux Guerrier</if> de la Lumière... Je comprends mieux pourquoi vos ennemis vous craignent autant.”
#. column 0: Krile
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:199:0:8"
msgid "“Would you care to attempt a more dextrous deflection?”"
msgstr "«Ой-ой... А нельзя попросить повежливее?»"

#. ja: リセ
#. de: Lyse
#. fr: Lyse
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “I'm sorry for lying to you. My real name is Lyse.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:200:0:0"
msgid "Lyse"
msgstr "Лисе"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Lyse
#. column 0: Lyse
#. column 8: “I'm sorry for lying to you. My real name is Lyse.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:200:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「もちろん！<br>全力でやらせてもらうわ！」<br>暁の血盟：リセ
#. de: „Wenn man nur vorher wüsste, was man gewinnt und was man verliert.“
#. fr: “Je suis même prête à chasser tous les Impériaux à coups de pied dans le derche, s'il le faut<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Lyse
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:200:0:8"
msgid "“I'm sorry for lying to you. My real name is Lyse.”"
msgstr "«Прости, что солгала тебе. На самом деле меня зовут Лисе»."

#. ja: ゼノス・イェー・ガルヴァス
#. de: Zenos yae Galvus
#. fr: Zenos yae Galvus
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Do not disappoint me, girl. Or I will kill you.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:201:0:0"
msgid "Zenos yae Galvus"
msgstr "Зенос яэ Галвус"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Zenos yae Galvus
#. column 0: Zenos yae Galvus
#. column 8: “Do not disappoint me, girl. Or I will kill you.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:201:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「せいぜい愉しませろ……。<br>そうでなければ、すぐに潰す」<br>第XII軍団軍団長：ゼノス・イェー・ガルヴァス
#. de: „Da steht ja immer noch jemand. Gut, dann spielen wir eben weiter.“
#. fr: “J'espère bien que cette proie va me procurer du plaisir...”
#. column 0: Zenos yae Galvus
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:201:0:8"
msgid "“Do not disappoint me, girl. Or I will kill you.”"
msgstr "«Не разочаруй меня, девочка. Иначе я убью тебя»."

#. ja: ヒエン
#. de: Hien
#. fr: Hien
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “My blade or my head. Which would you have of me?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:202:0:0"
msgid "Hien"
msgstr "Хиэн"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Hien
#. column 0: Hien
#. column 8: “My blade or my head. Which would you have of me?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:202:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「 ……して、どうする。<br>この首と刀、どちらを求めにきた？」<br>ドマ国主：ヒエン
#. de: „Ich mag unseren Wettkampf verloren haben, den Kampf gegen die Garlear aber werde ich gewiss nicht verlieren!“
#. fr: “Qu'êtes-vous donc venus chercher finalement<nbsp>? Ma tête à trancher ou mon bras pour lever une armée<nbsp>?”
#. column 0: Hien
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:202:0:8"
msgid "“My blade or my head. Which would you have of me?”"
msgstr "«И что же тебе нужно? Моя голова или мой меч?»"

#. ja: モスモス
#. de: Moosling
#. fr: moussemousse
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Appearing as little more than mossy spheres with legs, these seedkin are fond of wetlands and humid climes. Mosslings are highly active when moisture is abundant, but exhibit a tendency to huddle together in damp clumps when dry weather threatens, presumably in an effort to prevent unwanted evaporation.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:203:0:0"
msgid "Mossling"
msgstr "Моховик"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: moussemousses
#. column 0: Mossling
#. column 8: Appearing as little more than mossy spheres with legs, these seedkin are fond of wetlands and humid climes. Mosslings are highly active when moisture is abundant, but exhibit a tendency to huddle together in damp clumps when dry weather threatens, presumably in an effort to prevent unwanted evaporation.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:203:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 湿潤な土地を好む草木綱の魔物。二本足が生えた苔玉のような姿をしており、充分な水分がある時には活発に動く。乾燥の危険を察知すると、複数の個体が身を寄せ合い、水分の蒸発を防ぐという奇妙な習性がある。
#. de: Diese munteren Moosbällchen huschen bevorzugt durch Sumpflandschaften und andere Feuchtgebiete. Während Trockenperioden finden sie sich häufig zu geselligen Haufen zusammen, um Feuchtigkeitsverlust durch ungewollte Verdunstung zu vermeiden.
#. fr: Ces petites boules vertes indigènes des régions humides ressemblent aux sphères végétales ornant certains jardins orientaux. À l'inverse de ces arrangements floraux purement décoratifs, les moussemousses possèdent deux courtes jambes qui leur permettent de déambuler quand ils se sont assez gorgés d'eau. On notera aussi leur étrange tendance à se regrouper en “bosquet” pour combattre la déshydratation lorsque l'air devient trop sec.
#. column 0: Mossling
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:203:0:8"
msgid "Appearing as little more than mossy spheres with legs, these seedkin are fond of wetlands and humid climes. Mosslings are highly active when moisture is abundant, but exhibit a tendency to huddle together in damp clumps when dry weather threatens, presumably in an effort to prevent unwanted evaporation."
msgstr "Эти семенные создания похожи на моховые шарики на ножках и обитают в болотах и влажном климате. Когда влаги вдоволь, моховики весьма подвижны, но с наступлением засухи сбиваются в сырые кучки, словно стараясь не дать влаге испариться."

#. ja: チャプリ
#. de: Chapuli
#. fr: chapuli
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A common sight in the wilds of Gyr Abania, chapulis use the bladelike horn on their heads to strip plants bare before settling down to feast on the fallen foliage. Though primarily herbivores, they display surprising savagery when agitated, and have been known to attack both men and beasts. Powerful hind legs enable the chapuli to leap impressive distances, much to the dismay of fleeing victims.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:204:0:0"
msgid "Chapuli"
msgstr "Чапули"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: chapulis
#. column 0: Chapuli
#. column 8: A common sight in the wilds of Gyr Abania, chapulis use the bladelike horn on their heads to strip plants bare before settling down to feast on the fallen foliage. Though primarily herbivores, they display surprising savagery when agitated, and have been known to attack both men and beasts. Powerful hind legs enable the chapuli to leap impressive distances, much to the dismay of fleeing victims.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:204:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ギラバニアなどに棲息する百蟲綱の魔物。頭部に備えた刃状の角で、植物の枝や葉を斬り落として食す。基本的には草食だが、興奮すると人や獣をも襲う獰猛さを秘める。大きく発達した後脚による跳躍力も、かなりのもの。
#. de: Diese in Gyr Abania weit verbreiteten Insektoide benutzen ihr scharfes Horn, um Blätter und kleine Äste von Bäumen abzuschaben. Obwohl sie Pflanzenfresser sind, greifen sie häufig Reisende an, denen sie mit ihren starken Sprungbeinen nachsetzen.
#. fr: Considéré comme nuisible en Gyr Abania, le chapuli se nourrit es<shy>sen<shy>tiel<shy>le<shy>ment de fruits et de feuilles qu'il détache grâce à sa corne frontale acérée. Bien qu'herbivore, il peut se montrer assez féroce pour attaquer des êtres humains et des bêtes sauvages quand il est nerveux. Il est donc conseillé de garder ses distances, d'autant plus que les bonds dont ils sont capables sont remarquables une fois leurs pattes arrière entièrement développées.
#. column 0: Chapuli
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:204:0:8"
msgid "A common sight in the wilds of Gyr Abania, chapulis use the bladelike horn on their heads to strip plants bare before settling down to feast on the fallen foliage. Though primarily herbivores, they display surprising savagery when agitated, and have been known to attack both men and beasts. Powerful hind legs enable the chapuli to leap impressive distances, much to the dismay of fleeing victims."
msgstr "В дикой природе Гир-Абании чапули встречаются на каждом шагу. Острым рогом на голове они срезают растения, а затем лакомятся опавшей листвой. Обычно эти создания питаются растениями, но, если их потревожить, могут стать на удивление свирепыми и напасть как на людей, так и на зверей. Мощные задние лапы позволяют чапули прыгать на большие расстояния, что весьма огорчает тех, кто пытается от них убежать."

#. ja: キキルン・ミートイーター
#. de: Qiqirn-Fleischfresser
#. fr: Qiqirn croque-viande
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The Qiqirn tribes of Gyr Abania are an unusually bloodthirsty breed who consume the flesh of animal and man alike. Classified as wild beasts by the Garlean Empire and thus unworthy of contact, these carnivorous savages have been largely ignored even as they continue to terrorize local settlements.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:205:0:0"
msgid "Qiqirn Meateater"
msgstr "Кикирн-мясоед"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Qiqirns croque-viande
#. column 0: Qiqirn Meateater
#. column 8: The Qiqirn tribes of Gyr Abania are an unusually bloodthirsty breed who consume the flesh of animal and man alike. Classified as wild beasts by the Garlean Empire and thus unworthy of contact, these carnivorous savages have been largely ignored even as they continue to terrorize local settlements.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:205:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ギラバニアに棲まうキキルン族は、非常に獰猛で人さえ襲って食すことがある。ガレマール帝国は、キキルン族を人と認めておらず、野生生物として扱っているため、現地民の脅威となりながらも長らく放置されてきた。
#. de: Die Qiqirn von Gyr Abania sind besonders blutrünstige Vertreter ihrer Art und verzehren alles, was zwei Beine hat: Miqo'te, Roegadyn und Lalafell eingeschlossen. Obwohl sie eine Gefahr für ihre Umwelt darstellen, wurden sie<nbsp>- wohl aufgrund ihrer Unfähigkeit, regelmäßig Tribut zu zahlen<nbsp>- von den Garlearn größtenteils ignoriert.
#. fr: Con<shy>trai<shy>re<shy>ment à certains de leurs cousins, la plupart des Qiqirns de Gyr Abania sont ex<shy>trê<shy>me<shy>ment féroces, assez pour faire de pauvres voyageurs leur repas. Malgré le danger qu'ils présentent pour la population, les Garlemaldais les ont toujours considérés comme faisant partie de la faune locale plutôt que comme une tribu barbare, et ils n'ont de ce fait jamais tenté de réfréner leur appétit pour la chair humaine.
#. column 0: Qiqirn Meateater
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:205:0:8"
msgid "The Qiqirn tribes of Gyr Abania are an unusually bloodthirsty breed who consume the flesh of animal and man alike. Classified as wild beasts by the Garlean Empire and thus unworthy of contact, these carnivorous savages have been largely ignored even as they continue to terrorize local settlements."
msgstr "Племена кикирнов Гир-Абании отличаются необычайной кровожадностью и едят мясо как зверей, так и людей. Гарлеанская империя считает их дикими животными, не достойными внимания, и почти не вмешивается, хотя они продолжают терроризировать местные поселения."

#. ja: 直言のフロドリック
#. de: Hrodric Giftzunge
#. fr: Hrodric le Médisant
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Cousin to Theodoric, the last king of Ala Mhigo, the noble-born Hrodric was fifth in line to the throne. Compelled by an unwavering sense of justice, he made frequent attempts to counsel and calm the volatile monarch, but such efforts were construed an act of treason. Sentenced for his crime, Hrodric suffered a terrible punishment: cursed to forever inhabit the form of a monstrous beast.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:206:0:0"
msgid "Hrodric Poisontongue"
msgstr "Хродрик Ядовитый Язык"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Hrodric le Médisant
#. column 0: Hrodric Poisontongue
#. column 8: Cousin to Theodoric, the last king of Ala Mhigo, the noble-born Hrodric was fifth in line to the throne. Compelled by an unwavering sense of justice, he made frequent attempts to counsel and calm the volatile monarch, but such efforts were construed an act of treason. Sentenced for his crime, Hrodric suffered a terrible punishment: cursed to forever inhabit the form of a monstrous beast.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:206:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アラミゴ最後の王、テオドリックの従兄弟であり、王位継承権5位の大物貴族であった人物。正義感が強く、暴走する王を諫めようと進言を繰り返したが、反逆罪に問われ幽閉。呪術により怪物に変えられてしまったのだった。
#. de: Als Neffe des mhigischen Königs Theoderic hatte Hrodric entfernte Aussichten auf den Thron, doch als er dem Tyrannen<shy>könig Vernunft einreden wollte, bestrafte ihn dieser wegen Hochverrats dazu, fortan sein Dasein als furchterregendes Monster zu fristen.
#. fr: Ce membre de la haute noblesse gyrabanienne était le cousin du roi Theodoric, ce qui le plaçait en cinquième position dans l'ordre de succession. Son sens aigu de la justice l'a toutefois poussé à condamner avec sévérité les atrocités commises par son monarque, ce qui lui valut de s'attirer son courroux. Pour se venger de cette trahison, Theodoric le fit emprisonner et changer en créature monstrueuse.
#. column 0: Hrodric Poisontongue
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:206:0:8"
msgid "Cousin to Theodoric, the last king of Ala Mhigo, the noble-born Hrodric was fifth in line to the throne. Compelled by an unwavering sense of justice, he made frequent attempts to counsel and calm the volatile monarch, but such efforts were construed an act of treason. Sentenced for his crime, Hrodric suffered a terrible punishment: cursed to forever inhabit the form of a monstrous beast."
msgstr "Знатный Хродрик, двоюродный брат Теодорика, последнего короля Ала Миго, был пятым в очереди на престол. Неукротимое чувство справедливости побуждало его снова и снова наставлять вспыльчивого монарха и пытаться его успокоить, но это сочли государственной изменой. За своё преступление Хродрик понёс страшное наказание: проклятие навеки обрекло его жить в облике чудовищного зверя."

