#. ja: 「フッ……腕を上げたなピピン！」<br>「ご冗談を……私に斬らせるつもりで、<br>隙を見せて誘い込んだのでしょう？」<br>不滅隊局長ラウバーン／同少闘将ピピン
#. de: „Besser, als ich es gekonnt hätte, Pipin!“<br>„Du hast ihn mir doch absichtlich überlassen, Vater!“
#. fr: “Le bras m'en tombe<nbsp>! Tu es devenu un féroce combattant, Pipin.”<br>“Père, ce n'est pas le moment de plaisanter. Admettez plutôt que vous avez vo<shy>lon<shy>tai<shy>re<shy>ment laissé cet ennemi vous attaquer pour que j'intervienne.”
#. column 0: Raubahn & Pipin
#. column 2: 0
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:210:0:8"
msgid "“Ho! You've improved, lad!”<br>“Come now, Father. You lured the fool onto my blade, and do not try to deny it!”"
msgstr "«Ха! Вот это ты подрос в мастерстве, сынок!»<br>«Ну что вы, отец. Вы сами подставили глупца под мой клинок, не отпирайтесь!»"

#. ja: コジャ
#. de: Koja
#. fr: koja
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A golem mainly constructed for the purpose of serving onmyoji and geomancers, the bulbous form of a koja is fashioned from sticky mud and imbued with the spirit of a shikigami. The features common to all koja are believed to be modeled after the original creator─a eunuch from ancient times─but no portrait has ever been found to substantiate this claim.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:211:0:0"
msgid "Koja"
msgstr "Кодзя"

