#. de: Tansui
#. fr: Tansui
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “I realize you do not look kindly on the Confederacy and her ways. But if you refuse to pay the Ruby Tithe, your safety in these waters cannot be assured.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:214:0:0"
msgid "Tansui"
msgstr "Тансюи"

