#. ja: 「我が名は、ゴウセツ！<br>はるか東方「ドマ」国の侍大将なり！」<br>ドマ国侍大将：ゴウセツ
#. de: „Hört her! Ich bin Gosetsu, Samurai aus Doma im Fernen Osten!“
#. fr: “Je m'appelle Gosetsu et je suis un illustre samouraï de Doma<nbsp>! En garde<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Gosetsu
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:230:0:8"
msgid "“I am Gosetsu, samurai of Doma! You will rue your choice of opponent this day!”"
msgstr "«Имя моё — Госэцу! Самурай из далёкой восточной страны Домы! Сегодня ты пожалеешь, что выбрал меня противником!»"

#. ja: カラクリ・ハンニャ
#. de: Karakuri Hannya
#. fr: hannya karakuri
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Fitted with a mask of the hanya─a symbol of extreme envy and malice─this automaton is a marriage of Doman ingenuity and Hingan design. Its creators, somehow uncertain that a high-powered crossbow welded to one arm and a ludicrously large mace to the other would provide the golem with sufficient means of punishing its victims, also installed variations with a self-destruct mechanism capable of laying waste to nearby attackers.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:231:0:0"
msgid "Karakuri Hanya"
msgstr "Каракури ханья"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Karakuri Hannya
#. fr: hannya karakuri
#. column 0: Karakuri Hanya
#. column 8: Fitted with a mask of the hanya─a symbol of extreme envy and malice─this automaton is a marriage of Doman ingenuity and Hingan design. Its creators, somehow uncertain that a high-powered crossbow welded to one arm and a ludicrously large mace to the other would provide the golem with sufficient means of punishing its victims, also installed variations with a self-destruct mechanism capable of laying waste to nearby attackers.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:231:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ドマから伝わった人形師の技術を応用し、ひんがしの国で設計された武装カラクリ人形。嫉妬や強い恨みを表す鬼女を表した般若の能面を付けているのが特徴。弩と金棒を備えているほか、自爆機構を有する個体も存在する。
#. de: Diese überdimensionierte Marionette ist das Produkt domanischer Puppenkunst und hinganischem Erfindungsgeistes. Ihre Hannya-Maske ist ein Symbol absoluter Boshaftigkeit und Missgunst<nbsp>- kaum erforderlich angesichts der Angst einflößenden Bewaffnung und des trickreichen Selbst<shy>zerstörungs<shy>mechanismus, der jeden übermütigen Angreifer in Stücke zu reißen vermag.
#. fr: Mis au point par des artisans hingashiens ayant puisé leur inspiration dans le savoir domien antique, cet automate porte un masque qui symbolise la jalousie et la malice. En plus de ses armes très dangereuses, il est également doté d'un mécanisme d'auto-destruction qui le rend com<shy>plè<shy>te<shy>ment im<shy>pré<shy>vi<shy>si<shy>ble.
#. column 0: Karakuri Hanya
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:231:0:8"
msgid "Fitted with a mask of the hanya─a symbol of extreme envy and malice─this automaton is a marriage of Doman ingenuity and Hingan design. Its creators, somehow uncertain that a high-powered crossbow welded to one arm and a ludicrously large mace to the other would provide the golem with sufficient means of punishing its victims, also installed variations with a self-destruct mechanism capable of laying waste to nearby attackers."
msgstr "Этот автомат создан в Хингаси на основе мастерства доманских кукольников. Его отличительная черта — маска театра но в виде ханья, демоницы, олицетворяющей зависть и злобу. Вдобавок к мощному арбалету и огромной дубине некоторые модели снабжены механизмом самоуничтожения, способным уничтожить всех врагов поблизости."

#. ja: ムードスード
#. de: Muhtsu
#. fr: moudsoud
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The final days of the Garlean invasion found the few remaining Ala Mhigan soldiers holed up in their crumbling castle. Knowing they had little choice left for survival, court mages rent open the barrier between this realm and the void, summoning beings to inhabit the bodies of their fallen Highlander and Hellsguard comrades in hopes that the demons would honor the hastily sealed covenant. The voidsent did not, and the muud suud still roam free.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:232:0:0"
msgid "Muud Suud"
msgstr "Муд сууд"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Muhtsus
#. fr: moudsoud
#. column 0: Muud Suud
#. column 8: The final days of the Garlean invasion found the few remaining Ala Mhigan soldiers holed up in their crumbling castle. Knowing they had little choice left for survival, court mages rent open the barrier between this realm and the void, summoning beings to inhabit the bodies of their fallen Highlander and Hellsguard comrades in hopes that the demons would honor the hastily sealed covenant. The voidsent did not, and the muud suud still roam free.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:232:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 筋肉質の大型妖異。ガレマール帝国の侵攻時に、破れかぶれとなったアラミゴの宮廷魔術師が戦死したハイランダーやローエンガルデの男性兵士を依り代として召喚したらしい。それゆえに、ギラバニア地方で多く見かけるようだ。
#. de: Als die garleischen Invasoren wieder und wieder gegen die Mauern des Königs<shy>palastes anrannten, sahen die mhigischen Hofmagier keinen anderen Ausweg, als Kreaturen des Nichts anzurufen und ihnen die Körper ihrer gefallenen Kameraden darzubieten. Der Pakt scheiterte, und die Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ten kehrten nie in ihre Dimension zurück.
#. fr: Assiégés dans leur château par les Garlemaldais, les résistants mhigois désespérés n'eurent d'autre choix que de demander à leurs mages d'invoquer des créatures du néant afin de redonner ar<shy>ti<shy>fi<shy>ciellement vie à leurs camarades morts au combat, et avoir ainsi une chance de survivre. Hélas pour eux, ce pacte tacite fut rapidement rompu, et les moudsoud hantent toujours la région de Gyr Abania.
#. column 0: Muud Suud
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:232:0:8"
msgid "The final days of the Garlean invasion found the few remaining Ala Mhigan soldiers holed up in their crumbling castle. Knowing they had little choice left for survival, court mages rent open the barrier between this realm and the void, summoning beings to inhabit the bodies of their fallen Highlander and Hellsguard comrades in hopes that the demons would honor the hastily sealed covenant. The voidsent did not, and the muud suud still roam free."
msgstr "В последние дни гарлеанского вторжения немногие уцелевшие солдаты из Ала Миго укрылись в разрушающемся замке. Понимая, что выбора почти не осталось, придворные маги разорвали завесу между этим миром и Пустотой и призвали демонов вселиться в тела павших товарищей-хайлендеров и стражей преисподней. Маги надеялись, что существа сдержат поспешно заключённую сделку, но демоны обманули их — и муд сууд до сих пор бродят на свободе."

#. ja: トカップチ
#. de: Tokkapchi
#. fr: Tokkapchi
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Encountered within Saint Mocianne's Arboretum, this shambling horror was discovered to be a korpokkur covered in mud of strangely invigorating properties. The withered leaf upon its head resembles a crown of sorts, which has led some to refer to its domain as “Kingsloam.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:233:0:0"
msgid "Tokkapchi"
msgstr "Токкапчи"

