#. ja: 「テンゼン……<br>どうか私を見守っていてください……」<br>四聖獣：朱雀
#. de: „Tenzen wird immer ein Teil von mir sein.“
#. fr: “Tenzen... Où que tu sois, je sais que tu veilles sur moi...”
#. column 0: Suzaku
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:235:0:8"
msgid "“Oh, my beloved, I pray you yet watch over me...”"
msgstr "«О, любимый мой, молю, продолжай оберегать меня...»"

#. ja: パズズ
#. de: Pazuzu
#. fr: Pazuzu
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Explorers of Eureka Anemos claim that when the wind howls across that forbidden land, it is the sound of the dead heralding the advent of high voidsent and lord of the gales, Pazuzu. Considering what little is known of the Isle of Val and its logic-defying laws of nature, those claims could bear more truth than fiction.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:236:0:0"
msgid "Pazuzu"
msgstr "Пазузу"

