#. de: Gilgamesch (Stormblood)
#. fr: Gilgamesh (Stormblood)
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “I know it seems far-fetched, even insulting to your intelligence, but there's a simple and highly satisfying explanation.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:249:0:0"
msgid "Stormblood Gilgamesh"
msgstr "Гильгамеш из эпохи Stormblood"

