#. ja: 「いろいろケリついたら、<br>生まれとか関係ねー国にしようぜ」<br>伝説の英雄：ノクティス・ルシス・チェラム
#. de: „Prinz zu sein ist auch nicht leicht.“
#. fr: “Quand tout sera réglé... plus personne n'aura à se soucier de ses origines.”
#. column 0: Noctis Lucis Caelum
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:252:0:8"
msgid "“Once this is all over, I say we break down the borders─come together as one nation.”"
msgstr "«Когда со всем этим покончим, давай уничтожим границы. Пусть все станут одним народом»."

#. ja: アマロ
#. de: Amaro
#. fr: amaro
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: These flying beasts are the primary form of transportation in the region of Norvrandt. Once similar to the cama, the creatures now known as “amaro” are the result of a magically enhanced selective breeding process conducted in ages past by Ronkan sorcerers. Although the techniques employed are long since lost, the old bloodline has yet been known to quicken in individual amaro, manifesting in the form of superior intellect.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:253:0:0"
msgid "Amaro"
msgstr "Амаро"

