#. ja: 「私の旦那様は、アム・アレーンの<br>鉱山開発も担った、タロース操業の大家……<br>ダイダロス社の跡取りなんだから～！」<br>ユールモア市民：ドゥリア・チャイ＆チャイ・ヌズ
#. de: „Mein Mann hat die Daedalus-Steinhauerei übernommen. Er hat geholfen, die Minen von Amh Araeng auszuheben und ist ein Experte in allen Talos-Fragen!“
#. fr: “Moi, j'ai la solution à votre problème<nbsp>! Mon marrri va s'occuper de vos talos<nbsp>! C'est un expert en la matière, c'est lui qui a supervisé les chantiers des mines d'Amh Araeng. Il n'est pas l'héritier de la Daedalus pour rrrien, héhé<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Lord and Lady Chai
#. column 2: 0
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:255:0:8"
msgid "“...Isn't that right, darling?” <br><br>“Er─ Yes. Yes, of course, dearest. Quite right.”"
msgstr "«...Правда ведь, дорогой?»<br><br>«Э-э... Да, да, конечно, дорогая. Всё верно»."

#. ja: ギガテンダー
#. de: Riesenkaktor
#. fr: gigapampa
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Primarily found in Amh Araeng and other arid desert regions, the gigantender is distinguished from the common sabotender by its unusual size and crown of multiple branches. Their fruit is said to be deliciously sweet but difficult to consume due to the large number of seeds they hold.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:256:0:0"
msgid "Gigantender"
msgstr "Гигантендер"

