msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:259:0:8"
msgid "“Where're me tools, gods damn ye!? I must set to work before the feelin' fades!”"
msgstr "«Где мои инструменты, чтоб их!? Надо приниматься за работу, пока не пропало вдохновение!»"

#. ja: フィリア
#. de: Philia
#. fr: Philia
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The Lightwarden of Lakeland. The manacles which encircled its four limbs were whispered to be remnants of its mortal life─an elf, once held prisoner within the Hour of Certain Durance. Meaning “brotherly love,” Philia was the name bitterly bestowed upon the eater after it descended upon its home village and devoured its former neighbors.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:260:0:0"
msgid "Philia"
msgstr "Филия"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Philia
#. fr: Philia
#. column 0: Philia
#. column 8: The Lightwarden of Lakeland. The manacles which encircled its four limbs were whispered to be remnants of its mortal life─an elf, once held prisoner within the Hour of Certain Durance. Meaning “brotherly love,” Philia was the name bitterly bestowed upon the eater after it descended upon its home village and devoured its former neighbors.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:260:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: レイクランドを支配していた大罪喰い。元は「責苦の監獄」に収監されていたエルフ族の囚人であり、四肢の鉄鎖は、その名残りだと囁かれている。強い絆で結ばれた郷村を襲い、人々を喰らったことから、「フィリア（隣人愛）」と呼ばれる。
#. de: Als Licht<shy>bringer kontrollierte Philia das Seenland. Ehe er zum Licht<shy>bringer wurde, war er ein Elf, der in der Kerkerplatte mit vier schweren Eisenketten an Armen und Beinen angekettet war. Nach seiner Ver<shy>wand<shy>lung zerstörte er sein Heimatdorf und verwandelte seine ehemaligen Nachbarn, Freunde und Verwandten, womit er die eigentliche Bedeutung seines neuen Namens auf unheilvolle Weise verhöhnte.
#. fr: Grand purgateur qui régnait sur Grand-Lac, Philia était à l'origine une Elfe emprisonnée à Suppliciante, et on dit que les chaînes qui s'étendent à chacun de ses membres seraient un vestige de cette période. Son nom vient du fait qu'elle aurait dévoré les habitants du village auquel elle était fortement liée.
#. column 0: Philia
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:260:0:8"
msgid "The Lightwarden of Lakeland. The manacles which encircled its four limbs were whispered to be remnants of its mortal life─an elf, once held prisoner within the Hour of Certain Durance. Meaning “brotherly love,” Philia was the name bitterly bestowed upon the eater after it descended upon its home village and devoured its former neighbors."
msgstr "Страж Света Лейкленда. Говорят, кандалы на всех четырёх его конечностях остались с тех времён, когда он был эльфом-узником Часа неминуемой расплаты. Пожирателя нарекли Филией — «братской любовью» — с горькой насмешкой: он обрушился на родную деревню и пожрал бывших соседей."

#. ja: ティターニア
#. de: Titania
#. fr: Titania
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: King and ruler of the faeries, Titania once defeated a Lightwarden that threatened Il Mheg, only to be corrupted by the aether that was subsequently released. For long years thence, the fallen monarch was kept imprisoned within Lyhe Ghiah.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:261:0:0"
msgid "Titania"
msgstr "Титания"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Titania
#. fr: Titania
#. column 0: Titania
#. column 8: King and ruler of the faeries, Titania once defeated a Lightwarden that threatened Il Mheg, only to be corrupted by the aether that was subsequently released. For long years thence, the fallen monarch was kept imprisoned within Lyhe Ghiah.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:261:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: イル・メグの妖精たちを束ねる妖精王。かつて、妖精たちを守らんと大罪喰いと戦い、倒すことに成功するも、強烈な光の力を浴びて大罪喰いと化してしまった過去を持つ。以後、長らくリェー・ギア城に幽閉されていた。
#. de: Zunächst kämpfte der König des Feenreiches mutig gegen die Sünden<shy>ver<shy>tilger, doch dabei sammelte sich immer mehr Licht in ihm an, bis er sich selbst in einen Licht<shy>bringer verwandelte und Il Mheg in unendlichem Licht erstrahlen ließ. Daraufhin wurde er in Schloss Lyhe Ghiah eingesperrt.
#. fr: Titania a autrefois réussi à protéger ses sujets en affrontant les grands purgateurs, mais le monarque du peuple féerique d'Il Mheg est devenu l'un d'entre eux après avoir été exposé à l'immense pouvoir de la Lumière. Ce qui lui a valu d'être longtemps enfermé au Lyhe Ghiah.
#. column 0: Titania
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:261:0:8"
msgid "King and ruler of the faeries, Titania once defeated a Lightwarden that threatened Il Mheg, only to be corrupted by the aether that was subsequently released. For long years thence, the fallen monarch was kept imprisoned within Lyhe Ghiah."
msgstr "Король и повелитель фей Титания когда-то одолел Стража Света, угрожавшего Ил-Мегу, но выпущенный при этом эфир осквернил его. Долгие годы павший монарх провёл в заточении в Лихе Гиа."

#. ja: エロース
#. de: Eros
#. fr: Éros
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The Lightwarden of the Rak'tika Greatwood. A chimerical monstrosity, Eros was thought to be the amalgamation of several unfortunate creatures that were caught up and fused together by the Flood of Light. The meaning of its name─“romantic love”─is a mocking play upon the intimate and uncontrolled embrace which resulted in its present appearance.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:262:0:0"
msgid "Eros"
msgstr "Эрос"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Eros
#. fr: Éros
#. column 0: Eros
#. column 8: The Lightwarden of the Rak'tika Greatwood. A chimerical monstrosity, Eros was thought to be the amalgamation of several unfortunate creatures that were caught up and fused together by the Flood of Light. The meaning of its name─“romantic love”─is a mocking play upon the intimate and uncontrolled embrace which resulted in its present appearance.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:262:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ラケティカ大森林を支配していた大罪喰い。キメラ生物を思わせる奇妙な姿は、「光の氾濫」に巻き込まれた複数の獣が結合したものと推測される。その無節操な交わりから、「エロース（性愛）」と呼ばれる。
#. de: Eros herrschte als Licht<shy>bringer über den Großen Wald Rak'tika. Seine chimärenhafte Gestalt entstand aus mehreren Tierleibern, die von der Lichtflut verschlungen wurden, und das ungezügelte Verlangen der Bestien wütete in ihm.
#. fr: Grand purgateur qui se terrait dans la grande forêt de Rak'tika, Éros rappelle par son apparence les créatures chimériques. Certain estiment qu'il s'agit en réalité de plusieurs monstres ayant fusionnés ensemble lors du déluge de Lumière. Son nom viendrait du fait que cet étrange mélange évoque une débauche sexuelle.
#. column 0: Eros
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:262:0:8"
msgid "The Lightwarden of the Rak'tika Greatwood. A chimerical monstrosity, Eros was thought to be the amalgamation of several unfortunate creatures that were caught up and fused together by the Flood of Light. The meaning of its name─“romantic love”─is a mocking play upon the intimate and uncontrolled embrace which resulted in its present appearance."
msgstr "Страж Света Великого леса Рак'тика. Эрос — чудовищная химера, в которой, как полагают, слились несколько существ, застигнутых Потопом. Его имя означает «романтическая любовь» и насмешливо описывает беспорядочное слияние, придавшее ему нынешний облик."

#. ja: ストルゲー
#. de: Storge
#. fr: Storgê
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The Lightwarden of Amh Araeng. Believed to have arisen from the corrupted essence of a sprite or faerie, the entity named for “familial love” made its lair in Malikah's Well. Legends tell that Storge feasted upon the memories infused within its domain─upon a queen's adulation for her departed king.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:263:0:0"
msgid "Storge"
msgstr "Сторге"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Storge
#. fr: Storgê
#. column 0: Storge
#. column 8: The Lightwarden of Amh Araeng. Believed to have arisen from the corrupted essence of a sprite or faerie, the entity named for “familial love” made its lair in Malikah's Well. Legends tell that Storge feasted upon the memories infused within its domain─upon a queen's adulation for her departed king.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:263:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アム・アレーンを支配していた大罪喰い。おそらく、スプライトなどの妖精綱の存在が罪喰い化したものと思われる。マリカの大井戸を根城にしていたため、亡き王に捧げられた女王の愛を喰らった者として「ストルゲー（家族愛）」と呼ばれる。
#. de: Der Licht<shy>bringer Storge hatte ganz Amh Araeng unterjocht. Es wird vermutet, dass er ursprünglich ein Exergon oder ein anderes Geisterwesen war. Nach seiner Ver<shy>wand<shy>lung nistete er sich in Malikahs Brunnen ein, der einst von Prinzessin Malikah aus Trauer um ihren geliebten Vater errichtet wurde.
#. fr: Maître des terres d'Amh Araeng, ce grand purgateur serait à l'origine une créature appartenant à la classe des êtres féeriques. Il a centré son règne autour du Puits de Malikah, et le nom de Storgê lui aurait été donné parce qu'il s'est nourrit de l'amour d'une reine envers son défunt roi.
#. column 0: Storge
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:263:0:8"
msgid "The Lightwarden of Amh Araeng. Believed to have arisen from the corrupted essence of a sprite or faerie, the entity named for “familial love” made its lair in Malikah's Well. Legends tell that Storge feasted upon the memories infused within its domain─upon a queen's adulation for her departed king."
msgstr "Страж Света Ам-Аранга. Считают, что это существо возникло из осквернённой сущности спрайта или феи. Сторге, чьё имя означает «семейная любовь», обосновался в Колодце Маликки. По легенде, он пировал воспоминаниями, хранившимися в этом месте, — любовью королевы к покойному королю."

#. ja: フォーミダブル
#. de: Formidabel
#. fr: Formidable
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The Goggs employed every engineering trick in the book to complete the construction of this gigantic automaton. Seeking only to outdo the works of their hated rivals, the Tholls, they focused on sheer size to the exclusion of all else─an oversight which resulted in the creation of a massive, unstable machine that no dwarf could control.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:264:0:0"
msgid "Formidable"
msgstr "Формидебль"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Formidabel
#. fr: Formidable
#. column 0: Formidable
#. column 8: The Goggs employed every engineering trick in the book to complete the construction of this gigantic automaton. Seeking only to outdo the works of their hated rivals, the Tholls, they focused on sheer size to the exclusion of all else─an oversight which resulted in the creation of a massive, unstable machine that no dwarf could control.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:264:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: コグー一家に属すドワーフ族たちが、あらん限りの技術力を込めて造り上げた超大型オートマトン。トルー一家よりも凄いモノが造れることを示すため、ただひたすらに大型化させた結果、制御不能の暴走マシンが生まれてしまったようだ。
#. de: Dieser gigantische Eisenbart wurde von den Goggs erbaut, um das Dorf der Tholls zu vernichten. Allerdings haben sie sich bei diesem Projekt übernommen, denn die Konstruktion war einfach zu gewaltig und kompliziert, sodass die Goggs letzten Endes die Kontrolle über Formidabel verloren.
#. fr: Les Nains du clan des Gogg ont créé cet immense automate en employant toute l'étendue de leur savoir-faire afin de démontrer qu'ils étaient capable de faire mieux que leurs rivaux des Tholl. Hélas, le résultat de leur orgueil est qu'ils ont été incapable de contrôler cette machine devenue source de destruction.
#. column 0: Formidable
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:264:0:8"
msgid "The Goggs employed every engineering trick in the book to complete the construction of this gigantic automaton. Seeking only to outdo the works of their hated rivals, the Tholls, they focused on sheer size to the exclusion of all else─an oversight which resulted in the creation of a massive, unstable machine that no dwarf could control."
msgstr "Гогги пустили в ход все свои инженерные хитрости, чтобы построить этого гигантского автомата. Они хотели превзойти своих заклятых соперников толлей и сосредоточились лишь на размерах, забыв обо всём остальном. В результате вышла огромная неустойчивая машина, которую ни один дворф не смог контролировать."

#. ja: ライナ
#. de: Lyna
#. fr: Lyna
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Injuries are part and parcel of battle. While there's breath in my lungs, I shall see my duties done.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:265:0:0"
msgid "Lyna"
msgstr "Лина"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Lyna
#. fr: Lyna
#. column 0: Lyna
#. column 8: “Injuries are part and parcel of battle. While there's breath in my lungs, I shall see my duties done.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:265:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「……勝利と闇は、我らとともに」<br>クリスタリウム衛兵団団長：ライナ
#. de: „Wir werden das Orakel des Lichts aus den Klauen Eulmores befreien. Möge das Schlachtenglück mit uns sein!“
#. fr: “Nous sommes parés à exécuter le plan, et les autres bases le seront très bientôt. Nous sauverons la prêtresse de la Lumière, quoi qu'il en coûte. Que les Ténèbres nous apportent la victoire<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Lyna
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:265:0:8"
msgid "“Injuries are part and parcel of battle. While there's breath in my lungs, I shall see my duties done.”"
msgstr "«...Победа и тьма с нами»."

#. ja: ユールモアの道化
#. de: Närrinnen
#. fr: bouffonnes d'Eulmore
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Having seen your all-too-obvious charms, we welcome you with open arms!”<br><br>“Ah, just look at those expectant faces! What could you <i>possibly</i> be waiting for!?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:266:0:0"
msgid "Jongleurs of Eulmore"
msgstr "Шуты Юлмора"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Närrinnen
#. fr: bouffonnes d'Eulmore
#. column 0: Jongleurs of Eulmore
#. column 8: “Having seen your all-too-obvious charms, we welcome you with open arms!”<br><br>“Ah, just look at those expectant faces! What could you <i>possibly</i> be waiting for!?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:266:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「キミを、ユールモアにお迎えするよ！<br>幸せの街で、これからずぅ～っと、腕を振るっておくれ！」<br>ユールモアの道化
#. de: „Du wirst nach Eulmore gehen, in die Stadt des Glücks! Dort wirst du die Gelegenheit haben, dein Können unter Beweis zu stellen<nbsp>- bis ans Ende deiner Tage!“
#. fr: “Oui, c'est pas mal du tout<nbsp>! Nous t'emmenons avec nous à Eulmore<nbsp>! À partir d'aujourd'hui, tu vas pouvoir exprimer tes talents de cuisinière dans notre paradis sur terre<nbsp>!”<br>“Regardez-moi tous ces visages impatients<nbsp>! Ne vous en faites pas, nous savons très bien ce que vous attendez<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Jongleurs of Eulmore
#. column 2: 0
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:266:0:8"
msgid "“Having seen your all-too-obvious charms, we welcome you with open arms!”<br><br>“Ah, just look at those expectant faces! What could you <i>possibly</i> be waiting for!?”"
msgstr "«Разглядев твои несомненные достоинства, мы распахиваем перед тобой объятия!»<br><br>«Ах, гляньте на эти нетерпеливые лица! Чего же вы <i>так</i> ждёте!?»"

#. ja: イノセンス
#. de: Innozenz
#. fr: Innocence
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Corrupted by the power of a Lightwarden whilst he was yet a babe in the womb, Lord Vauthry, ruler of Eulmore, underwent a drastic metamorphosis when that power was awoken. He assumed the form of “Innocence,” an entity whose radiant might and presence would eclipse all Wardens that had come before.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:267:0:0"
msgid "Innocence"
msgstr "Невинность"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Innozenz
#. fr: Innocence
#. column 0: Innocence
#. column 8: Corrupted by the power of a Lightwarden whilst he was yet a babe in the womb, Lord Vauthry, ruler of Eulmore, underwent a drastic metamorphosis when that power was awoken. He assumed the form of “Innocence,” an entity whose radiant might and presence would eclipse all Wardens that had come before.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:267:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ユールモアの元首、ドン・ヴァウスリーが変異した大罪喰い。生前に埋め込まれた罪喰いの因子を覚醒させたことで、以前とは似ても似つかない姿に様変わりしている。その力は、既存の大罪喰いを大きく凌駕するものであった。
#. de: Lord Vauthrys verkommene Existenz gipfelte in seiner Ver<shy>wand<shy>lung in einen Licht<shy>bringer, der weitaus mächtiger als alle bisherigen Geschöpfe des Lichts war.
#. fr: Ce grand purgateur était à l'origine don Vauthry, le gouverneur d'Eulmore. L'éveil de facteurs qui lui ont été transmis avant sa naissance ont fait que son apparence a com<shy>plè<shy>te<shy>ment changé après sa transformation. Son pouvoir était bien supérieur à celui des autres grands purgateurs.
#. column 0: Innocence
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:267:0:8"
msgid "Corrupted by the power of a Lightwarden whilst he was yet a babe in the womb, Lord Vauthry, ruler of Eulmore, underwent a drastic metamorphosis when that power was awoken. He assumed the form of “Innocence,” an entity whose radiant might and presence would eclipse all Wardens that had come before."
msgstr "Лорд Ваутри, правитель Юлмора, ещё во чреве матери был заражён силой Стража Света. Когда эта сила пробудилась, он претерпел страшное превращение и стал Невинностью — существом, чей сияющий облик и мощь затмили всех прежних Стражей."

#. ja: ヤ・シュトラ（漆黒）
#. de: Y'shtola (Shadowbringers)
#. fr: Y'shtola (Shadowbringers)
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Did you really think I would go gently into that dark night with so much left undone? So many mysteries left unsolved?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:268:0:0"
msgid "Shadowbringers Y'shtola"
msgstr "Я'штола (Shadowbringers)"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Y'shtola (Shadowbringers)
#. fr: Y'shtola (Shadowbringers)
#. column 0: Shadowbringers Y'shtola
#. column 8: “Did you really think I would go gently into that dark night with so much left undone? So many mysteries left unsolved?”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:268:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「逃げる？　そんな必要ないわ……。<br>あの人が戻るまで、この地は私が制する！」<br>魔女マトーヤ：ヤ・シュトラ
#. de: „Es gibt keinen Grund davonzulaufen. Im Gegenteil: Es ist Zeit, in die Offensive zu gehen.“
#. fr: “Échapper<nbsp>? Je n'ai nulle intention de fuir mes problèmes. Jusqu'au retour de notre ami<if $gn4>e</if>, je continuerai de tenir bon.”
#. column 0: Shadowbringers Y'shtola
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:268:0:8"
msgid "“Did you really think I would go gently into that dark night with so much left undone? So many mysteries left unsolved?”"
msgstr "«Неужели ты и вправду решил, что я смирюсь с этой тьмой, когда столько дел ещё не сделано? Столько загадок не разгадано?»"

#. ja: ウリエンジェ（漆黒）
#. de: Urianger (Shadowbringers)
#. fr: Urianger (Shadowbringers)
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “We cannot deny our fate. But one course lieth before us.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:269:0:0"
msgid "Shadowbringers Urianger"
msgstr "Урианже (Shadowbringers)"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Urianger (Shadowbringers)
#. fr: Urianger (Shadowbringers)
#. column 0: Shadowbringers Urianger
#. column 8: “We cannot deny our fate. But one course lieth before us.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:269:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「運命に抗うか、それとも受け入れるか、<br>いずれにせよ退路はありません」<br>暁の血盟：ウリエンジェ
#. de: „Sich dem Schicksal widersetzen oder es akzeptieren? Ich glaube, der Weg liegt klar vor uns.“
#. fr: “Qu'en dites-vous, Maître Matoya<nbsp>? Nous pouvons accepter notre sort ou le défier. Mais nous ne pouvons y échapper.”
#. column 0: Shadowbringers Urianger
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:269:0:8"
msgid "“We cannot deny our fate. But one course lieth before us.”"
msgstr "«Судьбу не отвергнуть. Но путь у нас лишь один»"

#. ja: ランジート
#. de: Ran'jit
#. fr: Ran'jit
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Enough talk. I am a soldier, and you are my enemy.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:270:0:0"
msgid "Ran'jit"
msgstr "Ран'джит"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Ran'jit
#. fr: Ran'jit
#. column 0: Ran'jit
#. column 8: “Enough talk. I am a soldier, and you are my enemy.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:270:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「格別な理由も、妖術も不要。<br>我はただ、ヴァウスリーの掲げた理想を善しとしたのみ」<br>ユールモア軍将軍：ランジート
#. de: „Ich diene Lord Vauthry aus freien Stücken, weil ich sein Weltbild teile.“
#. fr: “N'allez pas chercher de raison cachée à mes actes, il n'y en a pas. Je sers don Vauthry car je crois en son idéal, c'est aussi simple que cela. L'homme ne pourra jamais échapper à la tentation de la guerre, quand bien même il chercherait à faire ce qui est juste.”
#. column 0: Ran'jit
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:270:0:8"
msgid "“Enough talk. I am a soldier, and you are my enemy.”"
msgstr "«Хватит разговоров. Я солдат, а ты мой враг»"

#. ja: ハーデス
#. de: Hades
#. fr: Hadès
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Was Hades always lurking beneath the surface of Emet-Selch? Or was this a case of transcendence, an aberrant being spawned from a crucible of ancient hope and prayer? Whichever the truth may be, this implacable immortal would never cease his struggle, never abandon the path which led to his fallen brethren's resurrection.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:271:0:0"
msgid "Hades"
msgstr "Аид"

