msgstr "0"

#. ja: その存在は、アシエン・エメトセルクの正体と見るべきか、あるいは彼が数多の古代人の想いを背負った結果、生まれた異形の存在と見るべきか。いずれにせよ、死滅した同胞の復活という大願を成就させるべく、彼は戦い続けてきたのだ。
#. de: Es lässt sich darüber streiten, ob Hades die wahre Gestalt des Ascians Emet-Selch war oder eine verzerrte Verkörperung seiner Ver<shy>zweif<shy>lung und seines Hasses. Unzweifelhaft ist, dass er für die Wie<shy>der<shy>auf<shy>er<shy>steh<shy>ung seines vor ewiger Zeit ausgelöschten Volkes kämpfte.
#. fr: Qu'il s'agisse de la véritable identité de l'Ascien Emet-Selch ou d'une entité née de la volonté de porter le désir de nombreux anciens, Hadès a continué à se battre afin de redonner la vie à ses semblables.
#. column 0: Hades
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:271:0:8"
msgid "Was Hades always lurking beneath the surface of Emet-Selch? Or was this a case of transcendence, an aberrant being spawned from a crucible of ancient hope and prayer? Whichever the truth may be, this implacable immortal would never cease his struggle, never abandon the path which led to his fallen brethren's resurrection."
msgstr "Всегда ли Аид таился в глубине Эмет-Селха? Или же он переродился в чудовище, возникшее из горнила древних надежд и молитв? Какова бы ни была правда, этот неумолимый бессмертный не прекращал борьбы и не сворачивал с пути, ведущего к воскрешению павших собратьев."

#. ja: アルバート
#. de: Ardbert
#. fr: Ardbert
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “My story may be finished, but the fates have gifted me a minor role in yours.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:272:0:0"
msgid "Ardbert"
msgstr "Ардберт"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Ardbert
#. fr: Ardbert
#. column 0: Ardbert
#. column 8: “My story may be finished, but the fates have gifted me a minor role in yours.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:272:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「世界はまだ 終わらせない。<br>冒険は どこまでだって続いていく――！」<br>光の戦士にして闇の戦士：アルバート
#. de: „Diese Welt ist noch nicht am Ende!<br>Dies ist unsere Geschichte! Unser Abenteuer!“
#. fr: “Ce monde n'a pas dit son dernier mot. L'aventure n'est pas terminée, au contraire... elle ne fait que commencer<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Ardbert
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:272:0:8"
msgid "“My story may be finished, but the fates have gifted me a minor role in yours.”"
msgstr "«Моя история, может, и окончена, но судьба отвела мне небольшую роль в твоей»"

#. ja: ホブゴブリン
#. de: Hobgoblin
#. fr: hobgobelin
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: These brutish folk have long plagued the region of Norvrandt. Reasonably intelligent and capable of speech and toolcraft, they are nonetheless devoid of anything resembling a moral compass, and primarily occupy themselves with thieving and trickery. Amongst the dwarves, few insults cut as sharp as having one's mother likened to a hobgoblin.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:273:0:0"
msgid "Hobgoblin"
msgstr "Хобгоблин"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Hobgoblins
#. fr: hobgobelins
#. column 0: Hobgoblin
#. column 8: These brutish folk have long plagued the region of Norvrandt. Reasonably intelligent and capable of speech and toolcraft, they are nonetheless devoid of anything resembling a moral compass, and primarily occupy themselves with thieving and trickery. Amongst the dwarves, few insults cut as sharp as having one's mother likened to a hobgoblin.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:273:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ノルヴラントに棲まう獣人種族。言語や道具を操る程度の知性はあるが、概ね粗暴で倫理観を持ち合わせておらず、野盗として暮らす者が多い。なお、「お前の母ちゃんホブゴブリン」とは、ドワーフ族にとって最大級の侮蔑表現となる。
#. de: Diese Wesen aus Norvrandt können sprechen und sind schlau genug, um Waffen und Werkzeuge zu benutzen, doch man kann sie nicht gerade als zivilisiert bezeichnen. Die meisten von ihnen sind ausgesprochen wild und gefährlich. Unter Zwergen gilt „Deine Mutter ist ein Hobgoblin!“ als allerschlimmste Beleidigung.
#. fr: Connus en Norvrandt pour semer la terreur partout où ils passent, ces hommes-bêtes sont pourtant plus civilisés qu'on ne pourrait le croire, puisqu'ils disposent d'un langage et savent manier des outils. En revanche, ils n'ont aucune morale et vivent prin<shy>ci<shy>pa<shy>le<shy>ment de pillages et autres larcins. Pour un Nain, l'assimilation de sa mère à une de ces viles créatures est la pire des insultes.
#. column 0: Hobgoblin
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:273:0:8"
msgid "These brutish folk have long plagued the region of Norvrandt. Reasonably intelligent and capable of speech and toolcraft, they are nonetheless devoid of anything resembling a moral compass, and primarily occupy themselves with thieving and trickery. Amongst the dwarves, few insults cut as sharp as having one's mother likened to a hobgoblin."
msgstr "Эти грубые создания издавна досаждают жителям Норврандта. Они достаточно разумны, умеют говорить и обращаться с инструментами, но напрочь лишены понятий о добре и зле, предпочитая воровство и обман. Для гномов мало какое оскорбление сравнится с тем, чтобы назвать их мать хобгоблином."

#. ja: ポークシー
#. de: Quiexie
#. fr: porxie
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Porcine familiars given life by the Nu Mou by imbuing bodies crafted from the richest of clays and the purest of waters with the magic of a fae lantern. Rumor has it that they are also quite tasty when eaten, if one can temporarily forget the fact that they are consuming a form of mud.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:274:0:0"
msgid "Porxie"
msgstr "Поркси"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Quiexies
#. fr: porxies
#. column 0: Porxie
#. column 8: Porcine familiars given life by the Nu Mou by imbuing bodies crafted from the richest of clays and the purest of waters with the magic of a fae lantern. Rumor has it that they are also quite tasty when eaten, if one can temporarily forget the fact that they are consuming a form of mud.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:274:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ン・モゥ族が創る使い魔。良質な泥と水をこねて、「妖精のランプ」と呼ばれるピクシー族由来の魔力を吹き込むことで、自律行動が可能な魔法生物として誕生する。食べると、それなりに美味いが、元が泥だということは忘れずに。
#. de: Quiexies werden von den Nu Mou als Familiare erschaffen. Dafür wird nicht viel mehr benötigt als etwas Wasser und Lehm von einer gewissen Reinheit und eine sogenannte Feenlaterne, welche mit der magischen Magie der Pixies angereichert ist. Quiexies sind relativ selbstständig, und sie schmecken auch gar nicht schlecht, wenn man den Gedanken verdrängt, dass sie aus Lehm erschaffen wurden.
#. fr: Les familiers préférés des Nu Mou sont en réalité fabriqués à partir d'un mélange d'eau et d'argile cuit au feu d'une loupiote féérique. Leur chair est également très savoureuse, si tant est qu'on considère la boue comme un aliment consommable.
#. column 0: Porxie
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:274:0:8"
msgid "Porcine familiars given life by the Nu Mou by imbuing bodies crafted from the richest of clays and the purest of waters with the magic of a fae lantern. Rumor has it that they are also quite tasty when eaten, if one can temporarily forget the fact that they are consuming a form of mud."
msgstr "Ну Мо создают этих свиноподобных фамильяров из отборной глины и чистейшей воды, наделяя их магией фонаря фей. Говорят, они довольно вкусны, если на время забыть, что ешь разновидность грязи."

#. ja: イグアナ
#. de: Leguan
#. fr: iguane
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Massive, vicious reptiles that inhabit the island of Kholusia. Skillfully wielding their long, prehensile tongues, they seize their prey with fearsome speed and accuracy. Prone to insatiable pangs of hunger, the largest of these creatures have been known to swallow unfortunate dwarves whole.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:275:0:0"
msgid "Iguana"
msgstr "Игуана"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Leguane
#. fr: iguanes
#. column 0: Iguana
#. column 8: Massive, vicious reptiles that inhabit the island of Kholusia. Skillfully wielding their long, prehensile tongues, they seize their prey with fearsome speed and accuracy. Prone to insatiable pangs of hunger, the largest of these creatures have been known to swallow unfortunate dwarves whole.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:275:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: コルシア島などに棲息する爬虫類。長い舌を巧みに使い、獲物を捉えることで知られる。大きく成長するほど、食欲が増すらしく狩りに熱心になり、場合によってはドワーフを丸呑みにすることもあるようだ。
#. de: Diese unter anderem auf Kholusia weit verbreiteten Reptile sind bekannt dafür, ihre Opfer mit ihren langen Zungen zu fangen. Je größer sie werden, desto größer wird auch ihr Appetit. Ab einer gewissen Größe besteht die Gefahr, dass sie den ein oder anderen Zwerg verschlingen.
#. fr: Ces reptiles massifs chassent leurs proies dans toute l'île de Kholusia. Leur goût pour la prédation est proportionnel à leur corpulence et à la longueur de leur langue, et certains spécimens seraient même capables de gober un Nain en une seule bouchée.
#. column 0: Iguana
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:275:0:8"
msgid "Massive, vicious reptiles that inhabit the island of Kholusia. Skillfully wielding their long, prehensile tongues, they seize their prey with fearsome speed and accuracy. Prone to insatiable pangs of hunger, the largest of these creatures have been known to swallow unfortunate dwarves whole."
msgstr "Крупные свирепые рептилии, обитающие на острове Холусия. Длинным цепким языком они ловко хватают добычу с пугающей скоростью и точностью. Игуаны страдают от ненасытного голода, и самые большие из них способны проглотить целого гнома."

#. ja: ン・モゥ
#. de: Nu Mou
#. fr: Nu Mou
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A fae race that inhabits the faerie kingdom of Il Mheg. Noted for their warm disposition and welcoming attitude towards the mortal races, they enjoyed close relations with the Kingdom of Voeburt in the days before the Flood. With fair exchange as their foremost principle, they are willing to barter for a wide range of goods and services.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:276:0:0"
msgid "Nu Mou"
msgstr "Ну Мо"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Nu Mou
#. fr: Nu Mou
#. column 0: Nu Mou
#. column 8: A fae race that inhabits the faerie kingdom of Il Mheg. Noted for their warm disposition and welcoming attitude towards the mortal races, they enjoyed close relations with the Kingdom of Voeburt in the days before the Flood. With fair exchange as their foremost principle, they are willing to barter for a wide range of goods and services.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:276:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 妖精郷イル・メグに住まう妖精種族のひとつ。人との交わりを望む温厚な種族で、特にフッブート王国の民とは浅からぬ絆で結ばれていた。公正な取引を名誉と考える独特の価値観を有しており、それゆえ「対価の収集家」とも呼ばれる。
#. de: Im Vergleich zu den anderen Feenwesen von Il Mheg sind die Nu Mou erstaunlich sanftmütig, freundlich und aufgeschlossen. Vielleicht liegt es daran, dass sie einst eng mit den Bewohnern des Königreichs Voeburt verbunden waren. Sie legen besonders viel Wert auf faire Absprachen. Aus ihrer Sicht erfordert jede Form von Hilfe eine angemessene Gegenleistung.
#. fr: Les Nu Mou sont le peuple féérique de l'Il Mheg qui a développé les rapports les plus profonds avec les humains, notamment en raison de leurs liens avec le royaume de Voeburt. Ils considèrent l'équité comme un principe sacré, ce qui en fait de très bons partenaires commerciaux.
#. column 0: Nu Mou
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:276:0:8"
msgid "A fae race that inhabits the faerie kingdom of Il Mheg. Noted for their warm disposition and welcoming attitude towards the mortal races, they enjoyed close relations with the Kingdom of Voeburt in the days before the Flood. With fair exchange as their foremost principle, they are willing to barter for a wide range of goods and services."
msgstr "Народ фей, живущий в сказочном краю Ил-Мег. Ну Мо добродушны и приветливы с другими смертными народами. До Потопа они были тесно связаны с королевством Фоэбурт. Считая честный обмен главным принципом, они готовы торговаться за самые разные товары и услуги."

#. ja: フーア
#. de: Fuath
#. fr: Fuath
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A fae race that inhabits the faerie kingdom of Il Mheg. Also known as water spirits, they make their home in lakes, fiercely protecting the waterfront from would-be interlopers. The sheer cruelty and tastelessness of the pranks they play on outsiders has earned them the scorn of the more playful pixies.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:277:0:0"
msgid "Fuath"
msgstr "Фуат"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Fuath
#. fr: Fuath
#. column 0: Fuath
#. column 8: A fae race that inhabits the faerie kingdom of Il Mheg. Also known as water spirits, they make their home in lakes, fiercely protecting the waterfront from would-be interlopers. The sheer cruelty and tastelessness of the pranks they play on outsiders has earned them the scorn of the more playful pixies.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:277:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 妖精郷イル・メグに住まう妖精種族のひとつ。「水妖」の別名で呼ばれるように、彼らは水辺を縄張りとしており、近づく者には容赦なくイタズラで応じる。その悪趣味さは、ピクシー族ですら嫌悪するほどだという。
#. de: Die Fuath gehören zu den Feen von Il Mheg. Als Wasserwesen leben sie in Flüssen und Seen. Wer ihrem nassen Reich zu nah kommt, dem spielen sie üble Streiche. Ihre Bösartigkeit wird sogar von den anderen Feen gefürchtet.
#. fr: Les Fuath sont des fées aquatiques vivant autour des points d'eau de l'Il Mheg. Nettement moins affables que les Nu Mou, leurs facéties envers les visiteurs de la région peuvent atteindre un tel degré de méchanceté qu'elles vont jusqu'à choquer les Pixies elles-mêmes.
#. column 0: Fuath
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:277:0:8"
msgid "A fae race that inhabits the faerie kingdom of Il Mheg. Also known as water spirits, they make their home in lakes, fiercely protecting the waterfront from would-be interlopers. The sheer cruelty and tastelessness of the pranks they play on outsiders has earned them the scorn of the more playful pixies."
msgstr "Народ фей, живущий в сказочном краю Ил-Мег. Фуатов также называют водяными духами: они обитают в озёрах и яростно защищают берега от незваных гостей. Их жестокие и безвкусные проделки над чужаками снискали им презрение даже у более игривых пикси."

#. ja: リャナンシー
#. de: Leanan Sidhe
#. fr: Leannan Sith
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: An ambulatory plant with a body indistinguishable from that of a voluptuous woman. With their beauty and siren song, they lure ill-fated hunters and woodcutters deep into the forest, where they drain the life force of their prey.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:278:0:0"
msgid "Leannan Sith"
msgstr "Линнан-сид"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Leanan Sidhe
#. fr: Leannan Sith
#. column 0: Leannan Sith
#. column 8: An ambulatory plant with a body indistinguishable from that of a voluptuous woman. With their beauty and siren song, they lure ill-fated hunters and woodcutters deep into the forest, where they drain the life force of their prey.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:278:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: まるで人の女性のように見える移動性植物。これは、猟師や木こりなど森に分け入る者を惑わし、その生命力を吸い尽くすために手に入れた能力らしい。時には魅力的な歌声によって、獲物を誘引することもあるらしい。
#. de: Diese außer<shy>ge<shy>wöhn<shy>liche Pflanze sieht beinahe so aus wie eine Frau. Sie lockt Jäger und Holzfäller im Wald an, um ihre Lebensenergie auszusaugen. Das gelingt ihr nicht nur durch ihre betörende Erscheinung sondern auch durch ihre unwiderstehliche Singstimme.
#. fr: De la même manière que les sirènes des mers, ce végétal aux allures de jeune femme aux formes voluptueuses attire à lui ses proies avec son chant enjôleur, afin de se nourrir de leur énergie vitale quand elles se montrent trop faibles pour résister à ses charmes.
#. column 0: Leannan Sith
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:278:0:8"
msgid "An ambulatory plant with a body indistinguishable from that of a voluptuous woman. With their beauty and siren song, they lure ill-fated hunters and woodcutters deep into the forest, where they drain the life force of their prey."
msgstr "Подвижное растение, чьё тело не отличить от тела пышнотелой женщины. Красотой и чарующей песней оно заманивает незадачливых охотников и дровосеков в самую чащу, где высасывает из добычи жизненную силу."

#. ja: 黒の導師
#. de: Einsiedler
#. fr: ermite du palais
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: This Nu Mou hermit makes their home deep in the Grand Cosmos, an abandoned palace that was once ruled over by the elven kings of old. Their frightening garb is simply an affectation meant to ward off unwanted visitors─their true appearance is unassuming and even charming. As their research focuses primarily on the power of souls, they have given life to many an arcane entity.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:279:0:0"
msgid "Seeker of Solitude"
msgstr "Искатель уединения"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Einsiedler
#. fr: ermites du palais
#. column 0: Seeker of Solitude
#. column 8: This Nu Mou hermit makes their home deep in the Grand Cosmos, an abandoned palace that was once ruled over by the elven kings of old. Their frightening garb is simply an affectation meant to ward off unwanted visitors─their true appearance is unassuming and even charming. As their research focuses primarily on the power of souls, they have given life to many an arcane entity.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:279:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 放棄されたエルフ族の宮殿、グラン・コスモスを根城にするン・モゥ族の隠者。人の接近を拒むために、恐ろしげな装束をまとっているが、実際には可愛らしい顔立ちをしている。魂の研究家であり、魔法生物の生成に長けている。
#. de: Dieser Einsiedler lebt in dem alten Schloss der Elfen, das als Chateau Cosmea bekannt ist. Um sich unliebsamen Besuch vom Leib zu halten, trägt er ein furcht<shy>ein<shy>flößendes Gewand, doch darunter verbirgt sich ein geradezu niedliches Gesicht. Besonders gut versteht er sich auf die Seelenkunde und die Züchtung magischer Wesen.
#. fr: Déçu par les hommes et leur soif de pouvoir, un Nu Mou décida un jour de se retirer à tout jamais dans le Cosmos coruscant, un palais autrefois habité par les familles royales elfiques. Il s'est alors vêtu de ce déguisement fort peu engageant, tout l'opposé de son apparence naturelle des plus avenantes. Sa con<shy>nais<shy>san<shy>ce de la magie et des propriétés de l'âme est sans égale.
#. column 0: Seeker of Solitude
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:279:0:8"
msgid "This Nu Mou hermit makes their home deep in the Grand Cosmos, an abandoned palace that was once ruled over by the elven kings of old. Their frightening garb is simply an affectation meant to ward off unwanted visitors─their true appearance is unassuming and even charming. As their research focuses primarily on the power of souls, they have given life to many an arcane entity."
msgstr "Отшельник из народа ну Мо, обосновавшийся в глубине Великого Космоса — заброшенного дворца, которым некогда правили эльфийские короли. Страшные одежды он носит лишь затем, чтобы отвадить незваных гостей; на самом деле его внешность проста и даже обаятельна. Изучая силу душ, он оживил множество магических созданий."

#. ja: 光の巫女
#. de: Orakel des Lichts
#. fr: prêtresse de la Lumière
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “That selfsame hope lives on in you. It gives me comfort to know that the future is in capable hands.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:280:0:0"
msgid "Oracle of Light"
msgstr "Оракул Света"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Orakel des Lichts
#. fr: prêtresses de la Lumière
#. column 0: Oracle of Light
#. column 8: “That selfsame hope lives on in you. It gives me comfort to know that the future is in capable hands.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:280:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「あの願いは、あなたが拾ってくれたのね。<br>……わたしは、それで十分、胸を張ることができる」<br>光の巫女
#. de: „Du hast meinen Traum weitergeträumt. Da habe ich allen Grund, stolz auf mich zu sein.“
#. fr: “Je vois que tu as repris le flambeau... Ça suffit à me mettre du baume au cœur<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Oracle of Light
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:280:0:8"
msgid "“That selfsame hope lives on in you. It gives me comfort to know that the future is in capable hands.”"
msgstr "«Та самая надежда живёт теперь в тебе. Мне спокойно от мысли, что будущее в надёжных руках»"

#. ja: アルケオタニア
#. de: Archaeotania
#. fr: Archaeotania
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: This massive and monstrous beast that arose from the depths of the Tempest is said to bear a striking resemblance to one of the calamitous fiends that brought death and destruction to the civilization of the ancients. One rumor has it that it was recreated by the Ascian Emet-Selch, that people of this day might know the terror that he and his brethren suffered, but the truth remains shrouded in mystery.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:281:0:0"
msgid "Archaeotania"
msgstr "Археотания"

