#. ja: 「ガイア、私はここだよ！<br>ここであなたを待ってる！<br>約束したでしょ！？」<br>明日へと歩む者：リーン
#. de: „Gaia! Wir sind hier bei dir! Komm zu uns zurück!“
#. fr: “Gaïa<nbsp>! C'est moi, Ryne<nbsp>! Je suis là, avec <split " " 1><string $gs1></split><nbsp>! Reviens-nous<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Ryne
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:313:0:8"
msgid "“Gaia! We're right here beside you! Come back to us!”"
msgstr "«Гайя! Мы здесь, рядом с тобой! Возвращайся к нам!»"

#. ja: ガイア
#. de: Gaia
#. fr: Gaïa
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “...I could never forget you. Try as I might.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:314:0:0"
msgid "Gaia"
msgstr "Гайя"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Gaia
#. fr: Gaïa
#. column 0: Gaia
#. column 8: “...I could never forget you. Try as I might.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:314:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「当然よ、私が約束を忘れたことがある？」<br>明日へと歩む者：ガイア
#. de: „Ich könnte dich niemals vergessen. Selbst, wenn ich es versuchen würde.“
#. fr: “Évidemment. C'est pas mon genre d'oublier une promesse<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Gaia
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:314:0:8"
msgid "“...I could never forget you. Try as I might.”"
msgstr "«...Как бы я ни старалась, я не смогла бы тебя забыть»"

#. ja: プロミス・オブ・エデン
#. de: Edens Verheißung
#. fr: Promesse d'Éden
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Formed by the fusion of Mitron and Loghrif, this mysterious entity wields Eden's power to control the elements. Its aim is to create an eternal utopia, where the two Ascians may live in peace, never to be parted.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:315:0:0"
msgid "Eden's Promise"
msgstr "Обет Эдема"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Edens Verheißungen
#. fr: Promesse d'Éden
#. column 0: Eden's Promise
#. column 8: Formed by the fusion of Mitron and Loghrif, this mysterious entity wields Eden's power to control the elements. Its aim is to create an eternal utopia, where the two Ascians may live in peace, never to be parted.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:315:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アシエン・ミトロンとアシエン・アログリフの融合体が、エデンの属性操作能力を利用して創り出した「永遠の理想郷」の守護者。ふたたび分かたれることがないように、いつか交わした約束を結び目として、創出された。
#. de: Dieses mysteriöse Wesen ist aus der Vereinigung der Ascians Mitron und Loghrif entstanden und verfügt über Edens Macht über die Elemente. Es strebt die Verwirklichung eines ewigen Paradieses an, in dem die beiden Ascians für immer zusammen sein können.
#. fr: Fusion de Mitron et de Loghrif, cette mystérieuse entité manipule le pouvoir d'Éden pour contrôler les éléments. Son objectif est de créer un monde utopique leur permettant de vivre côte à côte en paix pour l'éternité.
#. column 0: Eden's Promise
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:315:0:8"
msgid "Formed by the fusion of Mitron and Loghrif, this mysterious entity wields Eden's power to control the elements. Its aim is to create an eternal utopia, where the two Ascians may live in peace, never to be parted."
msgstr "Слияние Митрона и Логриф породило загадочное существо, способное повелевать стихиями с помощью силы Эдема. Оно мечтает создать вечный рай, где оба асциана смогут жить в мире и никогда больше не разлучаться."

#. ja: フェニックス
#. de: Phoenix
#. fr: Phénix
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: This fiery entity is said to have manifested in the sky following the Battle of Carteneau. Although memories of that time were distorted by the effects of the Calamity, a number of survivors swear to have witnessed the immortal Phoenix, legendary symbol of rebirth, rise up and rescue Eorzea from certain annihilation.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:316:0:0"
msgid "Phoenix"
msgstr "Феникс"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Phoenixe
#. fr: Phénix
#. column 0: Phoenix
#. column 8: This fiery entity is said to have manifested in the sky following the Battle of Carteneau. Although memories of that time were distorted by the effects of the Calamity, a number of survivors swear to have witnessed the immortal Phoenix, legendary symbol of rebirth, rise up and rescue Eorzea from certain annihilation.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:316:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: カルテノーの戦いの直後に目撃された伝説の不死鳥。記憶の混乱を伴う「霊災の後遺症」によって、証言が一致しないものの、一部の者は滅びゆくエオルゼアを救ったのは、再生の象徴でもある不死鳥「フェニックス」だったと主張している。
#. de: Dieses feurige Wesen soll sich angeblich nach der Schlacht von Carteneau am Himmel manifestiert haben. Die Berichte aus dieser chaotischen Zeit der Katastrophe sind mit Vorsicht zu genießen, doch einige Überlebende schwören, der unsterbliche Phönix hätte sie gerettet. Sie sehen in ihm ein Symbol für die Wie<shy>der<shy>auf<shy>er<shy>steh<shy>ung Eorzeas.
#. fr: Bien que le Fléau ait jeté le trouble dans la mémoire de nombreux individus, certains survivants prétendent que cet oiseau de feu légendaire, symbole ultime de renaissance, serait apparu lors du dénouement de la bataille de Carteneau pour sauver Éorzéa d'une destruction qui semblait inévitable.
#. column 0: Phoenix
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:316:0:8"
msgid "This fiery entity is said to have manifested in the sky following the Battle of Carteneau. Although memories of that time were distorted by the effects of the Calamity, a number of survivors swear to have witnessed the immortal Phoenix, legendary symbol of rebirth, rise up and rescue Eorzea from certain annihilation."
msgstr "Говорят, это огненное создание появилось в небе после битвы при Картено. Воспоминания о тех событиях исказились из-за последствий Бедствия, но многие выжившие клянутся, что видели, как бессмертный Феникс — легендарный символ возрождения — взмыл в небо и спас Эорзею от неминуемой гибели."

#. ja: キーパー・オブ・ダンジョン
#. de: Kerkermeister
#. fr: gardien hypogéen
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The Fuath who repurposed the Dungeons of Lyhe Ghiah as their personal treasure vault likely put this cursed monstrosity in place as a guard. One wonders if the riotous hue of the creature's fur was deliberate, or simply a chaotic side effect of reckless fae enchantments.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:317:0:0"
msgid "Keeper of the Keys"
msgstr "Хранитель ключей"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Kerkermeister
#. fr: gardiens hypogéens
#. column 0: Keeper of the Keys
#. column 8: The Fuath who repurposed the Dungeons of Lyhe Ghiah as their personal treasure vault likely put this cursed monstrosity in place as a guard. One wonders if the riotous hue of the creature's fur was deliberate, or simply a chaotic side effect of reckless fae enchantments.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:317:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: リェー・ギア城の「ダンジョン」内をうろつく巨大な魔物。この地下空間を占拠し、宝物庫へと作り変えたフーア族たちが、宝の番人として配置したものだろう。彼らがかけた呪いの影響か、毛並みが異様な色合いに変色している。
#. de: Dieses schreckliche Ungeheuer wurde von den Fuath in den Kerker von Lyhe Ghiah gebracht, um ihre dort versteckten Schätze zu bewachen. Seine grelle Fellfarbe ist wohl eine Nebenwirkung der wilden Verzauberungen durch die Fuath.
#. fr: Quand les Fuath ont converti le donjon hypogéen du Lyhe Ghiah en coffre-fort personnel, il leur a fallu trouver un gardien pour veiller sur tous ces trésors. Ils ont finalement choisi ce gros patapouf, dont le pelage multicolore est pro<shy>ba<shy>ble<shy>ment le fruit d'un de leurs malicieux sortilèges.
#. column 0: Keeper of the Keys
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:317:0:8"
msgid "The Fuath who repurposed the Dungeons of Lyhe Ghiah as their personal treasure vault likely put this cursed monstrosity in place as a guard. One wonders if the riotous hue of the creature's fur was deliberate, or simply a chaotic side effect of reckless fae enchantments."
msgstr "Фуаты превратили Подземелья Лихе-Гии в собственную сокровищницу и, скорее всего, поставили эту проклятую тварь охранять её. Вот только её пёстрая шерсть — дело рук безрассудного волшебства фей или случайный побочный эффект?"

#. ja: ルナバハムート
#. de: Luna-Bahamut
#. fr: Luna-Bahamut
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: This manifestation of the elder primal is believed to have been called forth by Meracydian dragons held captive within one of the Telophoroi's mysterious towers. Due to the altered state of mind of those forced to perform in the summoning, its appearance differs greatly from the Bahamut that brought about the Seventh Umbral Calamity.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:318:0:0"
msgid "Lunar Bahamut"
msgstr "Лунный Бахамут"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Luna-Bahamut
#. fr: Luna-Bahamut
#. column 0: Lunar Bahamut
#. column 8: This manifestation of the elder primal is believed to have been called forth by Meracydian dragons held captive within one of the Telophoroi's mysterious towers. Due to the altered state of mind of those forced to perform in the summoning, its appearance differs greatly from the Bahamut that brought about the Seventh Umbral Calamity.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:318:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: テロフォロイが使役する異形の蛮神。おそらく捕獲した南方大陸のドラゴンたちの祈りを利用し、「異形の塔」において召喚されたものと思われる。しかし、その姿は第七霊災時に確認された龍神とは、異なる形に歪められていた。
#. de: Diese Manifestation des Primae wurde vermutlich von Drachen aus Meracydia gerufen, die in einem der Türme der Telophoroi eingesperrt waren. Ihre gemarterten Seelen hatten zur Folge, dass Bahamuts Erscheinung ebenso verzerrt und verändert ist.
#. fr: On soupçonne les Télophores d'avoir capturé des dragons sur le continent méridional de Méracydia, puis de les avoir emprisonnés dans une tour de l'apocalypse afin que leurs prières donnent naissance à ce Néo-Primordial. Bien que de nature semblable, ce dernier n'a pas exactement la même apparence que le Primordial Bahamut qui a ravagé Éorzéa lors du septième fléau.
#. column 0: Lunar Bahamut
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:318:0:8"
msgid "This manifestation of the elder primal is believed to have been called forth by Meracydian dragons held captive within one of the Telophoroi's mysterious towers. Due to the altered state of mind of those forced to perform in the summoning, its appearance differs greatly from the Bahamut that brought about the Seventh Umbral Calamity."
msgstr "Считают, что этот праймал явился по призыву мерацидийских драконов, которых телофорои держали в плену в одной из загадочных башен. Из-за изменённого сознания пленников облик праймала сильно отличается от Бахамута, вызвавшего Седьмое Бедствие."

#. ja: ウァレンス・ヴァン・ウァロ
#. de: Valens van Varro
#. fr: Valens van Varro
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “Burn out the bad! Burn out the bad!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:319:0:0"
msgid "Valens van Varro"
msgstr "Валенс ван Варро"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Valens van Varro
#. fr: Valens van Varro
#. column 0: Valens van Varro
#. column 8: “Burn out the bad! Burn out the bad!”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:319:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「がーんばれ、がーんばれッ！」<br>第VII軍団軍団長：ウァレンス・ヴァン・ウァロ
#. de: „Tu es, tu es, tu es!“
#. fr: “Allez<nbsp>! Courage<nbsp>! Allez<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Valens van Varro
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:319:0:8"
msgid "“Burn out the bad! Burn out the bad!”"
msgstr "«Сожги всё плохое! Сожги всё плохое!»"

#. ja: ルナイフリート
#. de: Luna-Ifrit
#. fr: Luna-Ifrit
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: This twisted fiend is believed to have been forcibly summoned by Amalj'aa held captive in one of the Telophoroi's towers. While similar in many ways to the Lord of the Inferno, he lacks the capacity to temper those in his vicinity.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:320:0:0"
msgid "Lunar Ifrit"
msgstr "Лунный Ифрит"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Luna-Ifrit
#. fr: Luna-Ifrit
#. column 0: Lunar Ifrit
#. column 8: This twisted fiend is believed to have been forcibly summoned by Amalj'aa held captive in one of the Telophoroi's towers. While similar in many ways to the Lord of the Inferno, he lacks the capacity to temper those in his vicinity.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:320:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: テロフォロイが使役する異形の蛮神。おそらく誘拐されたアマルジャ族の祈りを利用し、「異形の塔」において召喚されたものと思われる。焔神イフリートと同等以上の戦闘力を秘めているが、他者をテンパードにする能力はないようだ。
#. de: Diese Manifestation des Primae wurde vermutlich von den Amalj'aa gerufen, die in einem der Türme der Telophoroi eingesperrt waren. Ihre gemarterten Seelen hatten zur Folge, dass Ifrits Erscheinung ebenso verzerrt und verändert ist.
#. fr: Les Télophores ont capturé des Amalj'aa puis ont canalisé leurs prières dans une tour de l'apocalypse afin de donner naissance à ce Néo-Primodial. Bien que Luna-Ifrit soit plus puissant que le Seigneur des flammes original, il ne bénéficie pas de son redoutable pouvoir de subjugation.
#. column 0: Lunar Ifrit
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:320:0:8"
msgid "This twisted fiend is believed to have been forcibly summoned by Amalj'aa held captive in one of the Telophoroi's towers. While similar in many ways to the Lord of the Inferno, he lacks the capacity to temper those in his vicinity."
msgstr "Считается, что эту искажённую тварь насильно призвали амалджа, пленённые в одной из башен телофороев. Во многом она похожа на Владыку Инферно, но не способна обращать окружающих в подчинённых."

#. ja: IVレギオン・シュミハザ
#. de: Shemhazai der IV. Legion
#. fr: Shemhazai de la 4e légion
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A IVth Legion Zealot transformed by the power of auracite into a twisted monstrosity resembling Shemhazai, the Whisperer of Ivalician legend. She is believed to hold sway over the spirits of the netherworld.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:321:0:0"
msgid "4th-make Shemhazai"
msgstr "Шемхазай IV легиона"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Shemhazai der IV. Legion
#. fr: Shemhazai de la 4e légion
#. column 0: 4th-make Shemhazai
#. column 8: A IVth Legion Zealot transformed by the power of auracite into a twisted monstrosity resembling Shemhazai, the Whisperer of Ivalician legend. She is believed to hold sway over the spirits of the netherworld.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:321:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 第IV軍団魔導僧兵大隊に所属する異端僧兵が、聖石片の力で変異した存在。その姿は、イヴァリース伝説に登場する密告者シュミハザと酷似している。その記述によれば、異界に漂う霊魂を操る能力を有しているのだという。
#. de: Die Jünger, eine ketzerische Randgruppe der IV. Legion, haben ihr Leben riskiert und die Macht eines Auracitensplitters entfesselt. Ihre nunmehr verzerrten Gestalten ähneln sehr dem Verräter Shemhazai, einer Legende aus Ivalice. Der Sage nach hatte er die Fähigkeit, Geister einer anderen Welt zu manipulieren.
#. fr: Un prêtre magitek de la 4e légion a utilisé une auralithe sacrée et s'est sacrifié pour invoquer cette créature ressemblant étrangement à Shemhazai, le Sycophante. Ce personnage féminin des légendes ivaliciennes serait capable de manipuler les âmes errant outre-tombe.
#. column 0: 4th-make Shemhazai
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:321:0:8"
msgid "A IVth Legion Zealot transformed by the power of auracite into a twisted monstrosity resembling Shemhazai, the Whisperer of Ivalician legend. She is believed to hold sway over the spirits of the netherworld."
msgstr "Фанатик IV легиона, которого сила святого камня превратила в чудовище, похожее на Шемхазая, Шепчущего из ивалисских легенд. Считается, что он повелевает духами загробного мира."

#. ja: IVレギオン・キュクレイン
#. de: Cuchulainn der IV. Legion
#. fr: Cúchulainn de la 4e légion
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: This former Zealot of the IVth Legion was reborn by the power of auracite in the likeness of Cuchulainn, the Impure of Ivalician legend. While he shares his name with a renowned voidsent, this is believed to be no more than coincidence.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:322:0:0"
msgid "4th-make Cuchulainn"
msgstr "Кухулин IV легиона"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Cuchulainn der IV. Legion
#. fr: Cúchulainn de la 4e légion
#. column 0: 4th-make Cuchulainn
#. column 8: This former Zealot of the IVth Legion was reborn by the power of auracite in the likeness of Cuchulainn, the Impure of Ivalician legend. While he shares his name with a renowned voidsent, this is believed to be no more than coincidence.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:322:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 第IV軍団魔導僧兵大隊に所属する異端僧兵が、聖石片の力で変異した存在。その姿は、イヴァリース伝説に登場する不浄王キュクレインと酷似している。なお、同名の大妖異も同じ伝承にちなむが、この個体とは無縁の存在であろう。
#. de: Die Jünger, eine ketzerische Randgruppe der IV. Legion, haben ihr Leben riskiert und die Macht eines Auracitensplitters entfesselt. Ihre nunmehr verzerrten Gestalten ähneln sehr der des Königs Cuchulainn, dem Unreinen, einer Legende aus Ivalice. Aber abgesehen von den Äußerlichkeiten und dem Namen, teilen sie keine der Eigenschaften des gleichnamigen Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ten.
#. fr: Un prêtre magitek de la 4e légion a utilisé une auralithe sacrée et s'est sacrifié pour invoquer cette créature ressemblant étrangement à Cúchulainn, l'Impur. Bien qu'ils portent tous deux le même nom, lui et le démon venu du néant qu'on croise dans le folklore éorzéen n'ont absolument aucun lien.
#. column 0: 4th-make Cuchulainn
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:322:0:8"
msgid "This former Zealot of the IVth Legion was reborn by the power of auracite in the likeness of Cuchulainn, the Impure of Ivalician legend. While he shares his name with a renowned voidsent, this is believed to be no more than coincidence."
msgstr "Бывший фанатик IV легиона возродился благодаря силе святого камня в облике Кухулина Нечистого из ивалисских легенд. Его имя совпадает с именем прославленного демона, но это, как считается, всего лишь совпадение."

#. ja: Gウォリアー
#. de: G-Krieger
#. fr: Guerrier-G
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Originally created by the Allagans as a prototype for the Ultima Weapon, this warmachina was known as the Ultima Warrior before being restored and extensively modified by Garlond Ironworks. It was later called into action in the battle with the Sapphire Weapon, where its vast range of armaments were the deciding factor in overcoming its far larger opponent. Rumors suggesting the “G” stands for “gun” remain unverified, especially considering its weapon of choice is an aethersaber.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:323:0:0"
msgid "G-Warrior"
msgstr "G-воин"

#. ja: 0
#. de: G-Krieger
#. fr: Guerrier-G
#. column 0: G-Warrior
#. column 8: Originally created by the Allagans as a prototype for the Ultima Weapon, this warmachina was known as the Ultima Warrior before being restored and extensively modified by Garlond Ironworks. It was later called into action in the battle with the Sapphire Weapon, where its vast range of armaments were the deciding factor in overcoming its far larger opponent. Rumors suggesting the “G” stands for “gun” remain unverified, especially considering its weapon of choice is an aethersaber.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:323:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アラグ帝国が「究極兵器開発計画」の一環として開発した対蛮神兵器「アルテマウォリアー」をベースに、ガーロンド・アイアンワークス社が改修を加えた機体。ウェルリト強襲作戦において、解放者が搭乗、サファイアウェポンを撃破した。
#. de: Diese Kriegsmaschine wurde ursprünglich von den Allagern als Prototyp der Ultima-Waffe entwickelt und Ultima-Krieger genannt. Mitarbeiter der Gar<shy>lond-Me<shy>tall<shy>wer<shy>ke fanden das Relikt, restaurierten es und gaben ihm seinen neuen Namen. Kurz darauf kam der G-Krieger beim Kampf gegen die Saphir-Waffe zum Einsatz.
#. fr: L'Ultima-guerrier était une machine de guerre anti-Primordiaux, conçue par l'empire d'Allag dans le cadre de son programme de recherche et de développement d'armes ultimes. Des milliers d'années plus tard, les Forges de Garlond l'ont remodelé afin que <if $gn4>la Guerrière<else>le Guerrier</if> de la Lumière puisse en prendre le contrôle et affronter l'Arme Saphir... à armes égales<nbsp>!
#. column 0: G-Warrior
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:323:0:8"
msgid "Originally created by the Allagans as a prototype for the Ultima Weapon, this warmachina was known as the Ultima Warrior before being restored and extensively modified by Garlond Ironworks. It was later called into action in the battle with the Sapphire Weapon, where its vast range of armaments were the deciding factor in overcoming its far larger opponent. Rumors suggesting the “G” stands for “gun” remain unverified, especially considering its weapon of choice is an aethersaber."
msgstr "Эту боевую машину создали аллагане как прототип оружия «Ультима» и назвали воином Альтима. Позже её восстановили и основательно переделали в Гарлондских мастерских. В бою с Сапфировым оружием широкий арсенал G-воина сыграл решающую роль, позволив одолеть противника, намного превосходившего его размерами. По слухам, буква G означает «пушка», но подтверждений этому нет. Тем более что излюбленное оружие машины — эфирная сабля."

#. ja: ダイヤウェポン
#. de: Diamant-Waffe
#. fr: Arme Diamant
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The final entry in the VIIth Legion's Weapon series incorporated data collected by units that fought the Warrior of Light, and it was equipped with the newly developed Overmind system. Had the Garlean Empire succeeded in unleashing the Diamond Weapon's destructive capabilities upon Eorzea, the results would have been catastrophic.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:324:0:0"
msgid "Diamond Weapon"
msgstr "Оружие «Алмаз»"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Diamant-Waffe
#. fr: Arme Diamant
#. column 0: Diamond Weapon
#. column 8: The final entry in the VIIth Legion's Weapon series incorporated data collected by units that fought the Warrior of Light, and it was equipped with the newly developed Overmind system. Had the Garlean Empire succeeded in unleashing the Diamond Weapon's destructive capabilities upon Eorzea, the results would have been catastrophic.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:324:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 第VII軍団が開発した試作型魔導兵器。ウェポン計画最初の機体にして究極系とも呼べる機体。3機のウェポンが収集したデータを反映したことに加え、オーバーマインドシステムと呼ばれる新機軸の制御システムを搭載している。
#. de: Die Diamant-Waffe war das letzte Modell aus dem geheimen Waffenprojekt der Garlear. Sie verfügte über Kampfdaten der anderen Waffen aus den Kämpfen gegen den Krieger des Lichts und war mit dem experimentellen Seelenüberlagerungsmodus ausgestattet. Wäre die Entwicklung abgeschlossen worden, hätte die Waffe Tod und Vernichtung über Eorzea gebracht.
#. fr: Cette Arme est la plus puissante de toutes celles créées par la 7e légion. Non seulement ce nouveau modèle dispose de toutes les données de combat accumulées par les trois précédents, mais il inclut aussi un système de contrôle unique le rendant encore plus redoutable<nbsp>: le mode de superposition mentale.
#. column 0: Diamond Weapon
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:324:0:8"
msgid "The final entry in the VIIth Legion's Weapon series incorporated data collected by units that fought the Warrior of Light, and it was equipped with the newly developed Overmind system. Had the Garlean Empire succeeded in unleashing the Diamond Weapon's destructive capabilities upon Eorzea, the results would have been catastrophic."
msgstr "Последняя модель из серии оружия VII легиона вобрала данные, собранные машинами, сражавшимися с Воином Света, и была оснащена новейшей системой «Сверхразум». Если бы Гарлеанская империя успела обрушить на Эорзею разрушительную мощь оружия «Алмаз», последствия были бы катастрофическими."

#. ja: ディアブロ・アーマメント
#. de: Diablo-Armament
#. fr: batterie d'artillerie Diablo
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Hidden deep within the ruins below Zadnor, it was recently unearthed by Menenius of the IVth Imperial Legion. Evidence indicates that it is a voidsent which has undergone aetherochemical enhancement, in order to participate in the subjugation of the southern continent.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:325:0:0"
msgid "Diablo Armament"
msgstr "Орудие «Диабло»"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Diablo-Armaments
#. fr: batteries d'artilleries Diablo
#. column 0: Diablo Armament
#. column 8: Hidden deep within the ruins below Zadnor, it was recently unearthed by Menenius of the IVth Imperial Legion. Evidence indicates that it is a voidsent which has undergone aetherochemical enhancement, in order to participate in the subjugation of the southern continent.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:325:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: メネニウス率いる聖遺物探索隊が、ザトゥノル高原にて発掘した遺物。異界ヴォイドから召喚した高位貴族級の大妖異を、魔科学的に強化した存在のようだ。おそらく南方大陸攻略の切り札として、開発していた兵器と思われる。
#. de: Das Diablo-Armament ist ein von der IV. Legion in Zadnor ausgegrabenes Artefakt, das Tribunus Menenius zur Unterwerfung Bozjas zu nutzen gedachte. Die Waffe selbst ist tatsächlich ein hochrangiger Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>ter, der einst von den Allagern aus dem Nichts beschworen und durch Ätherochemie noch zusätzlich verstärkt wurde. Es wird vermutet, dass diese mobile Artillerie-Batterie eigens für die Invasion der Allager auf den Südkontinent Meracydia entwickelt wurde und Breschen in die feindlichen Schlachtreihen schlagen sollte.
#. fr: Les troupes de la 4e légion chargées de trouver des reliques sacrées en Zadnor ont déterré cet artefact allagois lors de leurs recherches. Leur commandant Menenius comptait s'en servir à son avantage afin d'écraser les résistants bozjiens. Diablo lui-même semble être un démon de haut rang dans la hiérarchie du néant. Les Allagois l'ont fait venir dans notre monde et ont usé de leur magismologie afin de le rendre encore plus puissant qu'il ne l'était déjà.
#. column 0: Diablo Armament
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:325:0:8"
msgid "Hidden deep within the ruins below Zadnor, it was recently unearthed by Menenius of the IVth Imperial Legion. Evidence indicates that it is a voidsent which has undergone aetherochemical enhancement, in order to participate in the subjugation of the southern continent."
msgstr "Недавно Менений из IV имперского легиона обнаружил это орудие глубоко под руинами Заднора. Судя по всему, это демон из другого мира, усиленный магико-эфирными технологиями для участия в покорении южного континента."

#. ja: ２Ｂ
#. de: 2B
#. fr: 2B
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Officially “YoRHa No.2 Type B,” this black-clothed android's resemblance to 2P is only superficial. In truth, the white-garbed androids and other machine lifeforms are her mortal enemies, the destruction of which she has gone to great lengths to pursue. Her apparently close bond with android 9S cannot but give rise to curiosity...
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:326:0:0"
msgid "2B"
msgstr "2B"

