#. ja: 「存分に、愉しかったか……？<br>……俺は…………」<br>友を求めた者：ゼノス・ガルヴァス
#. de: „Dein Leben ... war ein Wunder. So viel besser ... als meins. Ich ...“
#. fr: “As-tu pu mordre dans la vie à pleines dents<nbsp>?”
#. column 0: Zenos Galvus
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:346:0:8"
msgid "“Did you find...fulfillment?”"
msgstr "«Ты... нашёл то, ради чего стоило жить?»"

#. ja: ランパート
#. de: Schutzwall
#. fr: rempart
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Encountered in the undersea ruins of Alzadaal's Legacy, this floating construct seeks to discourage intruders by teleporting hostile ocean denizens into their midst. A product of Hannish alchemy and possessed of a glimmering crystal core, the rampart is more accurately classified as soulkin rather than forgekin.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:347:0:0"
msgid "Rampart"
msgstr "Оплот"

