#. column 8: Encountered in the undersea ruins of Alzadaal's Legacy, this floating construct seeks to discourage intruders by teleporting hostile ocean denizens into their midst. A product of Hannish alchemy and possessed of a glimmering crystal core, the rampart is more accurately classified as soulkin rather than forgekin.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:347:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アルザダール海底遺跡群で用いられていた自走式転移装置。サベネア式錬金術の産物であり、核に輝石が用いられるため機関綱でなく呪具綱に分類される。付近の生物を転移させ、けしかけることで侵入者撃退を行うようだ。
#. de: Dieses Konstrukt wacht in den Tiefen bei Alzadaals Vermächtnis und schreckt Eindringlinge ab, indem es gefährliche Meeresbewohner herbeiteleportiert. Ursprünglich ein Produkt der Alchemisten aus Radz-at-Han, schimmert in seinem Inneren ein Kristallkern. Das Konstrukt ist daher tatsächlich eher als Lebewesen, denn als Maschine zu klassifizieren.
#. fr: Cette con<shy>struc<shy>tion installée dans les profondeurs du legs d'Alzadaal sert à dissuader les intrus en y téléportant de dangereuses créatures marines. Fabriquée selon une recette d'alchimie thavnairoise, son noyau de cristal fait d'elle une créature vivante plutôt qu'une machine.
#. column 0: Rampart
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:347:0:8"
msgid "Encountered in the undersea ruins of Alzadaal's Legacy, this floating construct seeks to discourage intruders by teleporting hostile ocean denizens into their midst. A product of Hannish alchemy and possessed of a glimmering crystal core, the rampart is more accurately classified as soulkin rather than forgekin."
msgstr "Летающее устройство, встречающееся в подводных руинах Наследия Альзадааля. Оно отпугивает незваных гостей, телепортируя к ним агрессивных обитателей моря. Оплот создан по рецепту тавнаирских алхимиков, а сияющее кристаллическое ядро позволяет отнести его скорее к одушевлённым созданиям, чем к механизмам."

#. ja: ヒッポカート
#. de: Hippowagen
#. fr: hippochar
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Sturdy and reliable, the Hippo Riders' speedy carts will deliver anything to anywhere in two shakes of a hippo's tail. Gaze into their hippos' dark, watery eyes, and know that you're in good hands─and hooves! Offer includes a complimentary gulal shower, while supplies last. (This Triad card sponsored by: the Hippo Riders.)
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:348:0:0"
msgid "Hippo Cart"
msgstr "Повозка бегемотов"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Hippowagen
#. fr: hippochars
#. column 0: Hippo Cart
#. column 8: Sturdy and reliable, the Hippo Riders' speedy carts will deliver anything to anywhere in two shakes of a hippo's tail. Gaze into their hippos' dark, watery eyes, and know that you're in good hands─and hooves! Offer includes a complimentary gulal shower, while supplies last. (This Triad card sponsored by: the Hippo Riders.)
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:348:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 頼れるのは、やっぱりカバの手！　ヒッポライダーズの「ヒッポ便」なら、どんなに重い品物も、即座にお届け万事解決。あなたの大事なお荷物を、丁寧・丁重に運びます。今なら無料で色粉を浴びせる開運キャンペーンも実施中！
#. de: Angst um die teure Ware? Die Zeit drängt? Dann seid Ihr bei den Flusspferdkurieren von den Hipporasern™ genau richtig! Unsere tonzenschweren Fleischlawinen hält keiner auf! Lieferung garantiert! Sofort buchen und zur Eröffnungskampagne eine Gratisladung Farbpulver ins Gesicht abstauben!
#. fr: Rien de mieux que ces grosses pattes d'hippo pour transporter les plus lourds bagages avec rapidité<nbsp>! Les Hippotracteurs se chargent de vos livraisons en toute sécurité. En ce moment, profitez d'une offre limitée vous permettant de lancer du gulal gratuitement<nbsp>!
#. column 0: Hippo Cart
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:348:0:8"
msgid "Sturdy and reliable, the Hippo Riders' speedy carts will deliver anything to anywhere in two shakes of a hippo's tail. Gaze into their hippos' dark, watery eyes, and know that you're in good hands─and hooves! Offer includes a complimentary gulal shower, while supplies last. (This Triad card sponsored by: the Hippo Riders.)"
msgstr "Прочные и надёжные повозки «Наездников на бегемотах» доставят что угодно куда угодно — глазом моргнуть не успеете! Посмотрите в тёмные влажные глаза их бегемотов и знайте: вы в надёжных руках... то есть копытах! Пока товар не закончился, к заказу прилагается бесплатное обливание цветной пудрой. (Карта Тройной триады предоставлена «Наездниками на бегемотах».)"

#. ja: ガジャースラ
#. de: Gajasura
#. fr: Gajasura
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: This Matanga tribe was driven from its indigenous home of Thavnair when it refused to accept the peace made between the Arkasodara and newly immigrated Au Ra. Said to spread discord wherever they go, the Gajasura finally resettled on the Azim Steppe, where their loathing for the Au Ra festers to this day.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:349:0:0"
msgid "Gajasura"
msgstr "Гаджасура"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Gajasura
#. fr: Gajasuras
#. column 0: Gajasura
#. column 8: This Matanga tribe was driven from its indigenous home of Thavnair when it refused to accept the peace made between the Arkasodara and newly immigrated Au Ra. Said to spread discord wherever they go, the Gajasura finally resettled on the Azim Steppe, where their loathing for the Au Ra festers to this day.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:349:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: かつてサベネア島で暮らしていたマタンガ族の一派。アウラ族と手を結んだアルカソーダラ族に敗北して島を追われた後、大陸各地で問題を起こしながら、アウラ憎しの一念でアジムステップへとたどり着いたらしい。
#. de: Ein Stamm der Matanga, der einst in Thavnair heimisch war. Wurde gemeinsam vom Matanga-Stamm der Arkasodara und den Au Ra aus Thavnair vertrieben. Nachdem sie auf dem kontinentalen Festland in den ver<shy>schie<shy>den<shy>sten Regionen für Unruhe gesorgt hatten, ließen sie sich schließlich mit einem tief gehegten Hass auf Au Ra in der Azim-Steppe nieder.
#. fr: Les Gajasuras, qui appartiennent à la famille des Matangas, vivaient autrefois à Thavnair. Exclus après avoir perdu contre les Ao Ra et Arkasodaras, ils ont fini par élire domicile à la Steppe d'Azim, non pas sans avoir causé de nombreux problèmes sur leur route.
#. column 0: Gajasura
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:349:0:8"
msgid "This Matanga tribe was driven from its indigenous home of Thavnair when it refused to accept the peace made between the Arkasodara and newly immigrated Au Ra. Said to spread discord wherever they go, the Gajasura finally resettled on the Azim Steppe, where their loathing for the Au Ra festers to this day."
msgstr "Племя матанга, изгнанное с родных земель на Тавнаире за отказ принять мир между аркасодарами и прибывшими туда аура. Говорят, гаджасура несут раздор повсюду, куда бы ни пришли. В конце концов они осели в Степи Азим, где и по сей день пылает их ненависть к аура."

#. ja: ラールガー
#. de: Rhalgr
#. fr: Rhalgr
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Breaker of worlds and god of destruction, Rhalgr commands the power of lightning and is often depicted as a magus carrying a staff of bronze. The mighty physical form he takes in Aglaia is believed to reflect the visualizations of his most pious monks, the Fist of Rhalgr.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:350:0:0"
msgid "Rhalgr"
msgstr "Ралгр"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Rhalgr
#. fr: Rhalgr
#. column 0: Rhalgr
#. column 8: Breaker of worlds and god of destruction, Rhalgr commands the power of lightning and is often depicted as a magus carrying a staff of bronze. The mighty physical form he takes in Aglaia is believed to reflect the visualizations of his most pious monks, the Fist of Rhalgr.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:350:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 彗星と破壊を司る男神。雷属の神力を有しており、黄銅の杖を持った怜悧な魔法使いの姿で描かれることが多い。神域では筋骨隆々な姿を見せたが、これはラールガー星導教のモンクたちの信仰が影響したものと思われる。
#. de: Gott der Kometen und der Zerstörung sowie Schutzgott Ala Mhigos. Wird oft auch schlicht als „der Zerstörer“ bezeichnet. Künstler stellen ihn für gewöhnlich als Magier mit einem Messingstab dar. In Götterbildnissen erscheint er außerdem mit ausgesprochen bulliger Statur, was möglicherweise auf den Einfluss der Mönche vom Orden „Rhalgrs Faust“ zurückzuführen ist.
#. fr: Dieu de la destruction et seigneur des corps célestes, il est le protecteur de la cité d'Ala Mhigo. Il commande l'élément foudre et est communément représenté sous la forme d'un sorcier portant un bâton de cuivre à la main. Il est très souvent également dessiné arborant une musculature imposante, ce qui est peut-être dû à l'influence des moines du Poing de Rhalgr.
#. column 0: Rhalgr
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:350:0:8"
msgid "Breaker of worlds and god of destruction, Rhalgr commands the power of lightning and is often depicted as a magus carrying a staff of bronze. The mighty physical form he takes in Aglaia is believed to reflect the visualizations of his most pious monks, the Fist of Rhalgr."
msgstr "Разрушитель миров и бог разрушения. Ралгр повелевает молниями и обычно изображается мудрым магом с бронзовым посохом. В Аглае он предстаёт могучим воителем — таким его, видимо, представляют себе самые набожные монахи, Кулак Ралгра."

#. ja: アーゼマ
#. de: Azeyma
#. fr: Azeyma
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Keeper of the sun and goddess of inquiry, Azeyma is most often depicted as a beautiful noble lady holding a golden fan─and so does she appear in Aglaia. Though this manifestation welcomes curiosity as a patron of inquiry ought, she is also wont to test pilgrims with unbridled ferocity...
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:351:0:0"
msgid "Azeyma"
msgstr "Азима"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Azeyma
#. fr: Azeyma
#. column 0: Azeyma
#. column 8: Keeper of the sun and goddess of inquiry, Azeyma is most often depicted as a beautiful noble lady holding a golden fan─and so does she appear in Aglaia. Though this manifestation welcomes curiosity as a patron of inquiry ought, she is also wont to test pilgrims with unbridled ferocity...
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:351:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 太陽と審理を司る女神。黄金の扇を持つ豪快な貴婦人と描かれることが多く、神域では通説どおりの優美な姿を見せた。一方で猛々しい一面も披露しているが、これは審理を司る神性ゆえのこと。試練に対して厳格であったのだ。
#. de: Göttin der Sonne und des Rechts, der das Element des Feuers zu eigen ist. Wird von Künstlern in Eorzea oft als erhabene Dame dargestellt und fällt in Götterbildnissen durch Eleganz und Schönheit auf. Azeyma hat aber auch eine strenge Seite, nicht umsonst gilt sie als Göttin des Rechts, die unverrückbar und unvoreingenommen richtet.
#. fr: Déesse de la justice et gardienne du soleil. Elle commande l'élément feu, et elle est généralement représentée sous la forme d'une magnifique femme noble tenant à la main un éventail en or. Elle possède aussi un côté sévère, une qualité nécessaire à sa condition de déesse impartiale de la justice.
#. column 0: Azeyma
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:351:0:8"
msgid "Keeper of the sun and goddess of inquiry, Azeyma is most often depicted as a beautiful noble lady holding a golden fan─and so does she appear in Aglaia. Though this manifestation welcomes curiosity as a patron of inquiry ought, she is also wont to test pilgrims with unbridled ferocity..."
msgstr "Хранительница солнца и богиня правосудия, Азима обычно изображается прекрасной знатной дамой с золотым веером — такой она предстаёт и в Аглае. Она приветствует любознательность, как и подобает покровительнице познания, но при этом любит испытывать паломников с беспощадной яростью..."

#. ja: ナル
#. de: Nald
#. fr: Nald
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Overseer of the underworld, god of commerce, and guardian deity of Ul'dah, Nald is conventionally depicted alongside Thal as either his twin or a single god of dual aspect. In Aglaia, he appraises the value of pilgrims' souls as any good trader would.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:352:0:0"
msgid "Nald"
msgstr "Нальд"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Nald
#. fr: Nald
#. column 0: Nald
#. column 8: Overseer of the underworld, god of commerce, and guardian deity of Ul'dah, Nald is conventionally depicted alongside Thal as either his twin or a single god of dual aspect. In Aglaia, he appraises the value of pilgrims' souls as any good trader would.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:352:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 地底と商売を司る男神であり、ウルダハの守護神。火属の神力を有し、ザル神と合わせ二面性のある一柱の神とも、双子の神とも解釈される。神域においては、魂の裁定を行ってみせるなど、商神としての神性を強く発揮した。
#. de: Nald ist eines der zwei Gesichter der Gottheit des Handels und der Unterwelt und Schutzgott Ul'dahs. Sein Element ist das Feuer. Nach allgemeiner Auffassung sind Nald und Thal Zwillinge. Künstler stellen sie oft in Gestalt eines scharfsinnigen Kaufmanns mit einer Waage dar.
#. fr: Dieu du commerce et gardien des enfers, il est le protecteur de la cité d'Ul'dah et il commande l'élément feu. Avec son jumeau Thal, ils contemplent chacun l'un des deux aspects de l'existence. Il est communément représenté comme un marchand tenant à la main une balance.
#. column 0: Nald
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:352:0:8"
msgid "Overseer of the underworld, god of commerce, and guardian deity of Ul'dah, Nald is conventionally depicted alongside Thal as either his twin or a single god of dual aspect. In Aglaia, he appraises the value of pilgrims' souls as any good trader would."
msgstr "Нальд, владыка подземного мира, бог торговли и покровитель Ульды, обычно изображается вместе с Талом — то ли как его близнец, то ли как одна из двух ипостасей единого бога. В Аглае он оценивает души паломников, как и подобает настоящему торговцу."

#. ja: ザル
#. de: Thal
#. fr: Thal
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Thal is but one aspect of the Traders who govern the underworld and commercial affairs. According to the teachings of the Order of Nald'thal, Nald presides over the world of the living, and Thal, the halls of the dead─and indeed, the twins' seamless transformations in Aglaia are strikingly reminiscent of the cycle of death and rebirth presented in the Order's liturgies.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:353:0:0"
msgid "Thal"
msgstr "Тал"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Thal
#. fr: Thal
#. column 0: Thal
#. column 8: Thal is but one aspect of the Traders who govern the underworld and commercial affairs. According to the teachings of the Order of Nald'thal, Nald presides over the world of the living, and Thal, the halls of the dead─and indeed, the twins' seamless transformations in Aglaia are strikingly reminiscent of the cycle of death and rebirth presented in the Order's liturgies.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:353:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 地底と商売を司る男神。ナル・ザル教団の教えでは、ナル神は生者の世界を、ザル神は死者の世界を見守るという。神域において二柱の神が入れ替わりながら躍動するその姿は、同教団の「輪廻転生」の観念を想起させる。
#. de: Thal ist eines der zwei Gesichter der Gottheit des Handels und der Unterwelt und Schutzgott Ul'dahs. Sein Element ist das Feuer. In der Erzählung des Nald'thal-Ordens herrscht Nald über die Welt der Lebenden und Thal ist der Wächter über das Totenreich. Diese göttliche Dualität, der Wechsel zwischen Leben und Tod in Form der Reinkarnation, spielt in der Gedankenwelt des Nald'thal-Ordens eine wichtige Rolle.
#. fr: Dieu du commerce et gardien des enfers, il est le protecteur de la cité d'Ul'dah et il commande l'élément feu. Selon le culte de Nald'thal, Nald protège le monde des vivants et son jumeau Thal celui des morts. Ces deux déités incarnent ainsi le cycle de la réincarnation.
#. column 0: Thal
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:353:0:8"
msgid "Thal is but one aspect of the Traders who govern the underworld and commercial affairs. According to the teachings of the Order of Nald'thal, Nald presides over the world of the living, and Thal, the halls of the dead─and indeed, the twins' seamless transformations in Aglaia are strikingly reminiscent of the cycle of death and rebirth presented in the Order's liturgies."
msgstr "Тал — лишь один из ликов Налд'тал Торговцев, богов подземного мира и торговли. Согласно учению Приказа Налд'тал, Нальд властвует над миром живых, а Тал — над чертогами мёртвых. Их плавное преображение в Аглае поразительно напоминает круговорот смерти и возрождения, о котором говорится в литургии Приказа."

#. ja: カイ
#. de: Chi
#. fr: Khi
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A ruthless war machine developed on the Alphatron Star. Yet unsated after wreaking untold havoc across countless civilizations, it split from central command and independently sought out further targets. Although the key to the Omicrons' further development─and perhaps very survival─is thought to lie hidden within its memory, it is unclear what that might entail.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:354:0:0"
msgid "Chi"
msgstr "Ти"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Chi
#. fr: Khi
#. column 0: Chi
#. column 8: A ruthless war machine developed on the Alphatron Star. Yet unsated after wreaking untold havoc across countless civilizations, it split from central command and independently sought out further targets. Although the key to the Omicrons' further development─and perhaps very survival─is thought to lie hidden within its memory, it is unclear what that might entail.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:354:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: アルファトロン文明が生み出した侵略兵器。数多の生命を屠り数多の文明を滅ぼしたのちに暴走し、指揮系統を離れ単独で侵略対象を求めていた。そのメモリーにはオミクロン進化の鍵が秘められているとされるが、詳細は不明である。
#. de: Angriffswaffe vom Planeten Alphatron. Geriet nach der Eroberung und Auslöschung zahlloser Zivilisationen außer Kontrolle und wählt inzwischen eigenständig seine Angriffsziele, außerhalb seiner Programmparameter. In ihrem Speicher liegt angeblich der Schlüssel zur Evolution der Omikron, doch genaueres ist unbekannt.
#. fr: Unité d'invasion mise au point par les Omicrons de la planète Alphatron, elle est devenue in<shy>con<shy>trô<shy>la<shy>ble après la conquête et l'ané<shy>an<shy>tis<shy>se<shy>ment d'un nombre incalculable de civilisations et choisit désormais ses cibles de manière autonome, sans tenir compte des réglages de son programme. Sa mémoire contiendrait la clé de l'évolution des Omicrons, mais personne n'en connaît les détails.
#. column 0: Chi
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:354:0:8"
msgid "A ruthless war machine developed on the Alphatron Star. Yet unsated after wreaking untold havoc across countless civilizations, it split from central command and independently sought out further targets. Although the key to the Omicrons' further development─and perhaps very survival─is thought to lie hidden within its memory, it is unclear what that might entail."
msgstr "Безжалостная боевая машина, созданная на звезде Альфатрон. Истребив бесчисленные цивилизации, она всё ещё не насытилась разрушением, отделилась от центрального командования и отправилась искать новые цели. Считается, что в её памяти скрыт ключ к дальнейшему развитию омега-тронов — а возможно, и к самому их выживанию. Что это означает, пока неизвестно."

#. ja: ダイヴァディーパ
#. de: Daivadipa
#. fr: Daivadipa
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Seeking the wisdom of man, this bestial god exchanged one of his three snakelike heads with a Manusya's─or so the original legend goes. As the only Daivadipa manifestation known to living memory was encountered near the Tower of Zot, it is likely that it─much like the recently sighted Magus Sisters─was merely a primal of the malevolent tower's making rather than the true Mrga.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:355:0:0"
msgid "Daivadipa"
msgstr "Дайвадипа"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Daivadipa
#. fr: Daivadipa
#. column 0: Daivadipa
#. column 8: Seeking the wisdom of man, this bestial god exchanged one of his three snakelike heads with a Manusya's─or so the original legend goes. As the only Daivadipa manifestation known to living memory was encountered near the Tower of Zot, it is likely that it─much like the recently sighted Magus Sisters─was merely a primal of the malevolent tower's making rather than the true Mrga.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:355:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ゾットの塔から現れた異形の神。ムリガ神群の一柱で、元は三つ首の大蛇であったが、知恵を求めて中央の頭をマヌシャ神のそれにすげ替えたという神話が伝わる。おそらく、メーガス三姉妹同様、塔が偽造した蛮神なのであろう。
#. de: Eine todbringende Blasphemität aus dem Turm von Zot und ursprünglich eine der Mrga-Gottheiten. Der Legende nach eine dreiköpfige Riesenschlage, die auf der Suche nach Weisheit ihr mittleres Haupt gegen das eines Manusya tauschte. Gesichert ist, dass es sich um eine falsche Gottheit handelt, die genauso wie die Magus-Schwestern im Inneren des Turmes erschaffen wurde.
#. fr: Un Primordial apparu dans la tour de Zott, qui était à l'origine une divinité mrga. La légende voudrait que ce serpent géant à trois têtes, en quête de sagesse, ait échangé sa tête du milieu contre celle d'une divinité manusya. Cependant, il s'agit cer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment d'une fausse déité créée par la tour, tout comme les sœurs Magus.
#. column 0: Daivadipa
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:355:0:8"
msgid "Seeking the wisdom of man, this bestial god exchanged one of his three snakelike heads with a Manusya's─or so the original legend goes. As the only Daivadipa manifestation known to living memory was encountered near the Tower of Zot, it is likely that it─much like the recently sighted Magus Sisters─was merely a primal of the malevolent tower's making rather than the true Mrga."
msgstr "Согласно древней легенде, это божество-зверь обменяло одну из трёх змеиных голов на голову манушья, чтобы обрести мудрость. Поскольку в наше время Дайвадипу видели только возле Башни Зот, вероятнее всего, он, как и недавно замеченные сёстры Магус, был всего лишь праймалом, созданным злой башней, а не настоящим божеством мурга."

#. ja: 終焉を謳うもの
#. de: Endsängerin
#. fr: chantre de l'anéantissement
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Born of a multiplicity of messengers who sought hope amongst the stars, yet found naught but despair, the Endsinger long nested at the furthest edge of the heavens. Thence did she grant the universe one final song, lifted upon the winds of dynamis─the kindness of oblivion.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:356:0:0"
msgid "Endsinger"
msgstr "Певица Последнего Дня"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Endsängerin
#. fr: chantres de l'anéantissement
#. column 0: Endsinger
#. column 8: Born of a multiplicity of messengers who sought hope amongst the stars, yet found naught but despair, the Endsinger long nested at the furthest edge of the heavens. Thence did she grant the universe one final song, lifted upon the winds of dynamis─the kindness of oblivion.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:356:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 先行く星々の絶望を目の当たりにした星渡る鳥たちが、旅の果てに変異した存在。天の果てに巣を作った彼女たちは、せめてもの優しさとして星々に向けて謳った。想いが作用する力、デュナミスの風に乗せて、すべての終焉を――。
#. de: Das aus reinem Dynamis erschaffene Wesen Meteion flog von Stern zu Stern, auf der Suche nach dem Sinn des Lebens. Doch auf seinen Reisen fand es nichts als Tod und Verderben. Die Emotionen waren überwältigend. Aus dem Schmelztiegel der geballten Hoffnungs<shy>losig<shy>keit erhob sich  die Endsängerin. Am Rande des Universums, wo sie ihr Nest errichtet hatte, flogen ihre Schwestern nun aus, um das gnadenvolle Ende auch im letzten Winkel des Universums zu besingen.
#. fr: Météion a fusionné avec presque toutes ses sœurs afin d'incarner le désespoir qu'elles et les civilisations disparues ont enduré. La chantre de l'ané<shy>an<shy>tis<shy>se<shy>ment veut maintenant entamer la coda de son lamento millénaire, en insufflant ses tristes sentiments au dynamis afin d'offrir aux survivants d'Ætherys une mort rapide.
#. column 0: Endsinger
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:356:0:8"
msgid "Born of a multiplicity of messengers who sought hope amongst the stars, yet found naught but despair, the Endsinger long nested at the furthest edge of the heavens. Thence did she grant the universe one final song, lifted upon the winds of dynamis─the kindness of oblivion."
msgstr "Певица Последнего Дня родилась из множества вестниц, которые искали надежду среди звёзд, но нашли лишь отчаяние. Долгое время она гнездилась на краю небес, откуда подарила вселенной свою последнюю песнь, подхваченную ветрами динамиса, — милосердное забвение."

#. ja: 0
#. de: N-7000
#. fr: N-7000
#. column 0: N-7000
#. column 8: “This unit finds the furry life-form's suggestion...\<whirr>...difficult to process.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:357:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「ガガガ……毛むくじゃら有機生命体の提案は、<br>実に意味不明です」<br>オミクロン：N-7000
#. de: „\<klick> ... \<ratter> ... Vorschlag der haarigen organischen Lebensform ist<nbsp>... schwierig zu verarbeiten.„
#. fr: “Bip bip... Pshhh... Impossible de traiter la requête de la petite boule de poils pensante... Erreur... Erreur...”
#. column 0: N-7000
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:357:0:8"
msgid "“This unit finds the furry life-form's suggestion...\\<whirr>...difficult to process.”"
msgstr "«Этому устройству трудно обработать предложение пушистого органического существа... <i>Вж-ж-ж...</i>»"

#. ja: 覇道のゲーリュオン
#. de: Geryon der Gewaltsame
#. fr: Géryon le Dominateur
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Descended from a race used as forced labor in bygone Thanalan, Geryon roamed the Eorzean subterrane, driven by the ambition to found his own empire. Alas, he had the misfortune of running into a formidable adventurer in the Sil'dihn waterways, by whose hand his quest came to a premature end.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:358:0:0"
msgid "Geryon the Steer"
msgstr "Герион Укротитель"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Geryon der Gewaltsame
#. fr: Géryon le Dominateur
#. column 0: Geryon the Steer
#. column 8: Descended from a race used as forced labor in bygone Thanalan, Geryon roamed the Eorzean subterrane, driven by the ambition to found his own empire. Alas, he had the misfortune of running into a formidable adventurer in the Sil'dihn waterways, by whose hand his quest came to a premature end.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:358:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: かつてザナラーンで強制労働を強いられていた奴隷種族の末裔。いつか己の帝国を築くという野望を胸に地下世界を放浪していたが、シラディハ水道奥地で運悪く冒険者に遭遇。かくして彼の覇道はあえなく潰えたのである。
#. de: Als Nachkomme eines Volkes, welches einst in Thanalan als Sklaven Zwangsarbeit leisten musste, war Geryon besessen von seinem Ziel, ein eigenes Imperium zu errichten. Hierfür durchstreifte er seit jeher die Unterwelt, bis er eines unglücklichen Tages in den Tiefen der Unterstadt von Sil'dih auf einen Abenteurer stieß, welcher seine Pläne vereitelte.
#. fr: Descendant d'une lignée d'esclaves réduits au travail forcé dans le Thanalan. Arpentant le monde souterrain, il espérait un jour parvenir à fonder son propre empire. Sa vie bascula le jour où il eut le malheur de rencontrer un aventurier au fin fond des anciennes canalisations sildiennes, mettant son armée en déroute et un terme à ses rêves de grandeur.
#. column 0: Geryon the Steer
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:358:0:8"
msgid "Descended from a race used as forced labor in bygone Thanalan, Geryon roamed the Eorzean subterrane, driven by the ambition to found his own empire. Alas, he had the misfortune of running into a formidable adventurer in the Sil'dihn waterways, by whose hand his quest came to a premature end."
msgstr "Потомок племени, когда-то обращённого в рабство и принуждённого к тяжёлому труду в Таналане. Герион бродил по подземельям Эорзеи, мечтая основать собственную империю. Увы, в водных путях Силди он столкнулся с могучим искателем приключений, и его замыслам пришёл конец."

#. ja: シラディハ・グラディアトル
#. de: Gladiator von Sil'dih
#. fr: gladiateur sildien
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Discovered in the ruins of Sil'dih, this warrior statue bears a resemblance to the guardians of Azeyma's temple. The similarity may be attributed to the use of Belah'dian technology in their construction, though this particular unit appears to have been designed to excel at swordfighting.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:359:0:0"
msgid "Gladiator of Sil'dih"
msgstr "Гладиатор из Силди"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Gladiatoren von Sil'dih
#. fr: gladiateurs sildiens
#. column 0: Gladiator of Sil'dih
#. column 8: Discovered in the ruins of Sil'dih, this warrior statue bears a resemblance to the guardians of Azeyma's temple. The similarity may be attributed to the use of Belah'dian technology in their construction, though this particular unit appears to have been designed to excel at swordfighting.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:359:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: シラディハ時代の遺構で発見された古の闘士像。アーゼマ神殿の守護者と似た姿を有するのは、ベラフディア時代の技術を用いて造られたためであろう。ただし、用途は異なり、神殿の警護ではなく剣闘に用いられていたようだ。
#. de: Die Statue eines Kriegers, die in den antiken Sil'dih-Ruinen entdeckt wurde. Ihr Aussehen ähnelt den Wächtern von Azeymas Tempel, weshalb vermutet wird, dass sie mit belah'discher Technologie gefertigt wurde. Erbaut wurde diese Skulptur jedoch scheinbar nicht als Schutzmann, sondern als Schwertkämpfer.
#. fr: Ancienne statue guerrière découverte dans des ruines sildiennes. Sa ressemblance frappante avec les gardiens du sanctuaire d'Azeyma est cer<shy>tai<shy>ne<shy>ment due à l'utilisation de technologies belahdiennes. Mais les similitudes s'arrêtent ici, car son rôle était indubitablement de combattre plutôt que de protéger un temple.
#. column 0: Gladiator of Sil'dih
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:359:0:8"
msgid "Discovered in the ruins of Sil'dih, this warrior statue bears a resemblance to the guardians of Azeyma's temple. The similarity may be attributed to the use of Belah'dian technology in their construction, though this particular unit appears to have been designed to excel at swordfighting."
msgstr "Эту статую воина нашли среди руин Силди. Она похожа на стражей храма Азимы — вероятно, потому что при её создании использовали белахдийские технологии. Но, судя по всему, её предназначение было иным: она создана для боя на мечах."

#. ja: ソーン・マジックナイト
#. de: Ritter der Thorne
#. fr: chevalier-mage des Thorne
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: This arcane soldier was created during the Thorne Dynasty to combat the plague of undead. Of its four arms, two belonged to a fallen Amalj'aa warrior, which were incorporated to enhance its affinity with fire. Despite its mammet-like appearance, the use of thaumaturgy in its creation means it is more akin to a golem than a mechanical construct.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:360:0:0"
msgid "Thorne Knight"
msgstr "Рыцарь Торно"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Ritter der Thorne
#. fr: chevaliers-mages des Thorne
#. column 0: Thorne Knight
#. column 8: This arcane soldier was created during the Thorne Dynasty to combat the plague of undead. Of its four arms, two belonged to a fallen Amalj'aa warrior, which were incorporated to enhance its affinity with fire. Despite its mammet-like appearance, the use of thaumaturgy in its creation means it is more akin to a golem than a mechanical construct.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:360:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ソーン朝時代に、ゾンビー掃討目的で造られた魔法兵。火属性との親和性向上のため、死したアマルジャ族戦士の腕を融合している。なお、マメットと外見が似るが、より古い時代に呪術的に造られたもので、構造はゴーレムに近い。
#. de: Ein Soldat einer magischen Armee, erschaffen in der Thorne-Ära zur Ausrottung von Untoten. Um seine Feuer-Affinität zu erhöhen, wurde er mit den Armen eines verstorbenen Amalj'aa-Kriegers ausgestattet. Da er mithilfe von antiker schwarzer Magie erschaffen wurde, gleicht sein Aufbau eher dem eines Golems, auch wenn sein Aussehen mehr an eine Marionette erinnert.
#. fr: Soldat créé magiquement afin d'exterminer des zombis à l'époque de la dynastie des Thorne. Des bras de guerrier amalj'aa mort au combat lui ont été greffés pour augmenter son affinité élémentaire au feu. Il peut être pris pour un simple pantin à première vue, mais les techniques d'occultisme ancestrales utilisées pour le créer le rapprochent plus d'un golem.
#. column 0: Thorne Knight
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:360:0:8"
msgid "This arcane soldier was created during the Thorne Dynasty to combat the plague of undead. Of its four arms, two belonged to a fallen Amalj'aa warrior, which were incorporated to enhance its affinity with fire. Despite its mammet-like appearance, the use of thaumaturgy in its creation means it is more akin to a golem than a mechanical construct."
msgstr "Этого магического воина создали во времена династии Торно, чтобы бороться с нашествием нежити. Две из его четырёх рук принадлежали павшему воину амалджаа — их добавили, чтобы усилить его связь с огнём. На вид он напоминает марионетку, но создан с помощью магии и ближе к голему, чем к механизму."

#. ja: ベアトリーチェ
#. de: Beatrice
#. fr: Béatrice
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: An entity encountered in the Thirteenth, this high-ranking voidsent was mistress of a domain built on the memories of a once-existing castle. She is said to have led the cabal of eight priestesses who governed Troia, a nation since lost to the Darkness.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:361:0:0"
msgid "Beatrice"
msgstr "Беатриче"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Beatrice
#. fr: Béatrice
#. column 0: Beatrice
#. column 8: An entity encountered in the Thirteenth, this high-ranking voidsent was mistress of a domain built on the memories of a once-existing castle. She is said to have led the cabal of eight priestesses who governed Troia, a nation since lost to the Darkness.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:361:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 第十三世界にて遭遇した上級妖異。ある妖異が証言したところによれば、元はトロイアと呼ばれる国を統治していた8人の神官の筆頭であったらしく、当時の城を模した領域を作り、城主として君臨していた。
#. de: Eine hochrangige Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>te aus der dreizehnten Splitter<shy>welt, deren Revier auf den Erinnerungen einer einst existierenden Burg errichtet wurde. Sie soll einen Kreis von acht Priesterinnen angeführt haben, die Troia regierten<nbsp>- eine Nation, die seitdem an die Dunkelheit verloren gegangen ist.
#. fr: Une créature du néant de haut rang, rencontrée dans le treizième reflet. D'après l'une de ses congénères, elle était jadis à la tête du groupe de huit primiciers régnant sur l'ancienne nation de Troïa. Son repaire est d'ailleurs une reproduction d'un château de cette époque.
#. column 0: Beatrice
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:361:0:8"
msgid "An entity encountered in the Thirteenth, this high-ranking voidsent was mistress of a domain built on the memories of a once-existing castle. She is said to have led the cabal of eight priestesses who governed Troia, a nation since lost to the Darkness."
msgstr "Это высокоранговое порождение пустоты встретили в Тринадцатом мире. Она владела владением, воссозданным по воспоминаниям о замке, существовавшем когда-то. Говорят, она возглавляла совет из восьми жриц, правивших Троей — государством, давно поглощённым Тьмой."

#. ja: ビエルゴ
#. de: Byregot
#. fr: Byregot
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The god of architecture and industry, Byregot commands the element of lightning, and is most often depicted as an ardent smith wielding a two-headed hammer. The muscular form he takes in Aglaia is a testament to faith in physical strength, a conviction common amongst the builders and laborers who worship him.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:362:0:0"
msgid "Byregot"
msgstr "Бьрегот"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Byregot
#. fr: Byregot
#. column 0: Byregot
#. column 8: The god of architecture and industry, Byregot commands the element of lightning, and is most often depicted as an ardent smith wielding a two-headed hammer. The muscular form he takes in Aglaia is a testament to faith in physical strength, a conviction common amongst the builders and laborers who worship him.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:362:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 建築と工芸を司る男神。雷属の神力を有し、双頭の鉄槌を持つ誠実な鍛冶の姿で描かれることが多い。神域では筋骨隆々の大男として顕現したが、これは建築業や製造業に携わる信者の多くが「筋肉の力」を信仰していることの証左とも言えようか。
#. de: Gott der Bauwerke und der Handwerker. Sein Element ist der Blitz. Nach allgemeiner Auffassung ist er Thaliaks Schüler und Halones älterer Bruder. Künstler stellen ihn als aufrichtigen Schmied mit großem, doppelköpfigem Eisenhammer dar.
#. fr: Dieu de l'architecture et de l'artisanat, il commande l'élément foudre et est généralement représenté sous la forme d'un forgeron passionné brandissant un marteau à deux têtes. Au domaine divin, il est apparu sous la forme d'une véritable montagne de muscles, preuve que la plupart des bâtisseurs et artisans qui croient en lui jurent es<shy>sen<shy>tiel<shy>le<shy>ment par la force physique.
#. column 0: Byregot
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:362:0:8"
msgid "The god of architecture and industry, Byregot commands the element of lightning, and is most often depicted as an ardent smith wielding a two-headed hammer. The muscular form he takes in Aglaia is a testament to faith in physical strength, a conviction common amongst the builders and laborers who worship him."
msgstr "Бьрегот — бог архитектуры и ремёсел, повелевающий молниями. Обычно его изображают пылким кузнецом с двуглавым молотом. В Аглае он явился могучим силачом — быть может, потому, что его почитатели, строители и рабочие, верят в силу мышц."

#. ja: 影火のゼレズ・ガー
#. de: Zeless Gah
#. fr: Zeless Gah
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: An Amalj'aa warrior who died some two hundred thirty years ago. Skilled at warding magicks wielded by him alone, he voluntarily joined Ul'dah's efforts to purge the undead. Unfortunately, he was wounded in the course of protecting an ally, and subsequently turned into the very thing that he had sought to vanquish.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:363:0:0"
msgid "Shadowcaster Zeless Gah"
msgstr "Заклинатель теней Зелесс Га"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Zeless Gah
#. fr: Zeless Gah
#. column 0: Shadowcaster Zeless Gah
#. column 8: An Amalj'aa warrior who died some two hundred thirty years ago. Skilled at warding magicks wielded by him alone, he voluntarily joined Ul'dah's efforts to purge the undead. Unfortunately, he was wounded in the course of protecting an ally, and subsequently turned into the very thing that he had sought to vanquish.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:363:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 約230年前に死したアマルジャ族の勇士。独自の結界術を得意とし、ゾンビー掃討には自ら名乗り出てウルダハへの救援に赴いた。しかし、友軍兵をかばった際に負った傷が原因で、自らもゾンビーと化してしまったようだ。
#. de: Ein Held der Amalj'aa, der vor etwa 230 Jahren starb. Er hatte eine eigene Barrieretechnik entwickelt und sich freiwillig gemeldet, um sich gegen die Untoten zu stellen und an Ul'dahs Seite zu kämpfen. Doch die Wunden, die er erlitt, als er seine Gefährten beschützte, machten ihn selbst zum Zombie.
#. fr: Héros amalj'aa mort il y a environ 230 ans. Connu pour ses techniques de barrières magiques apprises en autodidacte, il ne reculait devant aucun combat pour protéger Ul'dah de la menace des zombis. Mal<shy>heu<shy>reu<shy>se<shy>ment, il semblerait qu'il fut blessé en cherchant à protéger l'un de ses compagnons soldats, rejoignant à son tour les rangs des morts-vivants.
#. column 0: Shadowcaster Zeless Gah
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:363:0:8"
msgid "An Amalj'aa warrior who died some two hundred thirty years ago. Skilled at warding magicks wielded by him alone, he voluntarily joined Ul'dah's efforts to purge the undead. Unfortunately, he was wounded in the course of protecting an ally, and subsequently turned into the very thing that he had sought to vanquish."
msgstr "Воин амалджаа, погибший около двухсот тридцати лет назад. Он владел особыми защитными чарами и добровольно присоединился к борьбе Ульды с нежитью. Но, прикрывая союзника, получил ранение и в итоге сам стал тем, кого пытался уничтожить."

#. ja: スカルミリョーネ
#. de: Scarmiglione
#. fr: Scarmiglione
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The archfiend of earth, and one of Golbez's circle of four. Scarmiglione consumed voidsent with gluttonous abandon, the conflicting energies giving rise to his hideous and misshapen appearance. Possessed of incredible regenerative properties, his deathless form seemed beyond defeat until Zero finally bound him in crystal.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:364:0:0"
msgid "Scarmiglione"
msgstr "Скармильоне"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Scarmiglione
#. fr: Scarmiglione
#. column 0: Scarmiglione
#. column 8: The archfiend of earth, and one of Golbez's circle of four. Scarmiglione consumed voidsent with gluttonous abandon, the conflicting energies giving rise to his hideous and misshapen appearance. Possessed of incredible regenerative properties, his deathless form seemed beyond defeat until Zero finally bound him in crystal.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:364:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ゴルベーザ四天王の一角たる土の大妖異。数多の妖異を貪欲に喰らったゆえか肉体の変異が進んでおり、醜悪な外見を有している。高い再生能力とガスを武器に冒険者らを苦しめたが、ゼロによってメモリアに封印された。
#. de: Elementarfürst der Erde und einer von Golbez' vier Vertrauten. Scarmiglione verzehrte Nichts<shy>gesand<shy>te mit gefräßiger Hingabe, deren Energie zu seiner abscheulichen und missgestalteten Erscheinung führten. Er besitzt unglaubliche regenerative Eigenschaften und schien unsterblich, bis Zero ihn schließlich in einen Kristall bannte.
#. fr: L'un des quatre généraux de Golbez, aussi appelé le “maître de la terre”. À force de dévorer d'autres créatures du néant, il a subi de nombreuses mutations lui donnant une apparence repoussante. Sa capacité de régénération ex<shy>traor<shy>di<shy>nai<shy>re et ses gaz toxiques donnèrent du fil à retordre <if $gn4>à la Guerrière<else>au Guerrier</if> de la Lumière, et c'est finalement Zero qui l'enferma dans un mémoria.
#. column 0: Scarmiglione
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:364:0:8"
msgid "The archfiend of earth, and one of Golbez's circle of four. Scarmiglione consumed voidsent with gluttonous abandon, the conflicting energies giving rise to his hideous and misshapen appearance. Possessed of incredible regenerative properties, his deathless form seemed beyond defeat until Zero finally bound him in crystal."
msgstr "Демон земли, один из четырёх приближённых Голбеза. Скармильоне с жадностью пожирал порождения пустоты, и их противоречивая энергия исказила его тело до неузнаваемости. Благодаря невероятной способности к регенерации он казался неуязвимым, пока Зеро не заточила его в кристалл."

#. ja: バルバリシア
#. de: Barbarizia
#. fr: Barbariccia
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: The archfiend of wind and one of Golbez's circle of four, Barbariccia was obsessively proud of her flowing locks. Whether serving as weapons or armor, the enchanted strands of hair obeyed her every thought, and she employed them in battle with fierce aggression─a temperament which has endured since her mortal days.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:365:0:0"
msgid "Barbariccia"
msgstr "Барбаричча"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Barbarizia
#. fr: Barbariccia
#. column 0: Barbariccia
#. column 8: The archfiend of wind and one of Golbez's circle of four, Barbariccia was obsessively proud of her flowing locks. Whether serving as weapons or armor, the enchanted strands of hair obeyed her every thought, and she employed them in battle with fierce aggression─a temperament which has endured since her mortal days.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:365:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: ゴルベーザ四天王の一角たる風の大妖異。魔力を通した髪を自在に操り武器とするほか、装具として身に纏うことで力を高めることができる。その際、口調が一変するが、これは彼女が人であった頃の出来事に由来するようだ。
#. de: Elementarfürstin des Windes und eine von Golbez' vier Vertrauten. Sie liebte ihre wallenden Locken, die ihr als Waffe und Rüstung dienten und jedem ihrer Gedanken gehorchten. Selten sah man Haare mit so viel Temperament.
#. fr: L'un des quatre généraux de Golbez, aussi appelée la “maîtresse du vent”. Elle peut manipuler à sa guise sa chevelure imprégnée d'éther, et s'en sert ainsi comme d'une arme ou d'une armure décuplant sa force. Dans ce dernier cas, son langage devient brusquement fleuri, un tic qui serait lié à un événement survenu durant sa vie d'humaine.
#. column 0: Barbariccia
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:365:0:8"
msgid "The archfiend of wind and one of Golbez's circle of four, Barbariccia was obsessively proud of her flowing locks. Whether serving as weapons or armor, the enchanted strands of hair obeyed her every thought, and she employed them in battle with fierce aggression─a temperament which has endured since her mortal days."
msgstr "Демон ветра, одна из четырёх приближённых Голбеза. Барбаричча была безумно горда своими роскошными волосами. Пропитанные магией пряди служили ей и оружием, и доспехом, повинуясь одной лишь мысли. В бою она с яростью пускала их в ход — такой же свирепой она была и при жизни."

#. ja: ラハブレア
#. de: Leiter Lahabrea
#. fr: Lahabrea (passé)
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: “...His words were but the ramblings of a tortured mind. The hatred and despair he endures has warped his view of the world irreparably.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:366:0:0"
msgid "Chief Keyward Lahabrea"
msgstr "Главный хранитель ключей Лахабрея"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Leiter Lahabrea
#. fr: Lahabrea (passé)
#. column 0: Chief Keyward Lahabrea
#. column 8: “...His words were but the ramblings of a tortured mind. The hatred and despair he endures has warped his view of the world irreparably.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:366:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「……奴の言葉など、すべて妄言だ。<br>負の感情に支配され、とうの昔に正気を失っているだろうからな。<br>その行動も、たんなる衝動にすぎぬよ」<br>十四人委員会：創造者の座ラハブレア
#. de: „Er hat nichts als Wahnsinn in seinen Augen. Der Hass und die Ver<shy>zweif<shy>lung haben ihn um den Verstand gebracht.“
#. fr: “... Tous les propos que peut tenir Héphaïstos relèvent de la fabulation. Il faut comprendre qu'il n'a plus toute sa tête depuis bien longtemps, la faute aux sentiments négatifs qui le rongent. De même, ses actes sont par<shy>fai<shy>te<shy>ment irréfléchis.”
#. column 0: Chief Keyward Lahabrea
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:366:0:8"
msgid "“...His words were but the ramblings of a tortured mind. The hatred and despair he endures has warped his view of the world irreparably.”"
msgstr "«...Его слова — бред терзаемого разума. Ненависть и отчаяние, что он испытывает, безвозвратно исказили его взгляд на мир»."

#. ja: ヘファイストス
#. de: Hephaistos
#. fr: Héphaïstos
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Born from dark shades of Lahabrea's emotions and memory, Hephaistos was a mirror that the chief keyward could not bear to look upon. Although sealed away in Pandæmonium's deepest circle, he was liberated by an unknown force, and devoted himself to seeing Athena resurrected. By fusing his being with mythic creations, Hephaistos unlocked the hidden secrets of creation magicks, and his hands could mold the very concept of life itself.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:367:0:0"
msgid "Hephaistos"
msgstr "Гефест"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Hephaistos
#. fr: Héphaïstos
#. column 0: Hephaistos
#. column 8: Born from dark shades of Lahabrea's emotions and memory, Hephaistos was a mirror that the chief keyward could not bear to look upon. Although sealed away in Pandæmonium's deepest circle, he was liberated by an unknown force, and devoted himself to seeing Athena resurrected. By fusing his being with mythic creations, Hephaistos unlocked the hidden secrets of creation magicks, and his hands could mold the very concept of life itself.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:367:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 記憶と感情の分離によって生じた、ラハブレアの半身とも言える存在。何者かに封印を解かれたのち、妻アテナの復活を目指してパンデモニウムを掌握した。半神化によって創造魔法の真理を解し、一時的に生物の概念そのものを操る権能を得たようだ。
#. de: Eine Existenz, die den abgetrennten Erinnerungen Lahabreas entstieg. Einmal entsiegelt nahm er das Pandæmonium in Besitz, um seine Frau Athena wiederauferstehen zu lassen. Ihm gelang das Undenkbare, indem er das Wissen zur Schaffung von Halbgöttern enträtselte.
#. fr: Le double maléfique de Lahabrea, né de ses sentiments et souvenirs dissociés. Autrefois emprisonné, il s'est libéré par un moyen inconnu, et a pris le contrôle du Pandæmonium dans le but de ressusciter Athéna, l'ancienne épouse de son “modèle”. Transformé en hémithéos, il devient une sorte de demi-dieu créateur capable de manipuler les concepts à la base de toute vie.
#. column 0: Hephaistos
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:367:0:8"
msgid "Born from dark shades of Lahabrea's emotions and memory, Hephaistos was a mirror that the chief keyward could not bear to look upon. Although sealed away in Pandæmonium's deepest circle, he was liberated by an unknown force, and devoted himself to seeing Athena resurrected. By fusing his being with mythic creations, Hephaistos unlocked the hidden secrets of creation magicks, and his hands could mold the very concept of life itself."
msgstr "Гефест родился из тёмных воспоминаний и чувств Лахабреи и стал зеркалом, в которое главный хранитель ключей не мог смотреть. Запечатанный в глубочайшем круге Пандемониума, он был освобождён неизвестной силой и посвятил себя воскрешению Афины. Слившись с мифическими созданиями, Гефест раскрыл тайны магии творения и обрёл способность лепить саму идею жизни."

#. ja: からくり陰陽師＆からくり用心棒
#. de: Mechanik-Onmyoji & -Yojinbo
#. fr: prêtre onmyo mécanique & garde du corps mécanique
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: These clockwork contraptions were manufactured to satisfy a commission from the Eorzean Alliance, which had shown an interest in using Far Eastern automata in its training exercises. The Hingan artisans who designed them included inbuilt protection against reverse engineering, rigging them to explode if their cores were exposed without the proper administrative permissions.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:368:0:0"
msgid "Clockwork Onmyoji & Clockwork Yojimbo"
msgstr "Механический оммёдзи и механический Ёдзимбо"

#. ja: 0
#. de: Mechanik-Onmyoji & -Yojinbo
#. fr: prêtres onmyo mécaniques & gardes du corps mécaniques
