msgid "“Why not a place where people can <i>live</i> on their own terms?”"
msgstr "«Почему бы не создать место, где люди смогут <i>жить</i> по своим правилам?»"

#. ja: ペルペル
#. de: Pelupelu
#. fr: Pelupelu
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Known first and foremost as peddlers, this people of small stature hail from the mountainous region of Urqopacha. They can be seen traveling with their trusty alpacas across the length and breadth of Tural, their characteristic beak-like masks designed to resemble the legendary tural vidraal, Valigarmanda.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:406:0:0"
msgid "Pelupelu"
msgstr "Пелупелу"

