#. ja: トクローネ
#. de: Ttokrrone
#. fr: Ttokrrone
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: A tural vidraal whispered of in tones of dread, the “Serpentlord” has crushed entire villages beneath its scaled bulk, and even humbled a seasoned viper intent on taking its head. Named in the Hhetsarro tongue, it is the dweller beneath the shifting sands and the swallower of rroneek.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:432:0:0"
msgid "Ttokrrone"
msgstr "Ттокррон"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Ttokrrone
#. column 0: Ttokrrone
#. column 8: A tural vidraal whispered of in tones of dread, the “Serpentlord” has crushed entire villages beneath its scaled bulk, and even humbled a seasoned viper intent on taking its head. Named in the Hhetsarro tongue, it is the dweller beneath the shifting sands and the swallower of rroneek.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:432:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 蛇王と畏れられるトラルヴィドラール。過去にいくつもの村を壊滅させ、討伐に赴いた手練れのヴァイパーさえも退けてきた。その名は、ヘイザ・アロ族の言葉で「砂を纏い、ロネークを呑むもの」を意味するという。
#. de: Ein Tural Vidraal, der auch als „der Schlangenkönig“ bekannt ist. In der Ver<shy>gangen<shy>heit sind unter seinem Joch zahlreiche Dörfer zerstört und selbst erfahrene Vipern besiegt worden. In der Sprache der Hhetsarro bedeutet sein Name so viel wie „der, der in Sand gehüllt, Rroneek verschlingt“.
#. fr: Ttokrrone est un Tural vidraal surnommé “le roi des serpents”. Il a détruit de nombreux villages et a même triomphé des rôdeurs vipère les plus aguerris qui tentaient de le dompter. En langue hhetsarro, son nom signifierait “celui couvert de sable qui engloutit des rroneeks”.
#. column 0: Ttokrrone
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:432:0:8"
msgid "A tural vidraal whispered of in tones of dread, the “Serpentlord” has crushed entire villages beneath its scaled bulk, and even humbled a seasoned viper intent on taking its head. Named in the Hhetsarro tongue, it is the dweller beneath the shifting sands and the swallower of rroneek."
msgstr "Туральский видрааль, внушающий ужас одним своим именем, Владыка Змей. Его чешуйчатая туша уничтожила целые деревни, а однажды он одолел даже опытного вайпера, пришедшего с ним сразиться. На языке хетсарро его имя означает «обитатель зыбучих песков, пожиратель рронеков»."

#. ja: マイカ・ザ・ムー
#. de: Mica das Magische Mu
#. fr: Mica le mu
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: This mascot of Living Memory was created for the purpose of bringing smiles as brilliant as the mica for which it was named. Due to a lack of regular maintenance, however, its programmed behavior has become increasingly erratic.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:433:0:0"
msgid "Mica the Magical Mu"
msgstr "Мика — волшебный му"

#. ja: 0
#. de: NONE
#. fr: Mica le mu
#. column 0: Mica the Magical Mu
#. column 8: This mascot of Living Memory was created for the purpose of bringing smiles as brilliant as the mica for which it was named. Due to a lack of regular maintenance, however, its programmed behavior has become increasingly erratic.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:433:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 娯楽施設リビング・メモリーのマスコットキャラクター。モデルは「ムー」という小動物。雲母のような煌めく笑顔をもたらす存在として創られたが、メンテナンスを受けてこなかったためか動作に狂いが生じているようだ。
#. de: Das einem Mu nachempfundene Maskottchen der Lebenden Erinnerung. Eigentlich ist es zu dem Zweck geschaffen worden, funkelndem Glimmer gleichendes Lächeln auf die Gesichter aller Besucher zu zaubern, doch nach Jahren ohne eine ordentliche Wartung scheinen sich zahlreiche Fehlfunktionen in seine Verhaltensweise eingeschlichen zu haben<nbsp>...
#. fr: Ayant pour modèle une espèce de petits animaux mignons tout plein, Mica le mu est la mascotte de La Mémoire vivante. Il était censé arborer un sourire aussi brillant que le mica, mais il semblerait que le manque d'hygiène dentaire l'ait rendu com<shy>plè<shy>te<shy>ment hors de contrôle.
#. column 0: Mica the Magical Mu
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:433:0:8"
msgid "This mascot of Living Memory was created for the purpose of bringing smiles as brilliant as the mica for which it was named. Due to a lack of regular maintenance, however, its programmed behavior has become increasingly erratic."
msgstr "Этот талисман Живой памяти создали, чтобы дарить людям улыбки, сияющие, как слюда, в честь которой он назван. Но без регулярного обслуживания его запрограммированное поведение стало всё более непредсказуемым."

#. ja: Prishe of the Distant Chains
#. de: Prishe
#. fr: Prishe of the Distant Chains
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: This echo was fashioned from the memories of Prishe, a young girl of Vana'diel. Her powers of recollection have been warped that she might better serve her creator's purpose, which in turn has resulted in an appearance not entirely matching that of her original form.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:434:0:0"
msgid "Prishe of the Distant Chains"
msgstr "Прише из Дальних цепей"

