#. ja: 「いつもゴールドソーサーのご利用、ありがとうございます。<br>私は、従業員のオリアーと申します」<br>マンダヴィル・ゴールドソーサー 従業員：オリアー
#. de: „Ich heiße dich ganz herzlich im Manderville Gold Saucer willkommen. Wie kann ich dir zu Diensten sein?“
#. fr: “Merci de votre fidélité envers le Gold Saucer, aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if><nbsp>! Permettez-moi de me présenter<nbsp>: Ollier, pour vous servir<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Ollier
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:437:0:8"
msgid "“Allow me to bid you a warm welcome to the Manderville Gold Saucer. How might I be of service?”"
msgstr "«Рад приветствовать вас в „Золотом блюдце“ Мандервилей. Чем могу быть полезен?»"

#. ja: ゼレニア
#. de: Zelenia
#. fr: Zelenia
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: Drawing on Sphene's memory data, this mechanical construct was designed to emulate the combat skills of the valiant Zelenia─second-in-command of the royal knights of Alexandria. Zelenia contributed greatly to the defense of the kingdom during the Storm Surge conflict, and was said to display an unrivaled resolve when it came to protecting those under her charge.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:438:0:0"
msgid "Zelenia"
msgstr "Зеления"

