#. de: NONE
#. fr: Krile (Dawntrail)
#. column 0: Dawntrail Krile
#. column 8: “So please, be at peace. Be at peace, Mother, Father.”
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:454:0:2"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. ja: 「あなたたちが私を護ってくれたから、<br>私は今……幸せに生きています！」<br>暁の血盟：クルル・マイア・バルデシオン
#. de: „Nur weil ihr mich so tapfer beschützt habt, lebe ich jetzt ein Leben voller Freude und Glück!“
#. fr: “Car si je suis en vie et heureuse aujourd'hui, c'est grâce à vous<nbsp>!”
#. column 0: Dawntrail Krile
#. column 2: 0
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:454:0:8"
msgid "“So please, be at peace. Be at peace, Mother, Father.”"
msgstr "«Так что прошу вас, не тревожьтесь. Не тревожьтесь, мама, папа»."

#. ja: サンダーグリフォン
#. de: Donnergreif
#. fr: griffon de foudre
#. column 2: 0
#. column 8: An apex predator in the Ninth, this winged beast terrorizes the lands near Treno, swooping down from great heights to seize large prey. Folk who venture outside the barrier must remain on watch for the creature, which soars the levin-wracked skies unperturbed due to its ability to manipulate lightning.
msgctxt "TripleTriadCard:455:0:0"
msgid "Thundergust Griffin"
msgstr "Грифон грозового ветра"

